window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 You’re Right, She Knows Zhong Yiliu","paragraphs":["1601 You’re Right, She Knows Zhong Yiliu","She went up and flipped through the pages.","She was right. The MV went online yesterday.","The popularity was a little high.","Qiao Nian took a look at the trending searches. There were one or two more trending searches that day.","!!","She skimmed through it but didn’t click on it. Then, she went back and logged on to QQ and downloaded the variety program Wen Ruxia had sent her.","Next, she put the phone back in her pocket, propped her arm on the side of the window, and said, “Let’s go back to Rhine.”","*","Beijing Hotel.","Qi Rongguang was already as anxious as an ant on a hot pan. He paced around and said, “Our people haven’t found Lanyin yet, and Mas has no way of locating her. Lanyin has been missing for almost eight days. We can’t just sit here and wait.”","“Then what do you want to do?” Qi Yan was very tired. In just a few days, she had aged a lot, and she looked like she had lost most of her energy.","Qi Rongguang had just arrived in Beijing yesterday. He had probably heard about the situation from her. He asked her anxiously, “Has no one from the Jiang family contacted you yet?”","“Who do you think will contact me?” Qi Yan stared at him, then shifted her gaze away angrily. Holding her breath, she said, “Jiang Zongnan won’t agree to help no matter what. Jiang Yao won’t say a word, either. The Jiang family’s mother and daughter are very willing to help us. However, I heard that Qiao Nian has already gone to warn them and even ruined Jiang Xianrou’s chance to go to the Independent Continent. If Jiang Xianrou can’t go to the Independent Continent, how much do you think she’ll be willing to help us?”","Qi Yan saw through him and said coldly, “Jiang Xianrou is someone who won’t act unless she sees success. She won’t help us unless she sees benefits.”","Qi Rongguang was stunned by her words. After recovering from his shock, he frowned and looked at her. “Why would Qiao Nian ruin Jiang Xianrou’s chance to go to the Independent Continent? You have such a good relationship with the Pharmacy Association. Does she know Zhong Yiliu?”","“Huh.” Qi Yan picked up the tequila on the table and finished it in one gulp, then put it down and looked at him. “You’re right. She knows Zhong Yiliu.”","Qi Rongguang was stunned.","Qi Yan’s face was ashen. She was no longer afraid of losing face and said bluntly, “I met her when I accompanied the Jiang family’s mother and daughter to the Pharmacy Association to report. At that time, she was by Dean Zhong’s side. Dean Zhong’s personal disciple even said that she was Dean Zhong’s friend. However, at that time, I didn’t think of investigating her relationship with the Pharmacy Association. I was distracted by other matters and forgot to investigate.","“...I called Jiang Xianrou again this morning. She said that she couldn’t go to the Independent Continent. Qiao Nian interfered and ruined her chance. Only then did I remember this.”","Qi Yan took a deep breath and looked at the middle-aged man, who was stunned by the series of events. She said tiredly, “Brother, under these circumstances, Qiao Nian’s relationship with the Pharmacy Association is not ordinary. Her relationship with Dean Zhong is definitely not inferior to mine.”","She was slurring her words.","In fact, she knew very well that her relationship with Zhong Yiliu was just an ordinary one.","Zhong Yiliu owed her a favor when he moved the Pharmacy Association to Country M. It was just a favor.","Qiao Nian was different.","From Zhong Yiliu’s attitude towards Qiao Nian then, and the respect that his personal disciple, Robert, showed her, she should have understood that Qiao Nian’s status in the Pharmacy Association was extraordinary."]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 Face Slapping, We’re Removed From the List","paragraphs":["1602 Face Slapping, We’re Removed From the List","As for how unusual, she had already sent someone to find out, but there were no results yet.","Her people in Country M had only found out that Qiao Nian wasn’t on the Pharmacy Association’s list. In other words, Qiao Nian wasn’t a member.","However, with just one sentence from Qiao Nian, Zhong Yiliu, who had always ignored everyone, actually canceled Jiang Xianrou’s spot in the Independent Continent. What did this mean? It meant that... Qiao Nian’s connections in the Pharmacy Association were much stronger than hers!","At the very least, she did not have the power to change the Pharmacy Association’s decision.","“Then, what should we do now? Lanyin is still in their hands. I’m worried about her safety.” Qi Rongguang paced around anxiously and stopped. He frowned and looked at her. “Do you want to go to the Jiang family again? Try to talk to Jiang Zongnan and the others.”","“It’s useless.”","Qi Yan felt a headache coming on when she saw him walking in front of her. How could she not be frustrated? “Do you think I’m not worried about Lanyin’s safety? If I wasn’t worried about her safety, I wouldn’t have smashed my phone here! Hacker Alliance, Security Bureau... Other than the Red Alliance, I’ve found all the connections I can. Others have tried their best to help us, but no one can decipher Qiao Nian’s signal jammer system. If they can’t find Lanyin’s location, what can I do? Can I rush to Qiao Nian and ask her to hand her over?”","Of course, she wanted to do that.","After all, she had done a lot of bullying over the years!","She had always been domineering in her way of doing things, the kind that did not care about anything. She wouldn’t consider so much. If she could use power to pressure, she would directly use power to pressure.","But this time, she was no match for the other party!","“Brother, don’t forget. Beijing is the Ye family’s territory.","“Qiao Nian is very close to that person from the Ye family. They live together. What do you want me to do? We haven’t moved yet, but they might have already brought us in.” Qi Yan suppressed her voice. Her words were frightening, but they weren’t entirely alarmist.","Qi Rongguang wasn’t stupid. He could tell that Qi Yan was not scaring him.","He was just about to be exhausted by all kinds of things, so he couldn’t help but complain, “You shouldn’t have attacked Jiang Li without discussing it with me first. You shouldn’t have used Lanyin’s account to do this. If you had told me from the beginning, perhaps these things wouldn’t have happened...”","Qi Yan looked at him expressionlessly. “I did this for the Qi family’s sake! I just wanted to invite her over for tea, but she found someone to stop me and bump into you. If I don’t act tough, where will our family’s face go? How are we going to survive outside in the future? How will others look at us?”","Qi Rongguang also said angrily, “Does it matter how others think of us? It’s better for us to be a laughingstock than to have our family destroyed! The Qi family can’t last much longer, and I can’t hold on much longer either. Our family is about to go bankrupt.”","Qi Yan took a deep breath, her temples throbbing, then said, “Don’t worry. The Qi family won’t collapse so easily as long as I’m around.”","She received a call from Country M as soon as she finished speaking.","Qi Yan picked it up. She tried her best to suppress her anger and said calmly, “Hello.”","The person on the other end of the line was her trusted aide in Country M. At this moment, he called out to her in an extremely flustered tone, “Madam, bad news. The royal family suddenly announced that they want to streamline the members. We’ve been excluded from the list announced by the royal family!”"]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 Qi Yan, Why Do You Look So Bad?","paragraphs":["1603 Qi Yan, Why Do You Look So Bad?","“What did you say?!” Qi Yan stood up immediately. She was so strong that she almost overturned the cup in front of her.","Her eyelids twitched as she walked to the side and lowered her voice. “Don’t be anxious. Tell me what’s going on!”","“The royal family suddenly announced that they wanted to streamline the members at this week’s event. We didn’t take it to heart at first. After all, we were third in line. Even if the royal family wanted to streamline the members, it wouldn’t affect you, Madam. We let down our guard and didn’t tell you. Who knew...”","Qi Yan’s hand trembled as she held the phone. She forced herself to remain calm. “Continue.”","“Who knew that your name was not on the list that was released today, my lady. Even, even... the crown prince’s name was not on it.”","This time, Qi Yan’s face was as pale as paper. She staggered and lost her balance. Fortunately, she held onto the sofa in time. Otherwise, she might have fallen to the ground and become a joke.","But even after she regained her balance, she still found it difficult to speak. “You said that my husband’s name isn’t on the royal list, either?”","“Yes, Madam.”","Seeing her extremely pale face, Qi Rongguang couldn’t help but ask with concern, “What happened?”","“I...” Qi Yan looked at him, her pupils trembling violently. She opened her mouth, wanting to say a thousand words to him, but her throat seemed to be stuck and she couldn’t say a word. The walls of her throat were about to burst into flames.","Qi Rongguang saw that she was in a daze and couldn’t be bothered to blame her for being arbitrary for touching Jiang Li without informing him and implicating Qi Lanyin.","He walked forward and patted her shoulder with concern. “Qi Yan, what happened? Why do you look so pale? Are you alright?”","Qi Yan’s eyes turned hot and she almost couldn’t hold it in.","However, she grabbed the phone tightly and avoided him. “Brother, I’ll talk to you later.”","Then, she pursed her lips and said to the person on the other end of the line with a dark expression, “We’re the third heir of the royal family. How could they not discuss such a big matter with us in advance? Go and find out what’s going on!”","She was still calm and collected. Before she hung up, she instructed, “Wait. Don’t ask the royal family about it. Don’t we have the media that we know? They have a lot of channels and connections. The royal family must be tight-lipped now. You won’t get anything out of them. Look for the media. They might know something.”","“Alright,” her trusted aide said cautiously. “Don’t worry, Madam. I’ll get right on it.”","“Mm.”","Qi Yan hung up and called her husband immediately.","Her first call went unanswered.","No one answered on the second ring.","Qi Yan couldn’t care less. She kept calling until the other party picked up.","Finally, it didn’t ring anymore.","Instead, the other party switched off the phone.","Qi Yan’s graceful face turned pale as she held her phone for a long time.","Her mind was wandering when her phone dinged, and she immediately grabbed it.","[I’m in the royal family’s room. I asked. My grandmother and the others said that you offended someone. Qi Yan, who did you offend?]","It was a message from her husband, the third-in-line crown prince of Country M.","The man’s text message seemed calm and composed.","However, Qi Yan could feel that the other party was almost unable to maintain his composure."]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 Madam, The Remaining 700 Million Has Been Transferred Into Miss Qiao’s Account","paragraphs":["1604 Madam, The Remaining 700 Million Has Been Transferred Into Miss Qiao’s Account","“What’s wrong?” Qi Rongguang leaned over and vaguely saw the caller ID on Qi Yan’s phone. Still not knowing what had happened, he asked her in confusion, “Brother-in-law sent the message? What did he say? By the way, didn’t you ask him to help find Lanyin? Does Brother-in-law have Lanyin’s whereabouts?”","Qi Yan took a deep breath, but she was still distraught and couldn’t calm down at all.","She could only shake her head and deny it irritably. “It has nothing to do with that.”","Qi Rongguang focused on Qi Lanyin and the Qi family. Seeing that she was being vague, he became even more anxious. “You’re still hiding everything from me at a time like this! You have to tell me what happened so that I can help you. If you don’t say anything, I can only wait by the side.”","“You can’t help me with this.” Qi Yan looked him in the eye. Endless regret surged in her heart. She gritted her teeth and quickly walked past her brother to the sofa. She bent down and picked up her handbag. Without bothering to tidy herself up, she picked up her bag and said, “Brother, I’m going out for a while. Stay here and wait for my news.”","“Qi Yan!” Qi Rongguang was really angry this time.","However, Qi Yan left without looking back. Before leaving, she paused and said without looking back, “Stay here and don’t go anywhere. Wait for me to come back from the hotel. I’ll go look for Qiao Nian. If I can succeed, the Qi family’s crisis can still be resolved. If not...”","Qi Rongguang’s heart skipped a beat.","“Then the Qi family is finished this time.”","After Qi Yan finished speaking, she did not say anything else and closed the door behind her.","*","On the road outside Rhine Apartments.","Qi Yan didn’t dare to wait in the car. She stood under the camphor tree downstairs.","From time to time, passersby would pass by on the sidewalk. When they saw her dressed up, they could not help but glance in her direction.","Qi Yan couldn’t care less.","She was wearing a pair of stiletto heels and had been standing there for a good two hours.","At this moment, she was numb from her ankle to her calf. Blisters had even formed where her shoes rubbed against her feet. Every minute she stood here was undoubtedly a form of torture, but Qi Yan couldn’t care less. She stood upright with her handbag and waited quietly for someone to come out.","Other than pedestrians on the road, there was no one she was waiting for.","The driver couldn’t stand it.","He walked over and advised her in a low voice, “Madam, I don’t think the person you’re waiting for has come out yet. Why don’t you get in the car to wait?”","“No, I’m staying right here.” Qi Yan was concise.","Her phone rang at this moment.","Qi Yan immediately picked up the call. “Hello?”","“Madam, we have wired the remaining seven hundred million into the account you mentioned as per your instructions. Do you have any other instructions?”","Qiao Nian had asked for a billion yuan. At first, Qi Yan had only given her 300 million yuan. She had been unwilling to give the remaining 700 million yuan.","Now she had to deliver it personally.","This humiliation was practically slapping her in the face!","Qi Yan’s lips twitched bitterly. “Instructions? What other instructions can I have? That’s all for now. I’ll tell you if there’s anything else.”","The Qi family couldn’t treat one billion yuan as a small sum. With this, their family could be considered to have injured a major artery.","Even if they could successfully survive this crisis, the Qi family would never be able to recover its former glory.","They could only tuck their tails between their legs in the future."]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 Master Wang, What a Dog!","paragraphs":["1605 Master Wang, What a Dog!","After hanging up, she frowned as she sent a message to a phone number with the code J.","She had been trying to reach her for the past few days.","After all, if it weren’t for the other party’s request, she wouldn’t have come to the country, let alone become Jiang Xianrou’s stepping stone. She even handed over the position of the Pharmacy Association to Jiang Xianrou.","It was because they were related to Jiang Xianrou that the Qi family fell deeper and deeper!","She was as anxious as she could be. She regretted bringing the Qi family into an even deeper quagmire in order to pull them out of it!","The other party had never told her before that Qiao Nian wasn’t to be trifled with.","She already found it incredulous that the high school student from Rao City was Sun from the Red Alliance.","Although the Red Alliance was powerful, it was only powerful in the hacking field. After all, it was only an underground organization and not as powerful as the royal family.","But reality slapped her hard.","She was caught off guard now, and it had something to do with the fact that the other party had not made things clear to her back then.","If she had known that Qiao Nian was not to be trifled with, she would rather the Qi family go bankrupt than have her family destroyed!","Qi Yan sent several messages, but they were like stones thrown into the ocean.","The other party had no intention of replying to her message at all.","Qi Yan was so angry that her face twisted. She was so angry that she wanted to call her.","It was just that her rationality overcame her impulse.","And she did not dare.","If Qiao Nian wasn’t to be trifled with, then the person who had helped the Qi family back then was even more so. The Qi family could no longer afford to be tormented. If she angered the other party again, the Qi family would only suffer an even worse fate!","Qi Yan calmed down. Her temples were throbbing. She finally suppressed her urge and put down her cell phone with a cold expression.","Inside the apartment.","Qin Si had come over to play today and insisted on dragging Qiao Nian along to play games. He had even called a few of his friends in the group chat to form a five-row convoy.","“F*ck, f*ck him!”","“Sister Qiao, left, left.”","“To the right!”","“Awesome.”","Ye Wangchuan could only hear him shouting in the living room. Given Qin Si’s agitated expression, he didn’t look like he was playing games at all. He was even more uptight than when he took the college entrance examination back then.","“Sister Qiao, your gun is really good. It’s a godly sniper rifle.","“That dog Zhang Yang keeps saying that he can’t carry me every day. As expected, he’s the one who can’t do it and insists on blaming me for tricking him. Haha, I’ll take a screenshot of our battle results and let him take a good look to see if I can carry him!”","Qin Si was in high spirits. He surrounded the girl and chatted non-stop with her. From time to time, he would even put his hand on Qiao Nian’s shoulder.","Qiao Nian seemed to be used to interacting with him. She had her legs crossed the entire time, looking extremely lazy.","Qin Si started another game and pulled her in.","Ye Wangchuan casually took a photo of him and sent it to the person whose contact was saved as ‘Aunt Qin’ on his cell phone. He calmly complained below.","[Qin Si is playing games again.]","Less than five minutes later.","A call came in.","Qin Si was about to start another game when he was suddenly interrupted. He had the toothpick from his mouth and cursed. “Who is it? Why is she calling at this time? I...”","He broke out in a cold sweat when he saw who was calling. He stood up and said to the girl opposite him in embarrassment, “Ahem, it’s my mother. Sister Qiao, you play first. I’ll go take this call.”","He hurried off to answer it as he spoke.","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her pale wrist and lowered her eyes. She decided to play with her cell phone."]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 Sister Nian: I’m Going Out","paragraphs":["1606 Sister Nian: I’m Going Out","Gu San made two cups of coffee and placed one in front of Qiao Nian and one in front of Qin Si. Seeing that Qin Si’s seat was empty, he asked curiously, “Miss Qiao, where’s Young Master Qin? Why did he disappear? Did he go back?”","“No.” Qiao Nian didn’t like coffee. She could drink it, but she didn’t really like it. Thus, she did not touch it as she replied lazily, “He went out to answer a call. I think it was his mother.”","“Mrs. Qin.” Gu San revealed an indescribable expression.","Qiao Nian accidentally caught sight of the expression on his face. She raised her eyebrows, intrigued. “Is his mother very strict with him?”","Qin Si was the same age as Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan had long been left alone. He could do whatever he wanted all day long. It seemed like even Aunt Lan couldn’t control him.","Qin Si... He seemed quite afraid of his mother.","“I don’t think so.” Gu San didn’t know how to tell her. The main reason was that it would ruin his image. However, on second thought, Young Master Qin did not seem to have any image, so he didn’t have any psychological burden. He said smoothly, “Young Master Qin likes to play games too much. Mrs. Qin thinks that if he continues like this, he will spend all his time playing games at home and not go out. Therefore, Mrs. Qin is quite strict with Young Master Qin when it comes to playing games... It’s not that Mrs. Qin doesn’t want him to play games, but she’s afraid that he... knows nothing but that, and wouldn’t even go out for a walk to get to know more people.”","Gu San didn’t continue.","Actually, there was another reason.","In the past, Master Wang and the others got along well. The elders felt that with Master Wang leading the way, it would be easier for Young Master Qin, Young Master Bo, and the others to find a partner than Master Wang.","Who knew that the one who was the most difficult to find a partner would be the first to get attached?","The remaining two stood out.","Old Master Ye and First Miss even liked to show off their granddaughter-in-law and niece-in-law respectively in the circle. After a while, Young Master Qin and the others were in a miserable state.","“Oh.” Qiao Nian had thought that it was a strange reason, but she didn’t expect it to be because she was afraid of Qin Si becoming a homebody. She nodded with a knowing expression.","Gu San glanced at her and wanted to say, “Miss Qiao, you don’t understand!”","However, he hesitated and was too embarrassed to say it too clearly.","Qin Si returned at this moment. He picked up his jacket from the chair angrily and said to Qiao Nian, “Sister Qiao, I’m going back. I won’t be playing today. I’ll ask you out for a party another day.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian had just heard Gu San explain the reason. She agreed readily. “Sure.”","It wasn’t easy for Qin Si to find a god to carry him in the game, but before he could be happy, his mother called him back for a blind date. A fire lit up in his heart and he complained angrily, “I wonder who betrayed me and told my mother that I was playing games. Tsk, I’ll break his legs when I find out who he is.”","After saying that, he waved at the man on the couch and said, “Master Wang, I’ll leave first.”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and glanced at him with his deep black eyes. He nodded and said, “Go ahead. Let Gu San send you.”","Gu San immediately went up to get the car keys. “Young Master Qin, I’ll drive you home.”","Qin Si drove over and did not let anyone send him off. He waved and left in a hurry. “No, thanks. I have my own car. I’ll leave first.”","“Bye.”","Qin Si was quite reluctant, but his mother was anxious. He could only go back and deal with the elders first.","After he left, Qiao Nian’s cell phone vibrated.","She picked up the phone and squinted at it.","It was a bank transfer record.","The Qi family’s 700 million yuan had already been transferred into her account.","Qiao Nian stood up, casually picked up her baseball cap, and put it on her head. Then, she picked up her phone and said, “I’m going out for a while.”"]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 No Need, Just Say It Here","paragraphs":["1607 No Need, Just Say It Here","Qi Yan waited outside for more than three hours before the person she had been waiting for finally came down.","“Miss Qiao.”","This time, she did not dare to put on any airs. Her posture was very humble. As soon as she saw Qiao Nian, she immediately waved at her.","Qiao Nian glanced at her lazily and walked towards her unhurriedly.","!!","The chauffeur sized up the girl walking over.","She held the blue shirt rather casually in her hand. The white T-shirt matched her jeans. Her calves were taut, shapely, and long. She wore a pair of black canvas shoes.","From the outside, the other party was young and looked like a student.","The girl was wearing a baseball cap, so he couldn’t see her face clearly. He only felt that this girl’s aura was quite extraordinary.","This was the person Madam had been waiting for?","Qi Yan’s chauffeur looked incredulous. However, he wasn’t qualified to comment, so he stood at the side obediently.","“Miss Qiao.” Qi Yan didn’t look well. She looked much older, and her eyes were full of fatigue. Her smile looked very forced, but she didn’t dare to show any dissatisfaction in front of Qiao Nian. Even if she couldn’t smile, she forced herself to smile. She looked at the girl and said, “I’ve already gotten someone to transfer the money. Did you receive it?”","“Got it.” Qiao Nian walked up to her and stood still.","Qi Yan smiled ingratiatingly. “That’s good.”","Her heart was racing. She couldn’t understand how Qiao Nian could make the royal family of Country M so afraid that they wanted to kick her out of the royal list.","She couldn’t figure out Qiao Nian’s background and felt even more uneasy. She could only pretend to be calm and break the awkward atmosphere. She took a deep breath and composed herself. “Miss Qiao, let’s grab a drink at a place nearby. Are you free? If it’s convenient, why don’t we talk there?”","She didn’t have such an attitude before. Qiao Nian remembered very clearly that when Qi Yan first came to the country, she looked down at people with her nose held high.","Qi Yan had never even taken Jiang Xianrou seriously.","Now she seemed to have learned a lot.","Still...","The girl raised her thin white wrist and reached out to pull down her cap. She said coldly, “No need. If you have anything to say, just say it here.”","“Here?”","Qi Yan’s temples throbbed.","From time to time, pedestrians would walk over. She had never talked to anyone in such an environment.","For a moment, she almost wanted to leave. However, Qi Yan forced herself to stand rooted to the ground when she thought of the Qi family and her husband who was waiting for her explanation. She said with a complicated expression, “I-I’m here to look for Miss Qiao. Miss Qiao should know very well, so I won’t beat around the bush. Miss Qiao, I just want to ask you what would it take for you to forgive the Qi family’s rash behavior this time?”","Forgive the Qi family?","Rash behavior?","Qiao Nian was irritated by her words. She narrowed her eyes. Perhaps she felt that Qi Yan’s words were ridiculous. Qiao Nian raised her hand and stuffed it into her pocket. The corners of her lips curled up, and her eyes were cold and dry. “Isn’t this Qi Lanyin’s doing? What has it got to do with the Qi family?”","Qi Yan’s face was green and red. She knew that Qiao Nian was slapping her in the face, but there was nothing she could do. Her throat was dry as she said, “Miss Qiao, we’re all smart people. I know that you already know the truth behind this incident.”"]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 Still Trying to Play Dumb","paragraphs":["1608 Still Trying to Play Dumb","Qiao Nian said lazily, “Oh, what’s the truth behind it?”","Qi Yan was speechless.","When had she ever suffered such humiliation!","Qi Yan’s eyelids twitched.","However, she still understood the principle that one had to bow their head under the eaves.","She gritted her teeth and forced herself to force a smile. “Lanyin doesn’t know anything about Young Master Jiang.","“I was the one who arranged what happened with Young Master Jiang from the beginning to the end. I only used her account to transfer the money in the end.”","At that time, she had also considered Qi Lanyin’s age and the Qi family’s overseas influence. She thought that even if Qiao Nian found out about it, she wouldn’t be able to do anything to an overseas student like Lanyin.","Who knew that Qiao Nian would be so ruthless?","She could even find someone to take Qi Lanyin away from Country M.","Qi Yan was forced into a corner. She couldn’t care less about her face and said in a low voice, “I’ve already learned that I’m no longer a member of the royal family. I’ll also transfer all the money you asked me to prepare into your account according to your request... Miss Qiao, forgive me wherever possible. I’ve already paid the price. Can you be magnanimous and let the Qi family off?”","Qiao Nian glanced at her and smiled. “Qi Yan, did you forget something else?”","Qi Yan looked, not knowing what she was talking about.","Qiao Nian helped her recall. “You only admitted about my brother’s fall. Have you forgotten my car accident?”","Qi Yan’s expression suddenly changed, and her eyes flickered violently. She pretended to be surprised. “Miss Qiao was in a car accident before? Are you alright?”","Qiao Nian looked at her with a faint smile.","Those eyes seemed to see through her panic.","Qi Yan’s heart skipped a beat.","She forced herself to be calm and refused to admit it. “I’ve only been in Beijing for a short time. I’ve been staying in Continent O and don’t know much about domestic affairs. I’ve never heard that you were in a car accident...”","Qi Yan was still pretending. “Was this car accident a plot or...?”","Qiao Nian admired her a little. The corners of her lips curled up, her eyes mocking and cold. “A plot. What a coincidence. The results of my investigation traced back to your Qi family again.”","There was some silence.","Qi Yan’s scalp went numb and she couldn’t say a word.","She had miscalculated Qiao Nian’s accident. She had instructed that fool Madam Zhu to do it. In order to avenge her son, that fool was instigated to get someone to give Qiao Nian a scare. That fool had even taken the blame for her.","It led her to think that the car accident was over.","She hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to find out about it.","No matter how knowledgeable Qi Yan was and how calm she was, she didn’t know how to deal with the current situation. “This matter... i-is...”","She couldn’t come up with a reason after ‘is’.","“This matter is a misunderstanding.”","Qi Yan tried her best to calm herself down, but her fingernails were about to break. “You know about the incident in the illegal district... I-I definitely felt uncomfortable, but I didn’t expect Madam Zhu to be so bold.”","“Qi Yan, you didn’t expect me to escape so safely, right?”","Qiao Nian interrupted her. She was willing to come down to see Qi Yan because she wanted her to die knowing what she did wrong. This way, she wouldn’t have to look for connections all day long and find Jiang Xianrou and Jiang Zongnan or harass Jiang Li or even Old Master Jiang.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have come down to meet Qi Yan.","Qiao Nian had always kept a straight face, but now, her eyes were filled with anger. “You didn’t expect me to escape, so you’re thinking of dealing with my brother. Qi Yan, what are you trying to do? Are you using my brother to warn me?”"]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 The Qi Family Is Completely Gone!","paragraphs":["1609 The Qi Family Is Completely Gone!","Qi Yan’s face was pale, and her pupils trembled violently. She could already feel that the negotiation was about to collapse.","“Heh, I received your warning.” Qiao Nian smiled and continued nonchalantly, “That’s why I’m returning the warning to you. I’ve decided to go against the Qi family, and that’s that!”","“Qiao Nian, I’ve asked around. Young Master Jiang’s life isn’t in danger. There’s still room for negotiation...” Qi Yan’s hands trembled, and her mind was tense. Her bright eyes looked hopefully at the girl, wanting to make a final struggle.","Qiao Nian laughed.","Yes, Jiang Li’s life was not in danger this time. That was because he was lucky and reacted quickly!","If he had reacted half a beat slower and his head had hit the ground first, would Qi Yan still be able to stand in front of her and say that ‘there’s still room for negotiation’?","Her eyes were cold and dry as she stared straight at Qi Yan’s face. She said, “Now that the Qi family still has a chance of survival, I will definitely make the Qi family disappear overseas if you say another word to me! Including you! Qi Yan.”","Qi Yan’s mind went blank. She opened her mouth and wanted to say something, but in her shock, she couldn’t make a sound.","Qiao Nian could do it!","She could definitely do it.","She clenched her fists tightly and watched helplessly as the girl she had waited for for three hours only saw her for five minutes before turning around and walking back.","The chauffeur was also stunned by Qiao Nian’s aura. It took him a long time to regain his senses. The fear and shock from before still lingered in his eyes. He trembled as he spoke to Qi Yan. “Madam, you’re letting her go just like that?”","Qi Yan’s calves almost collapsed. Her legs went limp and she almost sat on the ground.","She smiled bitterly when she heard this. As she watched Qiao Nian leave, she felt as though she had lost her advantage.","“If I don’t let her go, what else can I do?”","“But...” The chauffeur was tempted to say that it had cost them 700 million yuan to get her out to meet them, and they had only talked for five minutes.","Five minutes. 700 million yuan?","What an astronomical figure for a conversation.","Qi Yan’s mind was buzzing. Her legs were weak as she walked back. She opened the car door with trembling hands. “Didn’t you hear what she said? If I had said anything else just now, the Qi family would have been finished.”","She left the rest unsaid.","Though the Qi family was no different from being finished now!","The chauffeur fell silent.","Qi Yan didn’t want to chat with him.","Just then, her cell phone rang.","Qi Yan took out her cell phone from her bag and looked down.","It was Qi Rongguang.","She didn’t answer the call for a long time. Only when the call was about to end did Qi Yan come back to her senses and slowly answered it.","“Hello, Brother.”","“Have you seen Qiao Nian? What did she say?” Qi Rongguang sounded anxious and angry. It was obvious that he had been waiting for news from her.","At this moment, Qi Yan revealed an expression that was uglier than crying. She finally couldn’t take it anymore and grabbed the car door tightly, her nails turning white. “S-Sorry, Brother.”","There was some silence.","Qi Yan’s mind was filled with regret, but there was no medicine for regret in this world. She trembled and said, “The Qi family... The Qi family is finished.”","Qi Rongguang was speechless for a long time.","He didn’t know what to say.","A large and powerful family had been destroyed in their generation in the blink of an eye.","He put the cell phone down silently and slumped on the couch in his hotel suite, staring out at the scenery for a long time."]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 Master Wang: What Did You Tell Her?","paragraphs":["1610 Master Wang: What Did You Tell Her?","On the other side, Qiao Nian had already returned to the apartment.","Gu San went out to send Qin Si off and had yet to return.","Ye Wangchuan was the only one home.","After Qiao Nian returned.","!!","The man on the sofa got up and came over. He brought her a pair of slippers and handed them over. “Back so soon?”","Qiao Nian changed into her shoes and walked in. She looked lazy and didn’t hide it from him. “I went downstairs to see Qi Yan. I have nothing to say to her, so there’s no need to waste time.”","She walked to the fridge and opened the door. She took out a bottle of ice water and unscrewed the cap. Her black bangs fell over her eyebrows. The girl’s eyes were lowered, and Ye Wangchuan couldn’t tell what she was thinking. However, he knew that Qiao Nian was in a bad mood.","He walked over and snatched the ice water from the girl’s hand. He poured her a fresh cup and handed it over. “Your period’s coming. Drink something hot before you get another stomachache.”","Qiao Nian was a Traditional Chinese Medicine practitioner herself, but she needed to take medicine to treat her period pain.","Qiao Nian was too lazy. Putting aside the fact that she had to brew medicine for herself every month and nurse herself back to health for two to three years, she had completely cured this old illness.","Even if someone else helped her brew the medicine, she might not be able to drink it on time.","After all, she was busy all day long. Once she got busy, she would even forget to eat, not to mention take some herbal medicine.","Hence, every month, Qiao Nian would have a stomachache for half a day after her period. During that half a day, she basically had to rely on eating medicine to resolve it.","However, the effects of the drug were limited. Even though Qiao Nian had taken painkillers, she couldn’t do anything for a long time. She could only lie on the sofa and wait.","The iced water was taken away, and the man stuffed a cup of warm water into her hand. Qiao Nian was stunned for a moment, but after that, she didn’t say anything. She obediently held the mug and lowered her head to take a sip of water.","Drinking hot water in this season was undoubtedly a form of mental and physical torture. After drinking it, Qiao Nian’s bad temper decreased significantly.","Hugging her glass of water, she headed for the sofa.","Ye Wangchuan also fetched himself a glass of water and walked back with her.","Then, seeing that the girl didn’t want to talk, he curled up on the sofa and laughed. “What did Qi Yan say to you?”","He paused. His handsome face looked lazy and noble, but his eyes were extremely sharp. “Did she say something that’s courting death again?”","Qiao Nian moved slowly, shaking her head lazily. “No.”","Ye Wangchuan raised an eyebrow. “No?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyes and looked at him with her dark pupils. The emotions in her eyes were quite restrained. “She admitted that Jiang Li’s incident had nothing to do with Qi Lanyin. It was all her doing. She asked me to forgive her and the Qi family. She also said that the Qi family and she already paid the price and Jiang Li is fine. She asked me to forgive people wherever possible and not be too ruthless...”","Ye Wangchuan’s smile faded. He probably understood why Qiao Nian was in a bad mood after coming back.","Qi Yan was quite thick-skinned.","She could actually say that with conviction.","He looked at the girl. “What did you tell her?” he asked, his voice low and teasing.","Qiao Nian let out an “ah” and said nonchalantly, “I told her that if she said another word, I would make the Qi family disappear with her. Then, I left. She didn’t stop me.”"]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 100th-Day Anniversary Gift","paragraphs":["1611 100th-Day Anniversary Gift","The girl spoke in a flat, matter-of-fact voice.","Ye Wangchuan was stunned for a second and then laughed. The hostility that had just gathered in his heart instantly dissipated.","His brows relaxed, and his eyes were clear. He wasn’t stingy with his praise. “God Qiao, well done!”","Qiao Nian glanced gently in his direction. Even though she knew that he was deliberately teasing her, she almost couldn’t resist asking him if he could change the way he addressed her.","God Qiao...","Nothing good ever happened when Ye Wangchuan called her that.","However, Qiao Nian swallowed the words that were about to come out of her mouth. She tapped her fingers on the mug and tugged at the corners of her lips. The spot where she had been kissed was still faintly visible, and it felt itchy and numb like an ant’s bite. She had woken up this morning to wash up and brush her teeth. When she looked in the mirror, she saw that the swelling at the corner of her mouth had subsided. Nothing good would happen if she provoked him now.","Qiao Nian retracted her gaze and lowered her head to drink some water to hide her embarrassment.","Ye Wangchuan was still waiting for her to tell him off. To his surprise, his little girl had learned her lesson. She was silent and did not respond.","His thin lips curled into a smile. He didn’t make things difficult for Qiao Nian. He stood up and walked back to the study, took out a rectangular box from the drawer, and handed it over.","“What’s this?”","Qiao Nian put down the mug in her hand and reached out to take it.","Ye Wangchuan saw that she was in a good mood and said, “A gift.”","Qiao Nian was confused.","A gift?","She pondered what day it was.","Realizing that today was neither a holiday nor anyone’s birthday, she looked at the gift again. It was a little baffling.","However, Ye Wangchuan walked over. His white clothes and black pants made him look tall and handsome. His voice was low, deep, and handsome. “It’s the 100th-day anniversary gift. Nian Nian, open it and take a look.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","She paused, pursed her lips, looked down, and seriously unwrapped the bow on the box and opened it.","Inside the rectangular box was a carefully designed bracelet. The silver chain was not ostentatious, but a diamond-polished pendant decorated a third of the length on the right. The pendant was a sunflower. The style was low-key, reserved, and gorgeous. The silver bracelet was beautiful and unforgettable under the light.","However, Qiao Nian’s first reaction was to recall the bracelet she received not long ago from Lu Zhi.","That eye-piercing aesthetic taste could be compared to the one Ye Wangchuan gave her.","Startled, she glanced up. “What made you think of giving me a bracelet?”","Ye Wangchuan walked over and took the bracelet out of the box. His voice was low and seductive. “Give me your hand. I’ll put it on for you.”","Qiao Nian was silent for a few seconds before extending her hand.","The silver bracelet looked cold on her white wrist. The diamond wasn’t big, but it was beautifully polished. Low-key and tasteful.","Especially Qiao Nian’s wrist. It was fair and slender.","It looked even better with that bracelet.","In a good mood, Ye Wangchuan took a photo with his phone and saved it. Then, he helped her pull down her sleeve to cover the bracelet. He said unhurriedly, “I know you usually don’t like to wear these things. You won’t be able to see it if you pull down your sleeve. It shouldn’t affect anything.”","Qiao Nian looked at his smooth movements and pursed her lips. “I might not be able to wear it all the time.”"]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 Qin Si Finally Knows Who Betrayed Him","paragraphs":["1612 Qin Si Finally Knows Who Betrayed Him","She still wasn’t used to having something on her wrist.","Her brow was a little dry. She scratched her hair and said in a low voice, “It’s not convenient for me to bring it with me when I shower and play games. I can easily lose it.”","Ye Wangchuan knew her personality. She liked simplicity and disliked trouble.","He reached over and ruffled the girl’s hair, perfectly good-natured. “I know. Just wear it for two days. Put it away if you don’t want to wear it later.”","!!","Qiao Nian frowned again. She didn’t think it was a good idea, so she didn’t say anything.","Ye Wangchuan lowered his eyelashes and restrained the smile in his eyes, as if he knew what she was thinking. He said unhurriedly, “This is only our 100-day gift. When the time comes, there will also be your birthday gift, half-year gift, one-year gift, Valentine’s Day gift... Nian Nian, are you going to wear all of them?”","Qiao Nian pictured herself as a Christmas tree, with her entire body covered in gifts. The corners of her mouth twitched, and she quickly looked up. “Ahem, I haven’t given you a gift yet. What do you want?”","She remembered the ‘gift’ Ye Wangchuan wanted as soon as she finished speaking.","Thus, she added, “I’ll make one for you when I get back from Rao City. I’ll have to see what to buy.”","Qiao Nian reacted so quickly that Ye Wangchuan didn’t even have time to respond. He realized what she was thinking upon seeing that she wasn’t looking at him. He couldn’t help but chuckle softly. “Okay.”","Qiao Nian’s heart burned. Her earlobes felt hot, and she felt uncomfortable all over. She changed the topic. “By the way, I’m going to Rao City the day after tomorrow. Just letting you know.”","“Are you sure you want to participate in that variety show?” Ye Wangchuan knew that Qiao Nian was deliberately changing the topic, but he cooperated calmly with her.","As expected.","The girl’s tense back relaxed, and she grunted in acknowledgment, returning to normal. “I was originally going there. Got some errands to run.”","She was going to find what the Morse code left in the black box said.","“What time the day after tomorrow?”","Qiao Nian thought for a moment. “Eight in the morning.","“The variety show starts live at eleven. I have to go to them first when I get there. It’ll take a while on the way.”","The flight was too early.","She had to get up at six o’clock.","Qiao Nian felt inexplicably frustrated at the thought of waking up early. However, she had already promised Wen Ruxia that she would go. She never went back on her word.","“I have to get up early the day after tomorrow. I’ll go straight to the airport when I get up.” What she meant was that she would leave early the morning after tomorrow, and she wouldn’t say goodbye to him.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan naturally brushed away her thin bangs and put down his hand. He said, “I have something on the day after tomorrow and can’t leave. I’ll send you to the airport in the morning. I’ll look for you at Rao City after I’m done with things here.”","Qiao Nian opened her mouth, wanting to say that that wasn’t what she meant.","But Ye Wangchuan didn’t give her the chance. “It’s decided!”","Qiao Nian composed herself and didn’t say anything else. She just nodded in agreement.","*","The Qin family.","Qin Si went back and was taught a lesson. It wasn’t easy for him to get the person who betrayed him out of Mother Qin. He ran out when she went to the restroom and sent a WeChat message angrily.","[Master Wang, why did you betray me and tell my mother that I was playing games at your house?!]","There was no reply.","Still depressed, Qin Si sent a bunch of messages."]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 Master Wang’s Large-Scale Public Affection","paragraphs":["1613 Master Wang’s Large-Scale Public Affection","Ten minutes later.","The ID on the dialog box finally changed to ‘typing’. He held his breath and sent another bunch of stuff.","[Do you know how miserable I am?]","[My mother thinks that I’m not doing my job properly and that all I know is to play games. She educated me in all kinds of ways. She even found my aunties to give me an ideological and political lesson! My brain is about to explode. It wasn’t easy for me to find an opportunity to slip out.]","!!","[Master Wang, I haven’t offended you recently! o(⊙_⊙)o!]","[o(⊙_⊙)o.]","[o(⊙_⊙)o.]","He sent another seven or eight messages in one go.","Ye Wangchuan finally replied to him.","Qin Si immediately looked at the reply and cursed. “F*ck!”","The message said: [Remember to leave after playing for an hour next time. Don’t stay here.]","Qin Si suspected that he had seen wrong.","He rubbed his eyes and looked again, but it was the same thing.","He was f*cking heartless.","Who the f*ck said that ‘brothers are like brothers and women are like clothes’? Who the f*ck said that!? Why did he feel that if he played with Sister Qiao for a while longer, Master Wang would chop him up?!","Qin Si held his phone, angry and amused. He had yet to reply to him when Zhang Yang sent him a message.","Qin Si clicked on it.","[Zhang Yang: Young Master Qin, look at your Moments. Master Wang posted it.]","[Little White Dragon in the Waves: ?]","Qin Si was confused and replied with a question mark.","Ye Wangchuan hadn’t posted on his social media for many years. In any case, he had never seen Master Wang post on his social media ever since he got the latter’s WeChat.","He once suspected that Master Wang didn’t know how to use WeChat Moments!","Master Wang posted on his Moments?","Although Qin Si was confused, he still clicked on his Moments curiously.","The first was indeed Ye Wangchuan’s profile picture.","There was nothing on the pure white portrait.","Ye Wangchuan’s WeChat nickname was also very simple. It was just a letter Y.","He updated the photo. It looked like it had been taken at a random angle. It was a girl’s hand, wearing a bracelet.","Qin Si zoomed in on the photo and saw the pendant.","Quite a pretty sunflower.","Needless to say, Master Wang’s work was definitely polished from real diamonds.","His mouth twitched when he focused.","That hand... Could it be Sister Qiao’s hand?","Qin Si estimated that it was most likely Qiao Nian’s hand in the photo.","Feeling a little sour, he looked at Ye Wangchuan’s Moments.","— [There’s no one else in sight, and you’re everywhere. When there’s you, you’re the sun, and I can’t take my eyes off you. When there’s no you, the stars can’t compare to you.]","Qin Si felt that his hands were too cheap after looking at his Moments. Why did he click on it?","What was there to see?","This was a f*cking public show of affection!","Unable to take it anymore, he posted on his Moments as well.","[Little White Dragon in the Waves: Every couple who kills a single person is guilty!!! I’m already dead, thank you for the invitation!!!]","Not long after Qin Si posted on WeChat, Mother Qin called again to ask why he wasn’t back yet. He put away his phone and walked back with heavy steps and a crazy expression.","He’d lost. He couldn’t afford to mess with the lovebirds.","Especially someone like Master Wang who was ruthless and calculative!","Ye Wangchuan never posted on his Moments.","Therefore, everyone in the small circle in Beijing erupted when he did.","There were a lot of likes below."]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 Everyone Is Discussing Qiao Nian, Slap in the Face","paragraphs":["1614 Everyone Is Discussing Qiao Nian, Slap in the Face","Zhang Yang, Qin Si, Bo Jingxing, and the others all liked his post.","The Ye family clearly wanted to acknowledge this future Young Madam of the Ye family.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t add many people on WeChat, but someone took a screenshot and posted it in the group.","Previously, Jiang Xianrou had been kicked out of the group by Qin Si, but there was more than one group in this circle. Ruan Sisi and the others pulled her into another group.","!!","In this group, other than Ruan Sisi and the others, there were also some people from Beijing’s circle.","The group was extremely lively at this moment.","[Master Wang posted on his Moments.]","[This has been officially announced, right?]","[Previously, Young Master Ye publicly called everyone in the group to introduce Qiao Niao. He should have admitted it then. Tsk, I heard that this girl is only a freshman, and she came from Rao City.]","[I saw Elder Ye and the others praising it below. This time, it can be considered a parental certification. It has been made public to the circle.]","Jiang Xianrou came out of the room after taking a shower. Her hair was still wet.","Hearing her phone beeping away, she walked over and picked it up. She saw that everyone in the group was discussing the Moments when she opened WeChat.","Jiang Xianrou tightened her grip on her phone and instinctively opened her Moments.","When she scrolled down, she found her circle of friends empty.","Only then did she remember that Ye Wangchuan had already blocked her on WeChat.","Jiang Xianrou’s mood hit rock bottom. She opened Ruan Sisi’s group chat again and took a look. The group was still in a heated discussion about Qiao Nian.","What college entrance examination top scorer?","Zhui Guang?","How popular Qiao Nian’s recent MV was?","Every discussion about Qiao Nian in the group seemed to hit her in the face, making her feel extremely embarrassed. She even wanted to leave the group chat.","Ruan Sisi sent her a private WeChat message at this moment.","[Xianrou, I heard you were moving?]","Jiang Xianrou took a deep breath. Her eyes were gloomy and her face was cold as she replied expressionlessly. [Yes, my father bought a new house. We plan to move there.]","Ruan Sisi’s message came back quickly.","[Then is the house you’re living in now vacant? Are you not living there anymore?]","Jiang Xianrou was already in a bad mood. Her mood worsened when she saw this question. However, it would seem even worse if she didn’t reply.","Therefore, Jiang Xianrou hesitated for a moment before replying [Not really. Hasn’t my uncle been living in the staff dormitory of Qing University? My father means that even if the house is empty, it will be empty too. He plans to let my uncle’s family live here.]","Almost everyone in the circle knew about her relationship with Qiao Nian, and Ruan Sisi was no exception.","Ruan Sisi immediately understood. [Doesn’t that mean that Qiao Nian will have to move into your house too?]","Jiang Xianrou was extremely annoyed and replied perfunctorily. [Ah, right?]","[She doesn’t have a place to stay, either.] Jiang Xianrou sent another message.","Ruan Sisi said nothing for a long moment.","Jiang Xianrou did not want to continue chatting with her.","Just then, someone knocked on the door. She looked in the direction of the door, put the phone down, and walked over to open it.","Tang Wanru stood at the door with a bowl of bird’s nest.","She walked in and said, “You just got out of the shower? Come, Mom made you bird’s nest soup. Come have a sip.”","“Mom, didn’t I say that I’m on a diet?” Although Jiang Xianrou said that, she still walked over and pulled out a chair to sit down."]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 Stepping Into the Sphere of Influence of the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1615 Stepping Into the Sphere of Influence of the Independent Continent","Tang Wanru looked at her thin face with heartache. She paused before asking, “When are you leaving for the Pharmacy Association?”","“The day after tomorrow.” Jiang Xianrou casually picked up the spoon and scooped up a mouthful of bird’s nest. After taking a sip, she put down the spoon and thought for a moment before saying, “The morning after tomorrow. I’ll set off early.”","She was now a member of the Pharmacy Association and often needed to report to the association.","The Pharmacy Association wasn’t a place that just anyone could enter, especially a new member like her. She couldn’t slack off.","!!","In the past, Jiang Xianrou would always feel more comfortable when she mentioned the Pharmacy Association. At least she had confidence.","But now...","When she thought of the phone call Qiao Nian had made to Zhong Yiliu that day, and how Zhong Yiliu had treated Qiao Nian, her heart felt like it had been stabbed by a thorn. She couldn’t feel comfortable.","“You’re in a hurry?”","“Yes,” Jiang Xianrou replied indifferently.","“By the way, your brother will be discharged tomorrow. Your father and I are going to the hospital to pick him up. Are you going...”","She was talking about Jiang Li.","Jiang Xianrou immediately frowned and then relaxed. She said expressionlessly, “I have to pack my things tomorrow, so I won’t be going.”","Jiang Li and Qiao Nian were siblings.","What kind of siblings were they to her?","There was no point in asking for trouble.","In any case, she couldn’t warm Jiang Li’s heart no matter how well she did!","Tang Wanru saw that she looked slightly tired and did not mention Jiang Li’s discharge anymore. “Then you can stay at home tomorrow and pack up. Your father and I will go. I will tell him that you have a cold and are not feeling well. You can rest at home.”","Jiang Xianrou nodded.","Tang Wanru’s brows relaxed, and she carefully reminded her, “Drink more of the soup.”","Jiang Xianrou was unwilling, but she still reluctantly drank half the bowl, her mind elsewhere.","With Qiao Nian’s interruption, she definitely wouldn’t be able to go to the independent continent.","Jiang Xianrou’s eyes flickered, and her grip on the spoon tightened.","Although she could no longer go to the independent continent, it was not as if she didn’t have other means of reaching higher platforms. She had heard from Robert that the Pharmacy Association rated new members every year. In addition to the possibility of going to the independent continent, the new member with the highest rating had a very generous reward—they could study in the Pharmacy Association’s library!","She had long heard that there were many exclusive copies in the Pharmacy Association, and even Jiang Yao had mentioned them.","Someone said that the formula for the small pill sold on the black market was hidden in the Pharmacy Association’s library.","Zhu Yuanhao had bought her a small pill before, then she spent some time learning about it.","That small pill was extremely popular on the black market. Many forces and people wanted that pill, but the seller was mysterious.","Very few small pills circulated on the market.","If she could make that small pill or had the recipe, she could use this mysterious small pill to connect with many forces!","Jiang Xianrou thought about it clearly and was very confident.","Many people on the market wanted to buy the small pill. Many of them were from the illegal district and the independent continent.","Even if she couldn’t go to the independent continent, as long as she could successfully enter the Pharmacy Association’s library and find the formula for the small pill, what she obtained would not be worse than the opportunity to go to the independent continent.","She could even use this relationship to rise quickly!","She could step into the territory of the forces of the independent continent."]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 Still Dreaming","paragraphs":["1616 Still Dreaming","Of course, Jiang Xianrou was not stupid. She had also thought about the problem of the seller.","She had asked Jiang Yao to investigate, but he found nothing.","She only knew that the seller was a low-key ‘old Chinese doctor’ related to Wei Lou.","The Wei family was one of the top families in Beijing. She was not enough to compete with them with her current ability. However, she wouldn’t be afraid of Wei Lou once she obtained the formula.","!!","At that time, she would find the person who made the small pill and threaten him to seal his mouth. The small pill market would belong to her!","“Remember to pack more clothes. The weather in Country M is not good, and the temperature difference between day and night is huge. Remember to bring cold medicine and other commonly used medicine, just in case you need to use them. You’re unfamiliar with the place over there, and there’s no one to take care of you.” Tang Wanru was still telling her about picking Jiang Li up from the hospital tomorrow and helping her pack her luggage. Jiang Xianrou did not listen to a single word.","She was distracted and did not hear what her mother said clearly.","She kept thinking about the recipe for the small pill and the assessment.","*","The next day.","Qiao Nian went to settle the discharge procedures for Jiang Li.","She bumped into Tang Wanru and the others who came to pick him up.","Tang Wanru didn’t like Qiao Nian because of what happened last time, so her expression was naturally not good. Her face darkened the moment she saw her. She straightened her shawl and said coldly, “You’re here too? It’s really a case of a weasel paying respects to a chicken. I wonder what she’s thinking!”","Jiang Zongnan looked embarrassed and immediately stopped her. “Enough! As an aunt, what are you talking about? Aren’t you embarrassed?”","Tang Wanru gritted her teeth in hatred whenever she thought about how Qiao Nian had ruined Jiang Xianrou’s chance to go to the Independent Continent. Naturally, she wasn’t polite to her. “If she’s not embarrassed, why should I be?”","Jiang Zongnan frowned and looked at her unhappily.","Tang Wanru pretended not to see it. She snorted and said to the girl who was walking towards them with the discharge procedures in her hand, “I’ll transfer the money to you. Our family can’t afford your money. I’m afraid we’ll have to return it to you later. Why don’t I give it to you now?”","Qiao Nian pretended not to see her and brushed past her.","Tang Wanru gritted her teeth.","She stopped rummaging through her bag as if she had been slapped in public. Her blood surged and she almost lost her cool.","What did she mean?!","Jiang Zongnan knew that she was angry because Qiao Nian had come to warn Jiang Xianrou last time. That was why she had said so much in a fit of anger. He couldn’t stop her.","It wasn’t convenient for him to say anything in public. He frowned and stopped Tang Wanru.","He turned around and followed the girl. After some thought, he said, “Nian Nian, Jiang Li spent a lot of money on the hospitalization this time, right? I can’t let you pay for everything. Send me his hospitalization fees and I’ll transfer the amount to you.”","He said this without malice.","It was just that, to put it bluntly, his behavior itself was irrelevant.","At least it wasn’t something close relatives would do.","It was too distant.","And too well calculated.","Qiao Nian had initially ignored Tang Wanru, but when Jiang Zongnan followed behind her and talked about repaying her the hospitalization fees, she stopped in her tracks. “You want to give me money?”","Jiang Zongnan was stunned for a moment when her black eyes swept past him. He reacted. “I just don’t think I can use your money. Your money is also...”"]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 If I Say Three Million, Will You Transfer It to Me?","paragraphs":["1617 If I Say Three Million, Will You Transfer It to Me?","He wanted to say, ‘Your money is also hard-earned,’ but he couldn’t bring himself to say it.","Jiang Zongnan corrected himself. “In short, we can’t take advantage of you.”","The corners of Qiao Nian’s lips curled up. She raised her eyebrows and said casually, “If I say three million, will you transfer it to me?”","Tang Wanru’s expression turned cold.","Her eyes were incredibly cynical.","Three million. How could Qiao Nian ask for so much?","Why wasn’t she demanding three million?","Jiang Zongnan was stunned but did not think for long. “I’ll transfer it to your WeChat. Or you can tell me the details of your bank account and I’ll transfer it to you.”","Qiao Nian was just saying it casually. She wasn’t short of a few million yuan. Seeing Jiang Zongnan take out his phone, she suddenly felt that this was meaningless. “No need.”","Jiang Zongnan thought that she was embarrassed to ask for this money. “It’s fine. Take the rest of the money and buy something for yourself. Didn’t you win first place in the software competition this time? I didn’t buy you a gift, either... I don’t know what you like. When you get the money, buy something you like.”","“There’s no need.” Qiao Nian rejected him again, not wanting to beat around the bush. She simply said, “It’s my own business to spend money on my brother. It’s not for anyone’s sake, and it has nothing to do with you.”","Since it had nothing to do with Jiang Zongnan and the others, there was no need to ask him to compensate her.","With that, Qiao Nian left without looking back.","Jiang Zongnan stood rooted to the ground, staring at Qiao Nian’s back for a long time, unable to regain his senses.","He could vaguely sense that after what had happened last time, Qiao Nian’s attitude towards him had become much colder. Although Qiao Nian didn’t completely ignore him like she did Tang Wanru, she actually treated him no different from a stranger.","“Dad, Mom.” Jiang Yao found them at this moment. Seeing that they were standing in the corridor and not going in, he rubbed his temples and asked with a headache, “Why don’t you go in?”","Jiang Zongnan had yet to recover from the episode just now, so he did not speak.","Tang Wanru was agitated by Qiao Nian’s attitude again. Her expression was ugly, and she didn’t want to speak.","Jiang Yao walked up to the two of them and said with a tired expression, “By the way, I went to the inpatient department to settle the discharge procedures. The nurse told me that someone had settled the bill and had already settled the discharge procedures for Jiang Li. Who was it? His manager?”","Jiang Yao arrived late and didn’t see Qiao Nian. He thought that Star Glory Entertainment had run up and down for Jiang Li and even completed the discharge procedures.","Jiang Zongnan seemed to have returned to his senses and replied absent-mindedly, “No.”","“Who then?” Jiang Yao looked at him curiously.","With a complicated expression, Jiang Zongnan spat out a name. “Nian Nian.”","“...” Jiang Yao was suddenly speechless.","“I said that I would transfer Jiang Li’s hospital fees to her, but she refused to accept them. It seems to me that she...” Jiang Zongnan didn’t have the face to continue.","Even if he didn’t say it, Jiang Yao could roughly guess it. It was highly likely that Qiao Nian refused to accept the money and was very cold to them.","At this moment, Tang Wanru said indifferently, “Heh, she’s too embarrassed to ask for it. Three million yuan? She’s so shameless.”","“Mom, you’re saying that Nian Nian wants three million yuan for Jiang Li’s medical fees?” Jiang Yao looked at her in surprise.","Tang Wanru said mockingly, “That’s right. At that time, she told your father that she wanted three million yuan without thinking. I don’t know why she doesn’t want it anymore. She probably feels guilty.”"]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 Face Slap, Eight-Figure Surgery","paragraphs":["1618 Face Slap, Eight-Figure Surgery","Jiang Yao suddenly looked at her strangely, his eyes revealing indescribable emotions. However, the other party was none other than his mother.","Jiang Yao was silent for a moment. His throat was dry. He smiled bitterly and said in a low voice, “Mom, don’t speak what you just said outside.”","“What do you mean?” Tang Wanru frowned, her face long and unhappy. She thought that he was also defending Qiao Nian.","Seeing that her expression was still dark, she must think that Qiao Nian was trying to extort them. He couldn’t help but feel bitter. With difficulty, he explained, “It’s not what you think.”","!!","“?” Then what did he mean?","Jiang Yao seemed to know what she was thinking. He took a deep breath and said in a low voice, “Jiang Li stayed in the best ward this time. The daily expense is more than 10,000 yuan. Jiang Li has been staying here for more than ten days. Just the hospitalization fee alone is at least 100,000 yuan. In addition, the medicine he uses and the doctors attending to him are all the best.”","“So she wants three million?” Tang Wanru was still disapproving.","Even so, the hospitalization fee shouldn’t be three million.","Jiang Yao said, “Jiang Li’s subsequent surgery was done by Mr. Huang himself. The price of Mr. Huang’s surgery has always been in the eight-figure range.”","Eight-figure was still the market price.","This was because Mr. Huang was already a master-level figure. Liang Lu, who was once an “authoritative expert”, did not easily treat people.","Not to mention people like Mr. Huang who had long become gods.","Mr. Huang had been secluded for almost ten years and had not taken on any surgery.","Therefore, eight-figure was just a number. The significance of Mr. Huang’s willingness to perform the surgery on Jiang Li was greater than money.","The fact that Qiao Nian could get Mr. Huang to step forward was the greatest contribution.","None of these things could be bought with money.","Tang Wanru kept saying three million. It really made her seem narrow-minded and petty!","“Jiang Li spent so much money this time?” Jiang Zongnan felt even more uncomfortable after hearing this. He felt a little uneasy and wanted to look for Qiao Nian. “No, I have to return the money to Nian Nian. We can’t take advantage of her.”","Tang Wanru was rendered speechless by Jiang Yao’s retort. Her face heated up and she almost couldn’t hold it in.","She hadn’t expected Mr. Huang’s one surgery to cost so much money.","Of course, 10 million wasn’t a huge amount of money to her. She just hadn’t expected to use it like this.","It made what she had just said seem ridiculous.","Even the subsequent reversal seemed so... embarrassing!","Tang Wanru stood rooted to the ground, speechless.","“Dad, don’t go. It’s useless even if you go. Qiao Nian won’t take your money.” Jiang Yao stopped him. His handsome face was expressionless as he looked at his father and said helplessly, “Since she said she doesn’t want it, she really won’t take it!”","Jiang Yao now understood a little about girls’ personalities. Qiao Nian’s personality was similar to what Xu Jishen had told him back then.","She was straightforward and unpretentious. Moreover, she was cold on the outside but warm on the inside and valued friendship.","Qiao Nian’s personality was even more vivid when it came to Jiang Li.","She could find Mr. Huang for Jiang Li, or she could stand up for him and pick on the Qi family alone... She could even quietly settle Jiang Li’s hospitalization fees and come to the hospital early to settle the discharge procedures...","In contrast, Jiang Xianrou’s actions were especially disappointing."]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 Leaving for Rao City","paragraphs":["1619 Leaving for Rao City","Jiang Yao recalled what Tang Wanru said this morning and he felt even more complicated.","He didn’t see Jiang Xianrou come out with them when he went out in the morning and asked casually. Tang Wanru said that she had caught a cold and was resting at home.","He actually knew very well that Jiang Xianrou was not sick.","Being sick was just a cover.","She didn’t want to come to the hospital because she didn’t like Jiang Li.","He had a thousand reasons to understand her behavior, but he couldn’t accept that she didn’t come to the hospital to see Jiang Li the entire time.","Jiang Xianrou was too cold this time.","It was as if Jiang Li was her enemy and not her biological brother.","Jiang Yao’s heart was heavy, but he couldn’t say these words in front of his parents. He could only suppress them in his heart.","*","Qiao Nian completed the discharge procedures for Jiang Li and temporarily handed him over to his manager to take care of. In addition, she used the money Qi Yan gave her to find Jian Jin.","He asked Jian Jin to find a few agile people to squat beside Jiang Li and protect him.","Jian Jin and the others had been in contact with people in the illegal district and the independent continent.","Few people in the country were as skilled and quick-witted as the people she interacted with.","Of course, it would cost a lot to hire these people as bodyguards.","However, since someone was footing the bill, Qiao Nian didn’t hold back at all. The bodyguards she found for Jiang Li were all among the top in the independent continent.","With these people watching over Jiang Li, a small character like Qi Yan could forget about touching him like before in the future.","Basically, anyone who came would be crippled.","Qiao Nian prepared for her trip to Rao City after arranging the bodyguards for Jiang Li.","She didn’t have much to bring, but there was something she needed to take with her.","Qiao Nian threw her laptop, charging cable, and the medicine she carried with her into her shoulder bag. Then, she zipped it up, put her phone to charge, got up, and went to take a shower.","*","The following day.","Qiao Nian got up early and arrived at the airport at 6:30 in the morning.","Because Ye Wangchuan had something to attend to at the last minute, he didn’t send her to the airport. Arriving at the airport, Gu San got out of the car and opened the door for her, reminding her worriedly, “Miss Qiao, remember to call me when you get there.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian agreed readily. Without further ado, she took her shoulder bag and slung it over her shoulder. Then, she lazily waved at him. “I’m going.”","Gu San said a few more words to her and watched her enter the airport before getting into the car and driving away.","Jiang Xianrou arrived at the airport almost at the same time.","However, she did not see Gu San. She pulled her suitcase and got out of the car, then looked at her watch and said impatiently, “Mom, I’m going in. Otherwise, I won’t be able to catch the plane.”","“Alright.” Not bearing to let go, Tang Wanru tidied her collar and said softly, “Just do your best for this assessment. Don’t tire yourself out, understand?”","“Mom, don’t worry.” Jiang Xianrou’s lips twitched and she forced a smile. Her eyes were filled with ambition as she said confidently, “I’ll definitely get first place in this new member assessment! And I’ll definitely let them know that I can still succeed even if I don’t go to the independent continent!”","Didn’t Qiao Nian think that by suppressing her and not letting her go to the independent continent, she would be able to prevent her from making a comeback?"]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 A New Face, Most Likely a Newbie","paragraphs":["1620 A New Face, Most Likely a Newbie","She would become the master of the small pill when she successfully entered the Pharmacy Association’s library and found the pill’s formula.","She would return the humiliation she had suffered a thousand times over!","The radio was broadcasting information about the flights that were about to take off. Among them was the plane that Jiang Xianrou had to catch.","Jiang Xianrou did not delay any longer. She looked up and said, “...The teacher from the Pharmacy Association is still waiting for me. I’m leaving.”","“Alright, alright. Be careful. It’s cold there. Wear more clothes.” Tang Wanru reluctantly let go.","Jiang Xianrou left without looking back.","*","10 AM.","Qiao Nian appeared at the entrance of Rao City’s television station.","She was wearing a black baseball cap, a pair of earphones, a white T-shirt, and black slacks. Her hands were in her pockets as she stood lazily in front of the television station.","The security guard at the door turned involuntarily in her direction.","Qiao Nian ignored him. She took out her cell phone and made a call lazily. “I’m here. I’m at the entrance of the station.”","After hearing what the other party said, Qiao Nian’s eyelashes lowered slightly and she said in a low voice, “Okay, I’ll wait for you outside. There’s no hurry.”","She gave the other party her location, hung up, and found a shady flower bed not far from the entrance. She walked over and stood there, waiting.","After a while, a silver nanny van drove slowly to the gate not far from her and stopped.","Qiao Nian saw the car door open and an assistant got out. She quickly walked around to the back and opened the door.","Immediately after, a young woman with short hair and branded clothes got out of the car.","“We’re here, Xueying. Let’s go in first.”","Wei Xueying had two appointments today. This was her last one for the day. After she got out of the car, her expression was very awful. Just as she was about to enter, she suddenly saw a girl standing beside the television station’s flower bed.","The girl was dressed simply and did not bring anything with her. She only had a black shoulder bag and looked very ordinary.","However, she still noticed the outline of the girl’s chin under her baseball cap. It was outstanding.","She frowned almost instinctively and raised her chin in disgust. “Who is that?” she asked.","“Huh? Who?” About to go in, the assistant followed her gaze and saw a girl standing by the flower bed playing with her phone.","The girl’s head was lowered, so he couldn’t see what she looked like.","However, her aura was outstanding. She was the kind of person one would notice at first glance!","He paused, frowning with uncertainty. “A minor celebrity, I suppose?”","“She’s a celebrity?” Wei Xueying looked at Qiao Nian’s clothes in disgust. There was no label on the girl’s clothes, so she couldn’t tell the brand.","The texture looked good, though.","However, the quality of many fast-developing brands on the market was not bad either. It was impossible to tell just by looking at the texture.","The assistant sized Qiao Nian up again, unsure. “I’m just guessing. But she might not be a celebrity. She might be a staff member of the television station.”","Wei Xueying always noticed passersby and disliked people who were better-looking than her. The assistant smiled and said casually, “If she’s not a staff member, she’s a small fry. Anyway, I’ve never seen her before. I have an impression of anyone in the circle who’s a little famous. She’s a new face. She’s most likely a newcomer.”"]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 Looking Down on Sister Nian","paragraphs":["1621 Looking Down on Sister Nian","The corners of Wei Xueying’s lips curled up in disdain. She retracted her gaze and said coldly, “There are many beautiful people in the entertainment industry. How many of them can stand out? They’re just flower vases.”","“That’s true.” The assistant had been with her for almost a year and knew her temper well. He knew how to make her happy. Thus, he immediately looked away and said disdainfully, “She’s just average-looking. There are so many passersby like her outside. She’s not even half as good-looking as you.”","Wei Xueying felt much better after hearing his words. She retracted her gaze arrogantly and stopped looking at Qiao Nian.","The assistant looked at the time on his watch and said anxiously, “Let’s go in. Otherwise, we won’t be able to make it in time for the makeup.”","!!","Wei Xueying nodded and followed her assistant into the television station.","She was one of the most popular female idols who had recently debuted on a popular show.","Wei Xueying came to participate in a variety show this time.","The resources were average, but for a newbie idol like her who had just debuted and had a few fans and a little fame, this was already very good.","Therefore, Wei Xueying also valued the opportunity to appear on this variety show.","She and her assistant were about to go to the artiste’s exclusive lounge to do their makeup when they encountered a man in his forties walking hurriedly towards them...","The assistant immediately bumped Wei Xueying with his hand. He lowered his voice and said with excitement, “Xueying, it’s Director Tan!”","Tan Ninghao was the overall director and producer of the variety show they were going to be recording this time. It could be said that he was the sole decision-maker of this variety show.","Wei Xueying naturally saw Tan Ninghao.","The age of 40 was the best time for a man. Men of this age group were always mature and steady. The middle-aged man was wearing mocha blue work clothes. He was tall and looked elegant and handsome.","Nervous, she immediately smiled and greeted the person walking over. “Hello, Director Tan.”","The man suddenly stopped in his tracks as if he had just noticed them. He was stunned for a second and frowned as he looked at Wei Xueying and then at the assistant and staff beside her before slowly asking, “You are?”","Wei Xueying had always thought that the talent show she participated in was very popular and that even she herself had become popular recently.","To her surprise, the director did not recognize her.","She stiffened, then introduced herself in embarrassment. “Hello, Director Tan. My name is Wei Xueying. I’m one of the guests participating in this show.","“That’s my assistant next to me.” She did not forget to introduce her assistant.","Her assistant hurriedly greeted the man respectfully. “Hello, Director Tan.”","Only then did Tan Ninghao look enlightened. He nodded gently and said, “Oh, I remember that your name is among the guests this time.”","Wei Xueying smiled obsequiously. She was no longer as arrogant as before and acted ingratiatingly. “Yes, this is my first time recording such a variety show. I hope Director Tan can look out for me.”","“It’s fine. Our variety show doesn’t have any rules. Just relax.”","Tan Ninghao comforted her briefly and picked up his cell phone. Clearly, he still had something on. He hurriedly said to them, “The dressing room is just around the corner on the left. You guys go over first. I’ll pick someone up.”"]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622 The Person He Picked Up Was Sister Nian","paragraphs":["1622 The Person He Picked Up Was Sister Nian","“Alright, Director Tan. Please go ahead. We’ll go over ourselves.” Wei Xueying acted politely and obediently.","Tan Ninghao seemed to be in a hurry and did not waste any more time with them","The assistant whispered, “Xueying, let’s go too.”","Wei Xueying retracted her obedient smile and nodded indifferently.","!!","At this moment, out of the corner of her eye, she suddenly saw Tan Ninghao walking towards the girl they had met at the door after rushing out of the television station. He was gesturing about as if he was talking to her.","The girl, on the other hand, was very calm. She did not show much of a reaction. She only looked up and pulled down her cap. Tan Ninghao was the one talking.","Her eyes widened in disbelief. She turned to her assistant and asked angrily, “Didn’t you tell me you’ve never seen that girl?”","She had inquired about the guests on this variety show.","Wei Xueying thought that among the few guests invited by the production team, she was the most popular and had the most fans.","Since that was the case, she was considered the most important guest on this variety show.","But just now, the director treated her coldly when she took the initiative to strike up a conversation with him.","It wouldn’t matter if the director treated everyone the same. However, the director who treated her so ordinarily turned around and hurried to chat with an ordinary girl warmly. In comparison, Wei Xueying felt like she had been slapped in the face.","She felt uncomfortable and her expression naturally became ugly. Her eyes were sharp as she instructed her assistant, “Go, find out who that girl is!”","*","At the same time.","In an artiste lounge at the end of the corridor of the television station, Qiao Nian did not have any makeup on. Naturally, she did not need a makeup artist or stylist.","She walked into the lounge, picked up a bottle of water from the table, and unscrewed the lid. Her fair wrist held the bottle, but she did not drink it immediately.","Instead, she casually raised her eyes and looked at the elegant middle-aged man who had entered with her. She asked in a low and hoarse voice, “Director, do I need to do anything later?”","“You don’t have to do anything. We’re in a hurry this time, and I didn’t have time to communicate with you in advance. When the live broadcast starts, you just have to stand by the side. I’ve told another guest to take care of you.”","Tan Ninghao spoke seriously. His attitude was completely different from when he spoke to Wei Xueying previously.","“He’s a variety show host. He’s experienced in the field of crowd control. He’ll look for an opportunity to call you during the live broadcast. You can just answer briefly. You don’t need to say anything if he doesn’t call you. Just stand there and don’t wander off.”","He spoke more carefully mainly because he wasn’t sure whether Qiao Nian understood camera positions and other technical matters. After some thought, he explained, “When the time comes, we’ll have six cameras aimed at you at the same time. It won’t be good if you walk out of their range.”","Their variety show this time used an unprecedentedly bold plan—a live broadcast.","The form of a live broadcast was very novel and creative, and could also attract the attention of a portion of the audience.","But at the same time, there was a very obvious drawback—the program was live-streamed. If any accidents happened in the variety show, there was no way to make up for it with post-editing. They could only be exposed to the audience!"]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 Sister Nian: I’m Familiar With This Business","paragraphs":["1623 Sister Nian: I’m Familiar With This Business","Tan Ninghao had asked Wen Ruxia for a long time to help him invite this great god.","He desperately wanted to introduce the cultural relics of this Han Dynasty clock to the audience.","Such educational-based variety shows had always been unpopular. He couldn’t invite many popular celebrities.","The most interesting guest this time was Qiao Nian.","Tan Ninghao couldn’t even bear to leak the news in advance. He thought that he would reveal this surprise when the live broadcast began!","“I’ll give you the script. Read it first.”","Tan Ninghao reminded her worriedly, “Miss Qiao, don’t worry. Ruxia told me to take good care of you. Just do as I say. You don’t have to say too much. The host will take care of you.”","Qiao Nian took a thick booklet from him and flipped through them casually.","The booklet contained detailed procedures.","For example, the camera positions for Unit 1 and Unit 2.","When Guest A would say something, then how Guest B would go along with Guest A’s words and bring out the theme.","She skimmed through it and saw Guest X underlined in red.","The other guests didn’t know much about Guest X’s arrangements. Basically, it was written as Guest X standing aside and smiling.","Guest X: Smiling thoughtfully at the camera.","Guest X: Smile.","Guest X: A slight smile.","Qiao Nian flipped to the last page. She was very satisfied to see that she simply had to smile from the beginning to the end.","When she heard Tan Ninghao’s instructions, she raised her eyebrows and already knew what to do.","“An improvised backdrop?”","The girl’s voice was lazy, but she had a good temper and was easy to talk to. She put away the script and looked at him with flamboyant eyes. “I’m familiar with this business.”","*","On the other side.","Wei Xueying was doing her makeup in a dressing room not far from them.","Her hair was done.","Her chestnut curls fell to her shoulders.","Seeing her assistant enter, she immediately motioned for the makeup artist to leave first. He picked up a lipstick on the table and touched it up in the mirror.","Out of the corner of her eye, he glanced at the panting assistant and asked calmly, “How was it? Did you find out?”","The assistant went through a lot and offered a few staff members some money and cigarettes. Finally, he got something out of them.","He did not have time to drink any water and quickly said to Wei Xueying, “I asked. That girl is a commoner! She’s not from any circle.”","Wei Xueying paused. She didn’t believe it. “Why does the director care so much about a commoner?”","“I’ve asked about that too.” The assistant was really thirsty. He quickly grabbed a bottle of water and hurriedly drank two mouthfuls. After taking a deep breath, he continued, “This commoner is a student from Qing University. She’s a top student. Ah, she can be considered a highlight of this program.”","Nowadays, variety shows would include one or two amateurs among the celebrity guests. To put it nicely, they were considered more down-to-earth.","Wei Xueying had been in the circle for a year and more or less understood some of the inherent patterns.","Of course, she knew that variety shows nowadays liked to have a mix of celebrities and amateurs.","Hence, her tense nerves relaxed when she learned that Qiao Nian was a commoner. She put down her lipstick and said proudly, “Tell me that commoner’s name. I’ll get Sister Xin to help me investigate if she has any background.”"]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 Didn’t Expect It to Be Someone Familiar","paragraphs":["1624 Didn’t Expect It to Be Someone Familiar","The entertainment industry was a place of fame and fortune.","It had all kinds of people.","Who knew if some big boss was behind the small fry she met?","Although Wei Xueying did not think that the other party would know any big shots, it would not hurt to ask.","The assistant immediately gave her the girl’s name.","Both of them were immersed in the entertainment industry all year round. They were usually not interested in academics, so they didn’t notice any news about the college entrance examination or professional software competitions.","As for Zhui Guang...","Other than helping Wen Ruxia and appearing in a few scenes, Qiao Nian kept a low profile.","In addition, although Zhui Guang was famous, strictly speaking, she was not from the entertainment industry. She wouldn’t take on commercial performances or shoot advertisements like celebrities. Therefore, not to mention the passers-by, even the people in the circle did not know much about her.","Wei Xueying and her assistant had never thought about this...","She sent Qiao Nian’s name to her manager, who had yet to reply.","Either she was busy or did not see it.","Wei Xueying didn’t dare to call her.","After all, Zhao Xin was one of the veteran managers in the entertainment industry and had led many famous artists.","At one point, she had almost groomed her cousin, Bai Lin, to be a top-tier artiste.","However, later on, Bai Lin had to go overseas to avoid the limelight because she had offended someone. That was how she became an artiste under Zhao Xin.","She wasn’t her only artiste. Her status was too low. Zhao Xin was only taking care of her because of her cousin.","She usually managed other artistes.","Her current assistant was once one of Bai Lin’s assistants.","Wei Xueying sent a message to Zhao Xin. Then, she suddenly thought of this matter for some reason. She put down her cell phone and couldn’t help but ask him, “By the way, do you know who my cousin offended?”","“This...” Wei Xueying’s assistant looked troubled and looked at her helplessly. “Xueying, it’s not that I don’t want to tell you. I’m not even sure what went on! I was just one of your cousin’s personal assistants. I usually helped her buy what she needed and contacted the driver to pick her up. That day, I wasn’t with Sister Xin and the others. I only know that your cousin went out to shoot for a magazine on the day of the accident. Halfway through the shoot, she was already banned by the company. It seems to be related to... a trending topic.”","“Trending topic?” Wei Xueying especially paid attention to this.","The assistant knew she was going to ask about the trending topic, so he said first, “I don’t know what trending topic it is. In short, your cousin was banned because of one trending topic.","“We don’t even know who they are. Only Sister Xin and your cousin know what happened. However, Sister Xin is very secretive about this matter and never mentioned what happened that day to us.”","Then, he asked, “Xueying, has your cousin mentioned it to you?”","Wei Xueying shook her head in a daze. “No, she didn’t tell me. She only told me to be careful in the circle and not to offend anyone, especially those who shouldn’t be offended.”","The assistant clicked his tongue and said rather ruefully, “Your cousin almost made it to the A-list. Just a little more. She’d definitely have become an A-list celebrity as long as she got an award in the next two years. For such a big-name artiste to be banned just like that, it can be seen that your cousin is right. Don’t offend anyone in this circle. Otherwise, you won’t even know how you die.”"]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 Most Likely an Ordinary Person","paragraphs":["1625 Most Likely an Ordinary Person","Wei Xueying nodded randomly, her mood turning bad again.","Frowning, she picked up her cell phone from the table and realized her manager had not replied to her message. She pursed her lips. Perhaps she was reading too much into it.","She was just an ordinary Qing University girl.","Just an average person!","Even a straight-A student was only so-so.","What kind of person could she be?","It was impossible for someone whom they couldn’t afford to offend to participate in a science and education variety show that was destined to not have much impact.","The other party was most likely an ordinary person.","*","At 11 o’clock, the variety show had to be ready to start its live broadcast. In addition, it had to record a save file. In the future, it might even be able to be broadcasted on satellite television.","At 10:30, the studio staff got busy and took their places. The lenses of the six cameras were adjusted and ready.","About 15 minutes later, the guests who came to participate in the variety show came out of the lounge one after another.","Qiao Nian guessed that there were a total of four guests in the first episode.","One of them was a veteran A-list movie star, but she had already retired a long time ago. This time, she was here to do the director a favor.","The other was the host that Tan Ninghao had told her about before. He was around 30 years old and had round eyes and a friendly face.","He greeted the senior first when he arrived. Then, he turned to Qiao Nian and said gently, “You’re the girl Director Tan mentioned, right?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and tried her best to hide the sharpness between her brows. She looked like someone who didn’t like to talk much. At least, she didn’t want to appear eye-catching. “Mm.”","The round-faced host did not recognize her. He nodded and reminded her kindly, “Don’t worry. Just go along with me later. I’ll pass the message on to you when I have the chance. You don’t have to be nervous. Just follow my lead. Don’t be afraid of responding wrongly. I’ll find a way back for you.”","Qiao Nian’s eyelashes fluttered slightly upon seeing that he was serious. There was nothing strange about his dark eyes. She nodded respectfully.","The young host casually said a few words to her before a makeup artist came over to tidy his hair. He didn’t bother about Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian didn’t mind. She found a quiet place to lean against and play with her cell phone.","Wei Xueying was the last to arrive.","She made a grand entrance. The other two celebrity guests didn’t bring their assistants, but she even brought her assistant to the venue.","Her attitude towards the seniors was also indifferent. It could be seen that she wasn’t a big shot but put on the airs of one.","The other two guests were seniors in the entertainment industry. Many new celebrities like Wei Xueying would appear in the circle every year.","It was normal for young people to be unconvinced by their abilities.","They were already used to it and pretended not to notice.","Wei Xueying greeted them calmly. They only maintained their dignity and replied calmly.","Back and forth.","Although Wei Xueying arrived late, she still greeted the director, assistant director, and other guests.","She only deliberately ignored Qiao Nian the entire time. She didn’t say that she wanted to get to know her after filming the show together.","She put on the airs of a celebrity in front of the average person.","Qiao Nian saw that Wei Xueying was like a butterfly. As soon as she arrived at the scene, she brought her assistant along to greet everyone. She also recognized Wei Xueying as the person she had seen at the entrance of the television station this morning. She lowered her eyes lazily and played with her cell phone, not caring if Wei Xueying paid her any attention."]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 Tsk, She Seems Hostile","paragraphs":["1626 Tsk, She Seems Hostile","The variety show would start in five minutes.","A staff member was already collecting the guests’ cell phones.","As they had to record the scene, the microphone needed to pick up their voices during the recording process. It would be awkward if one of the guests’ cell phones suddenly rang during this process.","In order to avoid such awkwardness, the staff usually asked the guests to hand over their cell phones in advance so that they could keep them together. They would immediately return them when the show was done recording.","!!","The other two guests handed their cell phones to the staff readily.","Wei Xueying had already taken out her phone when it was her turn. Suddenly, she saw that Qiao Nian had yet to hand it over.","She pulled her hand back again from her halfway gesture and asked coldly, “Why hasn’t she handed hers over yet?”","The staff member was confused by her question. He looked in the direction she was pointing at and realized that Qiao Nian had yet to hand it over.","He was helpless. He couldn’t afford to offend Wei Xueying. He could only walk over and talk to the girl in embarrassment. “Um, Miss Qiao. We have to collect all the cell phones. Do you think it’s alright for you...?”","Qiao Nian heard what Wei Xueying said. She looked up unhurriedly and said politely, “Wait a minute. Let me send a message.”","“Okay.”","The staff member did not hurry her.","Qiao Nian clicked on Ye Wangchuan’s profile picture and quickly typed a message.","[QN: I’m recording a show and they’re confiscating my phone. I’ll call you back later.]","She typed the message in less than 10 seconds, then closed WeChat and turned off her cell phone. She handed it to the staff member waiting beside her. “Okay, I’m done. You can have it.”","The staff immediately thanked her. “Thank you for your cooperation.”","He kept her cell phone and then went to look for Wei Xueying.","This time, Wei Xueying had nothing to say and happily handed over her cell phone.","Qiao Nian stood lazily at the side with her arms crossed. Seeing Wei Xueying’s cooperative actions, she clicked her tongue and retracted her gaze.","Although she was blind to people she wasn’t familiar with, Qiao Nian was certain that today was the first time she had seen Wei Xueying.","She couldn’t understand why the other party was targeting her, but she could tell that Wei Xueying was hostile to her.","She seemed to dislike her.","As for why the other party didn’t like her... Qiao Nian wasn’t sure yet, nor did she want to find out.","After all, she would only be recording this episode before leaving.","Be it Wei Xueying or the others, they were just strangers to her.","She had no interest in getting to know them.","*","“Lights, props, get ready.”","“Lights in place.”","“Camera One in position.”","“Camera Three in position.”","There was some silence.","The remaining people also responded. The atmosphere became serious.","Tan Ninghao worriedly looked at the girl standing in the corner among the guests. He saw that the girl’s shoulders were relaxed. Other than looking a little casual, she did not seem nervous.","He relaxed a little more.","Tan Ninghao picked up the walkie-talkie and commanded, “Everyone, get into position. Guests, get ready. We’ll start immediately.”","Wei Xueying’s assistant handed her a new water bottle and took away the one she hadn’t finished, then jogged to the side.","The makeup artists of the others quickly left the scene."]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 Already Jealous","paragraphs":["1627 Already Jealous","The lights were already on.","Wei Xueying’s arrogant personality immediately changed. The corners of her mouth curled up slightly, and her almond-shaped eyes watered. She looked very cute.","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow as she watched the change in her expression.","The round-faced host stood not far from her. He lowered his voice to comfort her. “Qiao Nian? That’s your name, right? Don’t worry later. Don’t be nervous. Wait for me to call you. You can just follow behind me at other times.”","!!","“Yes.” Because she was filming a variety show, Qiao Nian didn’t wear a baseball cap, revealing her exquisite and eye-catching face.","Even if she did not have exquisite makeup like Wei Xueying and even especially got a team to do her makeup, wearing a simple white T-shirt and black cargo pants, the surrounding spotlights seemed to fall on the girl as she stood there with her hands in her pockets, looking brighter than the others.","Beautiful and cool!","Countless times more prominent than Wei Xueying’s monotonous idol style!","“Camera One, take more shots to the side later.” Tan Ninghao also saw the girl’s attractive appearance in the split camera even if she didn’t speak. He instructed the camera in a low voice.","Without needing his instructions, the cameraman focused on Qiao Nian’s side and gave him an “OK” gesture to show that he understood!","Wei Xueying also heard Tan Ninghao’s words and bit her pink lips. Her eyes burned with unwillingness, but she was about to start recording the show.","She suppressed her resentment and tried to maintain her bright and slightly fake smile as she stared at the camera.","“Dear guests, please take note. This is a live broadcast, and the program will be recorded and uploaded online. However, at the same time, we are also doing a live broadcast. We can edit the parts that will be uploaded online later, but we can’t do so during the live broadcast. Therefore, everyone, try your best to follow the script. We’ll try to finish the recording as soon as possible so that everyone can go back and rest early.”","Several of the guests nodded.","Tan Ninghao raised his wrist to check the time. Without delay, he spoke to the film crew and started taking out his clipboard.","“3, 2, 1! Begin!”","*","‘Searching for Treasures’ was a variety show that introduced the national or private collectors’ collection of artifacts to the audience through the form of celebrity guests.","By introducing artifacts, while introducing their historical culture and traditional skills.","The first issue Tan Ninghao found was a row of chimes from ancient times.","He looked at the ancient and exquisite clock seriously when it was brought over by the expert.","The expert first faced the 24 chimes in front of the camera for a series of introductions. The celebrity guests also offered their tidbits.","Everything was going well.","At the same time, Weibo was also broadcasting live.","Compared to the other guests, Wei Xueying was quite popular as an idol from a recent popular talent show.","The comments on the live stream were basically all related to her.","# The girl is so cute!","# It can’t be, can it, Yingying can weave bells? I’m in love.","# Today is little fairy’s day too","# So this is my idol? She even has canine teeth when she smiles. Her interaction with Senior Zou Meng is so CP-ing","# Carry away sister, sister alone is beauty","Among the four guests and one cultural relic expert, the girl standing in the corner was too eye-catching. Qiao Nian immediately attracted the attention of the audience as soon as her face appeared on camera."]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 Someone Recognized Sister Nian","paragraphs":["1628 Someone Recognized Sister Nian","# Who’s the girl next to Du Yu","# Who’s the chick in the white T, she’s so cool","# Begging the girl’s name","# F*ck, why do I feel like I’m looking at my big boss?","!!","# Zhui Guang YYDS","The people in the entertainment industry did not pay much attention to academic news, but the netizens usually didn’t care which circle they were from. Everyone was happy as long as they watched a good show.","Therefore, after the intense bombardment of the college entrance examination and software competition some time ago, many netizens knew a name.","God Qiao of Qing University!","Moreover, the fans also knew this person. God Qiao = Zhui Guang!","Given Qiao Nian’s popularity, she should usually have fans camping around her. However, she was too low-key. Qing University was a century-old school, and not just anyone could enter.","Hence, there weren’t many revelations about Qiao Nian’s private life.","Usually, if the fans wanted to know more about their big boss, they would have to climb up the wall to the Qing University school forum.","They wanted to see if there were any updates on the big brothers and sisters.","Even so, the number of big shots the fans could find was pitifully small.","Some time ago, Qiao Nian filmed an MV for the Winter Games, causing the fans to celebrate for a long time. They had thought that it was already an unexpected surprise.","They didn’t expect the big shot to appear on a variety show!","The topic of Zhui Guang appearing on the variety show quickly became a hot topic. More and more people streamed into the live stream. At first, only one or two thousand of Wei Xueying’s fans were watching, but as the live stream continued, some people recognized Qiao Nian and the number of viewers began to increase.","Like a rocket, it soared to 500,000 viewers.","Even Tan Ninghao, who had contacted Qiao Nian through Wen Ruxia, didn’t expect this number. It was only when the assistant director beside him handed him his phone mysteriously did he see how popular they were.","Despite their high popularity, the variety show’s live broadcast continued.","The artifact expert introduced the bells and also the historical culture and musical background behind them.","He also emphasized the chimes’ preciousness and the timing of the birth of instruments that transcended the Western equivalent.","The program recording gradually came to an end.","Perhaps because they were approaching the end, the guests relaxed.","The artifact expert told everyone that they could touch the bells up close. Wei Xueying was the first to run over. The expert had just said that this set of bells was very precious, and they had spent a lot of time and effort to repair it.","However, Wei Xueying did not seem to notice. She took down one of the bells to examine it carefully, looking curious, pretty, and innocent.","Everyone was shocked, including the old artifact expert, who was a little alarmed by Wei Xueying’s actions. He quickly reminded her, “We usually take the top and bottom when we take an artifact. We have to hold it.”","Veteran movie queen, Zou Meng, frowned. She whispered to her, “Don’t hold it randomly. If we break it...”","Wei Xueying didn’t care too much about it. She only paid attention to the camera positions. Coincidentally, she happened to block their view of Qiao Nian behind her. She grabbed the middle of the bells and said nonchalantly, “It’s fine. They can repair it!”","Her words were brainless and impolite.","The expressions of the staff and artifact expert present changed. However, Wei Xueying didn’t think so herself. In order to grab the camera’s attention, she deliberately held the bells to show the audience."]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 Little Girl, You Can Restore Artifacts?","paragraphs":["1629 Little Girl, You Can Restore Artifacts?","To her surprise, she stumbled and swayed. In her panic, she let go of the bells and it fell to the table as everyone watched.","“Careful!” The expert’s expression changed drastically as he rushed forward to catch it.","However, he was too late.","He watched helplessly as the weaving bell passed down through the times landed on the table, and the repaired area in the middle broke apart.","!!","Now there was silence.","The other two guests were stunned by this unexpected situation. Even Du Yu, the host who was especially good at livening up the atmosphere, was dumbfounded.","“Move!” Qiao Nian was the first to react, pulling her away.","Only then did Wei Xueying react. Her eyes turned red upon seeing the mess she made. She looked at the camera and cried helplessly. “I-I didn’t mean to. I tripped.”","Qiao Nian was expressionless. She glanced at her coldly and couldn’t be bothered with her. She said to the old expert, whose eyes were filled with heartache, “Did you bring any repair tools? I can repair this.”","The expert was stunned. Surprise appeared in his turbid but intelligent eyes as he looked at Qiao Nian, unsure. “Little girl, you know how to repair artifacts?”","Qiao Nian picked up the bottom of the bell that Wei Xueying had broken. Her movements were gentle as she nodded and said concisely, “I’ve repaired some old objects in the past.”","There were many old things in the Pharmacy Association’s library.","Like some well-aged medicinal chisels and books.","She had been there for a while before. For research, she had learned some craftsmanship in artifact restoration.","But she was best at emergency restoration.","The restoration and maintenance of artifacts was a more detailed job that required expert research.","Now all she could do was get the broken chimes repaired as quickly as possible.","After a while, the staff delivered the small forceps, magnifying glasses, and other tools needed for artifact restoration.","Qiao Nian didn’t like to talk nonsense, so she ignored the others.","She grabbed the tools and began to work with the expert to urgently repair the chimes...","They were dead serious.","As a result, everyone’s attention was focused on the restoration of the artifact. No one cared about Wei Xueying, who was crying at the side.","Wei Xueying cried for a while before realizing that no one was paying attention to her. She awkwardly wiped her tears.","She had no choice but to put away her frustration and unhappiness and join the others in watching Qiao Nian repair the artifact.","She even put on a fake anxious and uneasy expression.","*","The live broadcast that introduced traditional musical instruments and cultural relics’ history had become ‘I repair cultural relics with the old master’.","However, the audience watching the live broadcast was in a frenzy.","The bullet screen above was about to explode.","“U1S1. Wei Xueying is too much. She still has the cheek to cry. It’s too interesting!”","“Am I the only one immersed in God Qiao’s cargo pants? So sassy, I love it!”","“F*ck, how dare Wei Xueying cry. I threw up!”","“Our sister was obviously tripped up by someone. Who knows who did it? We’re just small fries. Please be magnanimous and let us off the hook. Stop looking for fake reviewers to lead the way!”"]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 Miss Qiao Is Repairing Cultural Relics, Face Slapping!","paragraphs":["1630 Miss Qiao Is Repairing Cultural Relics, Face Slapping!","“I don’t know the full picture, so I have no comment. I’m no one’s fan, but it’s too much for some people’s fans to say that about a girl.”","“The person upstairs who said she’s not a fan, please change your master’s profile picture before pretending to be a righteous passerby. A real fan follows her master and is so fake!”","The bullet screen was filled with arguments and insults.","The two sides fought hard.","However, many onlookers did not pay attention to whether they were pink or not. They were all attracted by the girl on camera. Her crow-black eyelashes were lowered, and she had a strong aura. However, she patiently restored the artifact.","Before this, Qiao Nian had been quite restrained. She had tried her best to keep a low profile and not steal the limelight from others. She had dutifully completed the task assigned to her by Tan Ninghao.","Although she didn’t smile the entire time, she at least stood there as a backdrop according to her duty.","Now that she was focused on repairing the bells, she couldn’t be bothered to deliberately restrain her aura.","Wei Xueying was acting beside her. Her expression did not attract any attention.","Almost everyone’s attention was on the girl. The ancient clock seemed to have a life of its own in the girl’s hand.","Fewer people argued on the bullet screen.","They were all dominated by one sentence.","[YYDS]","Qiao Nian, forever and ever!","*","At this moment, in Beijing.","At the Ninth Branch.","Ye Wangchuan came out of Master Cheng’s laboratory.","“Master Wang.” Gu San was waiting outside while watching the live broadcast on his phone. He immediately put away his phone and went over when he saw the man coming out of the laboratory.","“Yes.” Ye Wangchuan rubbed his temples. He seemed tired. From the corner of his eye, he saw that he was watching the live broadcast. He raised his chin slightly and asked him, “How’s it going in Rao City?”","Gu San knew that he was asking about Miss Qiao. Thus, he immediately said, “Miss Qiao is repairing cultural relics.”","“?” Ye Wangchuan frowned and held out his hand. “Show me your phone.”","Gu San immediately handed him his phone and thoughtfully opened the live broadcast webpage that he had yet to close.","Ye Wangchuan immediately saw the focused person under the camera.","It was Qiao Nian.","His brow cleared instantly, and even his weariness was swept away. His shoulders relaxed.","At this moment, Gu San, who had been watching the live broadcast of Qiao Nian’s variety show all morning, said softly beside him, “Originally, they were introducing traditional musical instruments, but halfway through the program, a female guest broke one of the bells. If it was broken, so be it. However, her fans even went online to distort the truth. Now, many of her fans are guiding Miss Qiao on Weibo.”","Ye Wangchuan turned his head and looked at him with thin, sharp eyebrows. He raised his eyebrows slightly, as if to signal him to continue.","Gu San pursed his lips. “They said that Miss Qiao doesn’t have the qualifications to repair artifacts. Wouldn’t it be worse if she rashly tried to repair it?”","Ye Wangchuan’s aura was as outstanding as snow.","Not showing much emotion, he glanced at Gu San and said in a low voice, “Continue.”","“They also said that it could only be considered an unintentional mistake on their idol’s part, but Miss Qiao knowingly did it. Compared to the two, of course, Miss Qiao is worse.”","At this point, Gu San was a little angry.","Gritting his teeth, he argued on Qiao Nian’s behalf, “It’s clearly that little celebrity’s fault. She broke the cultural relic, and her fans are making false claims online. Instead, they’re pushing all the blame onto Miss Qiao!”"]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 Is There Someone Named Wei Xueying?","paragraphs":["1631 Is There Someone Named Wei Xueying?","Gu San was angered by their behavior. “What’s wrong with Miss Qiao? Shouldn’t you help her clean up her mess? To put it bluntly, Miss Qiao isn’t helping her clean up her mess. That’s a cultural relic. Do they know how precious a well-preserved cultural relic is? Is the value of a cultural relic comparable to a sensational celebrity?”","Ye Wangchuan listened quietly. His eyes were a little lazy and noble. He asked him unhurriedly, “Have you checked which company that celebrity belongs to?”","Gu San had already investigated Wei Xueying. When Ye Wangchuan asked, he immediately said, “I’ve checked. She’s from Star Glory Entertainment.”","“Star Glory Entertainment?” Ye Wangchuan returned the phone to him. His eyes narrowed slightly, as if he wasn’t sure which company this was.","!!","Gu San knew that Master Wang didn’t know much about the entertainment industry, so he quickly added, “Star Glory Entertainment is the Zhang family’s company.”","The Zhang family had been doing well in Beijing for the past few years.","Especially in the past year or two, Zhang Yang had successfully infiltrated Qin Si’s small circle, and the Zhang family’s status in Beijing had also risen.","Many people wanted to curry favor with Ye Wangchuan and the others through the Zhang family.","However, Zhang Yang knew how to conduct himself. He had never used his relationship with Qin Si to introduce these people to Ye Wangchuan.","With his quick-wittedness, he gradually got along well with Bo Jingxing and Qiao Nian.","Ye Wangchuan did not expect this matter to be related to Zhang Yang. He nodded and only said to Gu San, “I’ll go out and make a call.”","*","The Zhang family.","Zhang Yang had just woken up when he received Ye Wangchuan’s call.","Recently, Qin Si had been stimulated by Master Wang’s public display of affection and would drag him to play games every day. He had played all night last night.","Which led to his recent severe sleep deprivation.","However, Zhang Yang didn’t dare to slack off when it came to Master Wang’s call. Halfway through brushing his toothbrush, he threw it down and hurried to the washroom to answer it.","“Hello, Master Wang. Are you looking for me?”","He paused for a moment as the other party spoke.","Zhang Yang was dumbfounded. “Miss Qiao went to participate in a variety show?”","He didn’t know that Miss Qiao was participating in a variety show.","Moreover, a big shot like Miss Qiao? Zhang Yang felt like he was in a daze.","The big boss wanted to enter the entertainment industry?","But the next words made him shiver. Cold sweat broke out on his back. “Wei Xueying?”","He usually didn’t care about the family’s entertainment company. The entertainment company was mainly managed by his mother. Zhang Yang would definitely have to follow his career path in the future.","He broke out in cold sweat and immediately said to the person on the other end of the phone, “Master Wang, wait for a moment. I’ll call and ask if my mother’s company has this artist. If there is, I’ll definitely give Miss Qiao an explanation.”","Zhang Yang hurriedly hung up and called his mother without stopping.","The phone was answered on the first ring.","Zhang Yang impatiently asked, “Mom, does Star Glory Entertainment have an artist called Wei Xueying?”","“Wei Xueying?” Mrs. Zhang was confused by his call. “I’m not sure. I think there’s an artiste with the surname Wei. A small name artiste, right? Why?”","Zhang Yang couldn’t explain the situation to her. He only urged her, “Hurry up and see if there’s someone called Wei Xueying in the company.”"]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 Blocked by Someone","paragraphs":["1632 Blocked by Someone","Although Madam Zhang didn’t know why he was so anxious about the young artist in the company, she knew that her son was not the kind of person who would cause trouble for no reason. Since he was in a hurry, something must have happened.","She didn’t waste any time and went to check.","She picked up the office’s internal phone and called the artiste department to verify the situation.","She picked up her private phone and again frowned as she said to Zhang Yang simply, “Our company does have a person called Wei Xueying. She’s an idol that gained a little fame from a talent show and can be considered one of the newcomers nurtured by the company this year. Xiao Yang, what’s wrong with her? Why are you suddenly asking about her?”","!!","Zhang Yang said concisely, “Suspend her.”","“?”","Madam Zhang was even more confused now. She even said, “You can suspend her, but you have to give me a reason. It’s not easy for the company to nurture an artist. This Wei Xueying is a newcomer whom the company used resources to exchange for a spot in a talent show. You’re suddenly telling me that you want to suspend her. I have to answer to the directors and the artiste department...”","“Ha.” Zhang Yang only laughed, but it was more like he was angry. He didn’t beat around the bush and said to her directly, “Mom, she offended Young Master Ye. Is this reason enough to shut those people up?”","How many people in Beijing could be addressed as Young Master Ye?","Besides, Zhang Yang was usually playing with the people in the Beijing circle.","He already said Young Master Ye.","Then, only one person came to mind—Ye Wangchuan!","After Madam Zhang figured out what was at stake, she didn’t ask any more questions. She reacted quickly and immediately said, “I’ll inform the artiste department immediately.”","“Yes.” Zhang Yang rubbed his temples. He still felt that his back was drenched in a cold sweat, but he was still worried and urged her, “Mom, deal with this matter quickly. Don’t think about getting lucky. Such a brainless artiste should be hidden as soon as possible, lest she causes more trouble.”","A little idol who had only debuted for a year and had some popularity and fans was already lawless on a show.","She was arrogant as hell.","She didn’t respect the work of restoring cultural relics, nor did she respect the traditional culture. Such an immoral person wouldn’t be able to make a name for herself in the entertainment industry.","He might as well suspend her as soon as possible.","*","In the recording studio of the Rao City TV Station.","The bell that had been broken by Wei Xueying had been urgently repaired by Qiao Nian and the artifact restoration expert. They had barely managed to repair it.","Except there was some more detailed work left to be done.","The old expert in charge of displaying the set of bells did not want to waste any time, so he communicated with Tan Ninghao before rushing back with his things.","With Qiao Nian’s emergency rescue, this episode of the variety show was finally over.","Although the film crew, director, assistant director, and other guests were frightened by Wei Xueying, they were quite satisfied with this result.","The only one who was unhappy was Wei Xueying.","Ever since the camera was switched on, her expression had been extremely ugly. She went to a chair to rest with the help of her assistant.","Qiao Nian still had things to do.","Since the variety show was over, she went to get her phone back and then went to look for Tan Ninghao. She wanted to leave now that the recording was over.","Suddenly, a short, fat man blocked her path."]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 I Hope You Can Cooperate With Me and Make a Statement","paragraphs":["1633 I Hope You Can Cooperate With Me and Make a Statement","Qiao Nian looked impatient. “What’s the matter?”","The other party wasn’t tall and put on airs. He sized her up and said indifferently, “Miss Qiao, right? It’s like this. I’m Xueying’s assistant. Xueying wants to see you. She has something to discuss with you.”","Qiao Nian had no intention of arguing with them about destroying the cultural relics. But she didn’t expect them to come knocking on her door to “discuss” with her.","She glanced at him and said coldly, “I’m not free!”","With that, she walked around him in search of Tan Ninghao.","Unexpectedly, Wei Xueying’s assistant was tactless. He was stunned for a moment before he immediately blocked her path again. “Miss Qiao, I hope you can cooperate with us!”","“What if I don’t cooperate?” Qiao Nian was starting to lose her temper.","Wei Xueying’s assistant was stunned by her aura and couldn’t recover for a moment.","Wei Xueying walked over at this moment.","She gave her assistant a disgusted look, as if blaming him for being useless.","Then, she raised her chin slightly and her eyes sharpened. Facing Qiao Nian, she said confidently, “Miss Qiao, I’ve something to discuss with you. Do you have a Weibo account? If not, I’ll get my assistant to register one for you.","“I hope you can cooperate with me and release a joint statement. Just say that what happened during the recording just now was scripted. We just cooperated with the ‘act’. This can eliminate the impact of public opinion on me. Of course, I’ll also tell the production team later to cooperate with us to clarify things!”","Wei Xueying spoke smoothly, as if she had never considered that Qiao Nian would reject her.","As for the production team, it wasn’t that she didn’t have the confidence to say that.","Her confidence came from her manager, Zhao Xin.","Zhao Xin had worked hard in the circle for more than 10 years, and her connections were not just for show.","Wei Xueying thought it through. When the time came, she would ask her manager to help her negotiate with the production team. The chance that she would win was high.","Her priority was to deal with the vegetarian in front of her.","As long as this person was willing to cooperate with her and make a statement on Weibo, saying that the one on the show was an ‘accident’ that had been arranged beforehand, she would be clean.","“Of course, I won’t trouble you for nothing. If you make a statement for me, I’ll compensate you accordingly. Is that okay with you?” Wei Xueying said arrogantly.","In her eyes, Qiao Nian was just an ordinary person. How much experience could an ordinary person have?","Later, she would give her the bags that the brands gave her and the skincare products that she didn’t want to use.","Qiao Nian’s lips curled up nonchalantly. With one hand still holding her phone and the other in her pocket, she asked indifferently, “What if I have a problem?”","“...” Wei Xueying frowned fiercely, her eyelids twitching. She probably didn’t expect a commoner like Qiao Nian to reject her so directly.","At first, she kept her arrogant attitude. But after being provoked by Qiao Nian, her face immediately darkened. She said coldly, “Miss Qiao, I hope you’ll cooperate. Of course, if you don’t, I have a way to deal with you.","“We’ll all be fine if you cooperate with me and make a statement on Weibo. But if you refuse to cooperate, I can only tell the public that you deliberately tripped me under the table, so I was unable to hold on to the relic...”"]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 Sister Nian: Oh, Then Post It Now","paragraphs":["1634 Sister Nian: Oh, Then Post It Now","Wei Xueying wasn’t afraid that Qiao Nian would deny it. She was a celebrity, while Qiao Nian was just a commoner.","So what if she clarified online that she had never even touched her?","Her fans on Weibo could drown Qiao Nian with their saliva!","Who cared what the truth was!","“Cooperating with you isn’t the only option I can choose. You can consider which plan is better for you. Think about it yourself!” Wei Xueying’s eyes were filled with mockery as she looked at the girl in front of her and nodded slightly.","Her attitude was just short of bullying her.","*","At this point the staff at the scene were tidying up the loose ends, including the guests who were preparing to go down and catch up on their next schedule or return to the hotel to rest.","Du Yu was just passing by.","He wanted to speak to Qiao Nian upon seeing her.","Unexpectedly, he heard Wei Xueying threatening the girl arrogantly. As one of the senior members of the entertainment industry, Du Yu subconsciously frowned and did not agree with Wei Xueying’s actions.","Wasn’t she ruining her reputation?","She wasn’t from their circle. Wei Xueying was too much!","Recalling that Tan Ninghao had instructed him to take care of Qiao Nian, he was about to smooth things over when the girl said calmly, “Oh? Then post it on Weibo now and say that I tripped you.”","Wei Xueying was stunned.","She wondered if she had heard correctly.","“What?”","Qiao Nian turned on her phone and said casually, “I told you to post on Weibo now that I tripped you. I want to see how miserable my outcome will be if I don’t cooperate with you!”","Wei Xueying was speechless.","The girl had already taken her baseball cap. Qiao Nian put it on her head and raised the brim of her cap, revealing her exquisite and surly face. Her eyes were cold and valiant. “Are you going to post it or not? If not, I’m leaving.”","Her attitude.","Wei Xueying had never expected this outcome and was speechless for a moment. She wanted to flare up, but the other party’s aura seemed to be able to crush her.","Instead, she couldn’t figure it out and did not dare to be as arrogant and domineering as before.","However, she couldn’t let Qiao Nian go.","She wasn’t stupid. At the very least, she knew that the episode in the live broadcast had ruined her reputation. If Qiao Nian didn’t cooperate with her and clear her name, this matter would become a stumbling block to her future development.","“Qiao Nian, I’m communicating with you properly. There’s no need for you to be so stubborn with me. I know you’re a top student at Qing University, but have you heard of the saying that there’s always someone better? There’s always someone better out there. You can’t do whatever you want just because you’re good at your studies. Otherwise, you won’t even know how you were taught a lesson!”","That counted as a threat.","Qiao Nian looked at her with her dark eyes, finally showing some reaction. Her aura was many times stronger than Wei Xueying’s. Just one look was enough to send a chill down Wei Xueying’s spine.","Fortunately, the girl only glanced at her coldly and did not follow up.","But the temperature around them dropped noticeably.","Qiao Nian’s voice was slightly hoarse. “Before you persuade others, you’d better persuade yourself first. Let’s see if you’re qualified.”","Before she left, she glanced at Wei Xueying from the corner of her eye and said impatiently, “Don’t disturb me!”","Then, Qiao Nian walked away, leaving Wei Xueying and her assistant still in a daze.","“What’s with her attitude? Isn’t she afraid...”"]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 It’s Too Late Now","paragraphs":["1635 It’s Too Late Now","Wei Xueying was in no mood to hear him out. She frowned and took out her phone. “I’ll call Sister Xin.”","Qiao Nian refused to cooperate with her. Thus, she had to ask her manager what to do.","The manager called at this moment.","Wei Xueying quickly walked to the side and picked up the call. “Hello, Sister Xin.”","She was extremely careful and did not dare to slight her.","Zhao Xin wasn’t as polite. “What did you mean by the message you sent me? Qiao Nian? Where did you meet her?”","Zhao Xin had just finished filming an advertisement with a popular male celebrity. She couldn’t use her phone in the advertising studio, so she didn’t see Wei Xueying’s message immediately.","When she was done, she saw the name Wei Xueying had sent her on her phone. Not caring about what happened next, Zhao Xin directly handed the rest to her assistant and came out to call Wei Xueying.","“Wei Xueying, let me tell you, don’t provoke her. Be polite when you meet her. It’s also okay to please her. In short, remember not to become enemies with her!”","Wei Xueying was stunned. She looked up at the girl’s back and bit her lip. “It’s too late, Sister Xin. I...”","She told Zhao Xin what had happened during the variety show. In the end, she even told her about how she had asked Qiao Nian to post a statement on Weibo to clarify things...","Zhao Xin’s mind was buzzing.","She couldn’t believe that Wei Xueying was so stupid!","Her voice was dry and hoarse. After a long time, she said, “Didn’t I tell you many times to restrain your temper? Don’t cause trouble and don’t offend anyone. Why did you still do such a thing?”","“I didn’t expect her not to cooperate with me in releasing a statement to clear my name. I asked Xiao Wang to help me find out. She’s just a student. A student is fine, right?” Wei Xueying still hadn’t realized what she had done wrong and didn’t know the seriousness of the matter. “Sister Xin, what should I do now? I haven’t gone online yet, but I can guess that someone on Weibo must be trying to drag me down. And those annoying marketing accounts are going to harp on this matter again! It won’t be good for my reputation if this goes on...”","“Hmph.” Zhao Xin was amused by her naivety. “Why are you still concerned about the public opinion on Weibo at a time like this?”","Wei Xueying was dumbfounded and did not reply.","She didn’t quite understand what Zhao Xin meant.","As a celebrity, wasn’t public opinion the most important thing to her? Was there anything more important than how to resolve this wave of haters?","Zhao Xin was outside the filming venue. She was so angry that she couldn’t speak for a long time. She was thinking about how to reply to her.","Her phone had already received a notification from the artiste department of Star Glory Entertainment.","Wei Xueying was going to be suspended from all activities.","Star Glory Entertainment had already posted Wei Xueying’s apology on Weibo.","At the same time, the company punished her.","The reason given was that she had failed to lead the artiste well.","She was given a two-year suspension.","In a place like the entertainment industry, which was constantly being updated, asking a big-shot manager to take two years off was tantamount to asking the person to leave the industry.","Zhao Xin swayed and she almost lost her balance. Then, she heard Wei Xueying calling her from the other end of the phone when she finally steadied herself against the wall."]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 She’s Zhui Guang?!","paragraphs":["1636 She’s Zhui Guang?!","Zhao Xin felt as if a bucket of cold water had poured over her head, freezing her entire body. She gripped her phone tightly and asked with difficulty, “Wei Xueying, do you know who the commoner is?”","Wei Xueying was still in the studio, looking confused. “Who?”","“Do you remember what happened to your cousin? Didn’t you ask me who your cousin offended that she couldn’t even stay in the entertainment industry? I didn’t tell you before because the other party had too much backing. I was afraid to tell anyone, and I was afraid that you would do something. Now, I can tell you.”","Wei Xueying pricked up her ears and listened intently.","Zhao Xin sneered. “The person your cousin offended is that ‘ordinary person’!”","“What?!” Wei Xueying was shocked. Her reaction was huge. Many people had noticed her, but she couldn’t care less about her reputation.","“I had Xiao Wang ask around. She has no background. She just—”","“No background? Who did you ask? A staff member? How can a staff member know about people like them? I’ve been in the entertainment circle for so long, but I haven’t even touched the door of the Beijing circle, let alone come into contact with people in their circle! You told me that you ran to them and threatened them. You even said that if they didn’t cooperate with you, you had to let them know that there’s always someone better!”","Wei Xueying’s pretty face was pale as she kept muttering, “She, she, it can’t be her. She looks so ordinary. She doesn’t even wear branded clothes.”","“The company’s announcement has already been released. Go and take a look on Weibo yourself!” Zhao Xin was implicated by her and didn’t even want to say anything else. “In the future, be a smart person. If you’re not cultured, read more books. Also, she’s not what you call a simple person. You don’t even have half of her fans. Forget it, I can’t be bothered to tell you. Go and take a look yourself.”","Wei Xueying was hung up on.","Her expression was quite ugly. Not caring about being scolded, she quickly opened Weibo and logged in.","She was quickly notified of being tagged 99+ times.","And a lot of private messages.","Wei Xueying didn’t look at any of them. She looked at the trending searches first.","Right now, at the top of the trending searches was the withdrawal statement released by Star Glory Entertainment ten minutes ago. It was written clearly in black and white that she had decided to leave the industry to reflect on her poor performance on the variety show.","Wei Xueying paled.","Her hand shook and she almost threw the phone away.","She took another deep breath and read on.","‘Searching for Treasures’ was on several trending searches. One of the trending topics was about the same as her withdrawal statement.","Wei Xueying’s mind exploded and her ears buzzed when she saw the name behind Qiao Nian’s name.","# Zhui Guang, Variety Show","Wei Xueying couldn’t believe her eyes. With trembling hands, she opened the trending searches and realized that the comments below were all discussing their performance on the variety show.","Most importantly, there were a few related Weibo posts.","One of the black avatars was particularly eye-catching.","This was because the other party’s profile picture was very simple, but the number of fans was shocking.","Wei Xueying accumulated a lot of fans during her participation in the talent show. She now had 800,000 fans on Weibo.","However, the other party had ten times more fans than her.","And the other party’s Weibo name was written with the letter Q."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 Did You Do This to Wei Xueying?","paragraphs":["1637 Did You Do This to Wei Xueying?","Qiao.","“Qiao Nian?”","At this moment, Wei Xueying could no longer be arrogant.","Shivering, she searched her address book for her cousin’s phone number.","However, Wei Xueying knew very well that it was useless for her to do so. Back then, her cousin and the famous families in Rao City had been forced to leave the circle and go overseas. Now, she was not as popular and famous as her cousin back then. How could she be different?","However, other than trembling as she made this call, she couldn’t find any psychological comfort. She was afraid that she would embarrass herself in public.","She couldn’t care less even though she knew very well that she would eventually become a laughingstock when everyone saw the news in a few minutes.","“Cousin, I’m in trouble.”","*","Qiao Nian walked out of the television station and hailed a taxi, preparing to go to the library.","After she got into the car, she slowly took out her phone. It was filled with missed calls and unread messages.","Qiao Nian opened WeChat and took a look.","She thought it was nothing important.","Unexpectedly, she saw that Zhang Yang had sent her a WeChat message.","Qiao Nian was quite surprised.","She usually interacted with Zhang Yang, but it was usually when everyone played together. In private, Zhang Yang rarely looked for her and was very careful to keep a distance from her.","But he sent her a message?","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and clicked on his profile picture.","Zhang Yang apologized to her very sincerely, saying that he had just found out about Wei Xueying, and immediately told her the results of their treatment of Wei Xueying.","In the end, Zhang Yang even asked if she wanted Wei Xueying to apologize to her in person again.","At first, Qiao Nian’s brows were tightly furrowed. Towards the end, she raised her eyebrows and called someone.","The caller picked up almost as soon as the call went through.","“Hello.”","The man’s voice was low and magnetic.","Qiao Nian covered her ears. A little irritated by his deep voice, she said to him, “Did you do that to Wei Xueying?”","“Huh? What happened to Wei Xueying?” The man’s voice was lazy and his tone was smiling.","Qiao Nian paused for a moment. She felt that the car was too stuffy.","She opened the car window to let the wind in and pulled down her cap before saying unhurriedly, “You asked Zhang Yang for help?”","“Zhang Yang told you?” Ye Wangchuan was not surprised. He immediately said, “I just asked him to control the artistes in his company. Don’t let any Tom, Dick, or Harry out there. Being an artiste requires virtue. She has no bottom line. Staying in the entertainment industry will only harm minors.”","“I know.” Qiao Nian didn’t have a good impression of Wei Xueying, either. She planned to teach her a lesson. At the very least, Wei Xueying had gone overboard in destroying a cultural relic.","However, she didn’t expect Ye Wangchuan to know about these things in Beijing.","Pursing her lips, she changed the subject and looked up at the speeding scenery outside the window. “By the way, I came out of the television station and now will take a look at the library. I’ll go back when I’m done here. You don’t have to come.”","Qiao Nian thought for a moment, then frowned slightly and added, “It shouldn’t take long if everything goes well. Well, about half a day.”","“If so, I’ll go back tonight. Even if I don’t, I’ll be back in Beijing the next day.”","There was nothing left for her in Rao City.","There was nothing left for the Qiao family, and everyone was even.","Shen Qingqing and Liang Bowen were studying in Beijing."]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 Jiang Xianrou Has Also Arrived in Continent O","paragraphs":["1638 Jiang Xianrou Has Also Arrived in Continent O","Qiao Nian thought for a moment, then said in a low and hoarse voice, “If I leave tomorrow, I’ll go back to First High School to visit Teacher Shen if I have time. Also, I want to go to Aunt Chen’s house. I brought some medicine for Uncle Chen.”","She had recently upgraded the formula for the small pill.","She made some more medicine.","However, Qiao Nian had been busy recently and hadn’t had the time to pass this batch of medicine to Wei Lou.","However, even if she wanted to give Wei Lou a portion of the pills, Qiao Nian did not intend to sell them all on the black market.","“Okay, tell me when you’re sure.” Ye Wangchuan knew about Qiao Nian’s relationship with Chen Yuan’s family, so he didn’t say much. He only said, “If you go to Aunt Chen’s, remember to greet her for me.”","Who was Ye Wangchuan?","Aunt Chen and the others were just ordinary people.","Ye Wangchuan’s attitude was very respectful and polite.","Qiao Nian wasn’t stupid. She knew that he only respected Aunt Chen and the others because of her. She let out a low “Okay” and said to him, “I’m hanging up now.”","She hung up the phone and put it down again. Then, she called Aunt Chen and told her that she might go over tomorrow. Finishing the call, she rubbed her temples and pulled down the brim of her baseball cap to cover her face, then leaned back in her chair and closed her eyes to meditate...","Qiao Nian didn’t sleep well last night and had to catch a flight in the morning.","Coupled with the fact that she had been fully focused on repairing the bells just now, her temples were throbbing with a headache. It was still a distance to the library, so she decided to close her eyes and rest.","*","At the same time.","Jiang Xianrou’s plane also successfully landed at Country M’s airport.","Compared to the glorious scene where she and Tang Wanru were led by Qi Yan last time, Jiang Xianrou was much more shabby this time.","Only one member of the Pharmacy Association came to pick her up.","Jiang Xianrou dragged her suitcase and followed him into the car. Then, she took out her phone and turned it on.","She was exhausted after ten hours of flying.","The temperature difference between day and night in Country M was huge. There was also the time difference.","At this moment, it was already close to evening outside. Night had fallen, and there were fireworks and stars outside.","A missed call popped up after she turned on her phone.","It was from her mother.","There was also a message from Tang Wanru and Jiang Zongnan asking if she had arrived.","Jiang Xianrou tapped her phone with her slender fingers. She pursed her lips and looked indifferent. She didn’t reply to them immediately.","Instead, she read the WeChat messages sent by the others first.","Ruan Sisi also sent her a message, but she did not ask if she had gone to the Pharmacy Association. Instead, she sent her a link to a website on Weibo.","[Xianrou, look! Qiao Nian is in the limelight again!]","Jiang Xianrou’s head immediately throbbed when she saw this. Frowning, she clicked on the website and saw all kinds of trending topics on Weibo.","#Zhui Guang","#God Qiao Fixes the Bell","#Zhui Guang YYDS","Jiang Xianrou’s mood instantly sank to rock bottom. She casually opened one of the trending topics and scrolled down. After roughly figuring out what was going on, she exited Weibo and sneered coldly. “She really likes to be in the limelight.”","She didn’t dare say it too loudly in case the person from the Pharmacy Association heard.","After Jiang Xianrou finished speaking, she looked at the other messages in frustration.","Other than Tang Wanru and Jiang Zongnan asking if she had successfully arrived at the Pharmacy Association, Jiang Li and Jiang Yao had not sent her any messages!"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639 Sister Nian Got What Was in the Black Box","paragraphs":["1639 Sister Nian Got What Was in the Black Box","Jiang Xianrou was in a bad mood again. She narrowed her eyes and turned off her phone. She put it aside with a serious and frustrated expression.","Jiang Li... she left it at that.","Jiang Li had always had a good relationship with Qiao Nian. Jiang Li had never stood on her side ever since she started fighting with Qiao Nian.","She could take it if Jiang Li didn’t text her to ask.","!!","What Jiang Xianrou couldn’t accept was that Jiang Yao did not ask her if she had arrived successfully.","In the past, no matter how busy Jiang Yao was, he would always take the time to ask how she was doing.","But he didn’t even message her this time.","Jiang Xianrou couldn’t describe her current mood. She felt that Jiang Yao’s attitude towards her had become cold. At least, he didn’t care about her as much as before.","She picked up her phone, wanting to send him a message to ask if he was busy.","She started typing, but she suddenly deleted everything in a fit of pique. With a cold face, she put the phone away again expressionlessly. Her fingers clenched, and her eyes were cold. They were filled with unconcealed ambition...","Never mind.","Her brother’s misunderstanding of her could be slowly resolved in the future.","What was most important to her now was not these trivial matters, but to successfully enter the core library of the Pharmacy Association and find the formula for the small medicine pill.","As long as she found that formula, she believed that everything in front of her was only temporary!","*","Evening.","In a five-star hotel in the center of Rao City.","The thing Qiao Nian did when she arrived at the hotel was to take a shower.","When she came out, she didn’t use the hairdryer to dry her hair. Her black hair was still wet and draped over her shoulders. Qiao Nian didn’t care. She walked out and unzipped her shoulder bag and took out a laptop and a small box.","The box was square, about the size of a palm.","Made of velvet fabric, it was black and had an ancient-looking brass lock on the front. It looked exquisite.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and played with the brocade box. Then, she put the box aside and pulled out a stool. She placed the laptop on her lap and sat down cross-legged, then carefreely turned on the computer.","The laptop she used was light in weight, and it wasn’t tiring to rest it on her lap.","Qiao Nian turned on the computer before picking up the brocade box on the table. She took a closer look at the lock.","It seemed to be an ancient mechanism lock. This kind of lock was extremely complicated to make, much more complicated and exquisite than many modern electronic locks.","Usually, a lock like this couldn’t be opened without a key.","Qiao Nian weighed the box in her hand and shook it. She could hear the contents inside.","A clatter.","She guessed that it contained something like a piece of iron.","Qiao Nian weighed the box in her hand again. It wasn’t heavy.","She narrowed her eyes and stared at the box for a long time before pursing her lips and placing the laptop on the table again. Then, she got up and grabbed the ashtray from the coffee table.","The ashtrays in five-star hotels were basically made of marble and sought texture.","The fist-sized ashtray was about the size of a box.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were cold and dry. She raised her eyebrows and didn’t do anything else. She placed the box on the table and picked up the ashtray.","Bam!","After the noise, the palm-sized box was destroyed by an external force. Something dark fell to the ground.","Qiao Nian tossed the ashtray onto the coffee table, bent down to pick up the things on the ground, and wiped them clean."]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 Independent Continent, Ji Family Crest!","paragraphs":["1640 Independent Continent, Ji Family Crest!","She was holding a badge shaped like a falcon.","The badge wasn’t made of iron, as she had first guessed. It was a special material that looked like iron but was not iron, like metal but not metal.","At first glance, Qiao Nian couldn’t tell what kind of material it was. At the very least, she had never seen such a material before.","But that wasn’t the point. The point was that after she cleaned the badge, she could see the red and blue gems embedded around it.","Beyond the gems of the medallion, the falcon’s eyes were also adorned with gems like onyx.","As soon as Qiao Nian saw the eagle, she keenly sensed that something was wrong with it. However, she couldn’t immediately tell what was wrong.","She just felt that the eagle eyes were too realistic. Even though it had traveled through time, she could still feel the suppression from the eagle!","Qiao Nian looked at the badge for a long time but couldn’t see any iconic patterns on it. Frowning, she sat back down on the sofa and took a photo of the badge with her phone. Then, she grabbed her computer again and sent the photo to someone.","Within moments, Jian Jin’s avatar lit up.","She answered her almost instantly.","[Where did you find this picture, Qiao?]","Qiao Nian glanced at the badge she had casually placed on the sofa and casually typed a reply: [Do you recognize this?]","Jian Jin quickly replied: [This is the Ji family crest.]","[That eagle is the Ji family’s symbol.]","[The Ji family believes in eagles.]","The Ji family crest?","Qiao Nian hadn’t expected the thing she had brought back from the black box to be related to the Ji family. She was distracted for a moment.","Jian Jin sent another message.","[It’s not only the Ji family’s crest but also the crest of their long-lost family head. It’s said that this crest is also a seal that only the Ji family’s head can control. Ever since he disappeared 20 years ago, the Ji family has been searching for this crest. After all, there is no other crest. The current head of the Ji family will always be said to be illegitimate.]","[By the way, Qiao, where did you find this picture? Did someone send it to you?]","Qiao Nian didn’t answer her immediately.","Instead, she leaned back on the sofa for a long time.","Ji Family, independent continent.","The answer was more or less unexpected.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and stared coldly at the message Jian Jin had sent her. She rested her hand on her lap and casually raised her fingers. This was something she often did when she was thinking about something.","She had been investigating the matter of her biological mother. She didn’t expect the Ji family of the independent continent to be involved.","In fact, there was another continent outside the illegal district, recognized by the world as an independent continent.","The independent continent was different from Continent O, Continent M, and Continent F. It was a multi-national administrative region recognized by international law.","Many old countries and old families resided there.","These families and the royal family were inextricably linked to the other continents. This was also the reason why the independent continent could become an independent region outside the few continents.","Among them, the Ji family was one of the very famous families in the independent continent.","The Ji family was one of the ancient martial arts families and had always controlled the royal family of Continent O in private. They were honored guests of many royal families in Continent O and possessed black gunpowder technology, making all the forces in the world fear them!"]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 Who Knows How Much Trouble That Thing Will Cause","paragraphs":["1641 Who Knows How Much Trouble That Thing Will Cause","The Ji family’s strength had declined in the past few years, but it was still a powerful existence.","The Ji family’s style was the same as the other forces in the independent continent. They kept a low profile.","Many families in Beijing didn’t know about the existence of the Ji family. However, those in the know knew how powerful they were.","Many people acknowledged that the illegal district was a miniature version of the independent continent, but the independent continent must be stronger than the illegal district.","!!","Compared to these hidden forces...","The Wen, Shen, and Wei families in Beijing were actually not enough.","If not for Ye Wangchuan, the Ye family would probably not be able to reach the corner of the independent continent like them.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes, her gaze profound and unreadable.","However, she didn’t play with the crest for long. She casually threw the palm-sized Ji family head crest into her black shoulder bag.","That casual attitude was as if it was a worthless little item.","It wasn’t the symbol of the Ji family’s head that the Ji family had been looking for for 20 years!","Qiao Nian returned to her laptop. The message Jian Jin had sent her was still there.","Ji family.","Ji Qing.","She hadn’t considered the two together before, mainly because they seemed unrelated.","She couldn’t think of any connection other than the same last name.","This was like catching a few people on the streets. One or two of them had the surname Ma. Could they all be from rich families?","Until now, all the evidence pointed to the independent continent’s Ji family.","Only then did Qiao Nian take the connection seriously.","But she now had nothing in her possession other than the family crest she had found through the Morse code in the black box.","If she wanted to figure out what was going on, she would probably have to investigate the Ji family.","At this thought, Qiao Nian couldn’t help but feel a throbbing pain in her brain. She rubbed her temples and narrowed her eyes slightly.","Jian Jin happened to send another message at this moment.","[Are you still there, Qiao?]","[Where did you get that picture you just showed me? Did someone send it to you? Who was it? You...]","Qiao Nian didn’t read the rest of the message. She typed a few words on the keyboard with one hand and messaged back—","[Q: No. I happened to see it on the black market. I was curious, so I asked.]","Jian Jin didn’t seem to think much about it.","After all, there were a lot of miscellaneous items on the black market. All kinds of information could be found in the distribution center. It wasn’t impossible for Qiao Nian to accidentally see a photo of the Ji family’s crest.","She replied.","[Well, I thought you’d seen the actual thing somewhere. It’s no ordinary thing, and if it turns up, there’s no telling how much of a stir it’ll cause on the independent continent.]","There was some silence.","Qiao Nian placed her pale hand on the keyboard and didn’t reply for a long time.","Then, she closed her laptop, got up, and went into the bathroom to blow-dry her hair.","She still had to go to Aunt Chen’s house tomorrow to deliver Uncle Chen’s medicine. If she was too sloppy, with Aunt Chen’s worried personality, she would be worried that she didn’t have a good life outside.","In any case, there was no hurry for the crest’s matter. Since there were clues, she would slowly investigate.","Coincidentally, Nie Mi had told her he was going to the independent continent soon.","As Qiao Nian walked towards the bathroom, she wondered if she should agree to his request..."]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 The Road Is Full of People","paragraphs":["1642 The Road Is Full of People","The next day, Qiao Nian woke up in the morning and went to Aunt Chen’s usual stall.","She had just turned the corner when she saw that Aunt Chen’s stall was surrounded by onlookers.","The crowd was bustling.","As if they were watching something fun.","Qiao Nian frowned. She pulled down the hood of her jacket, removed her earphones, and walked forward.","“Excuse me, please make way.”","She squeezed into the crowd and finally understood why so many people were gathered there.","A luxury car was parked not far from Aunt Chen’s stall. A black Bugatti Veyron was definitely an eye-catching existence in a small place like Rao City. Many people probably stopped to watch the commotion because they were attracted by the luxury car parked by the roadside.","Not far away, someone was tugging at Aunt Chen, as if they wanted to force a bag into her hands.","“Madam Fu, this gift of yours is too precious. I really can’t accept it.”","“This is just a small gift. It’s just a small token of my appreciation. Just accept it.” A well-dressed noblewoman kept handing things to Aunt Chen.","Aunt Chen’s sallow face turned red and she was very uneasy. She clenched her fists and refused to take it. “Take it back. I really can’t take it.”","She saw Fu Ge bringing his mother over when she came out to set up her stall in the morning.","Aunt Chen thought that they were just going to do something nearby.","Unexpectedly, the two of them walked towards her with gifts. Without a word, they stuffed a pile of gifts into her hands.","How could she accept these things for no reason?","Besides, there was no such thing as a free lunch. She might be poor, but she wasn’t unreasonable.","The Fu family had suddenly come looking for her, and it was such a big scene. They were probably up to no good.","She was just a commoner and did not know anyone important. These people must have found her because they wanted to find someone else through her.","She only knew Nian Nian.","The other was her son, Chen Yuan.","Chen Yuan had done well in the college entrance examination this year and entered a famous university. However, the Fu family was a big family in Rao City. How could a big family like theirs come to give him a gift just because Chen Yuan entered a famous school?","Therefore, Aunt Chen wasn’t stupid. She more or less guessed that the Fu family was here for Qiao Nian.","She was actually not used to such a scene. Coupled with the fact that there were so many people watching, it made her very nervous. However, she still insisted on not accepting the gifts. “I really don’t want it. Take it back. I’m going to set up my stall.”","Madam Fu had never seen such a stubborn person. She had a headache about how to make Aunt Chen accept the gifts.","Suddenly, Aunt Chen saw the girl walking over from the corner of her eye. Her eyes lit up and she immediately let go, ignoring the Fu family as she walked towards Qiao Nian.","“Nian Nian, you’re here? I...”","She didn’t know how to explain the situation to Qiao Nian, because she herself didn’t understand why the Fu family had come looking for her.","She was quite worried about Qiao Nian. From the corner of her eye, she looked in the direction of the Fu family. Her plain face was a little embarrassed and at a loss as she whispered to the girl, “Let’s go back. I won’t set up the stall today. Your Uncle Chen is still waiting for us at home. I’ll go buy some groceries. We can leave after lunch if you’re not in a hurry?”","Qiao Nian had wanted to see her as well. The sharpness in her eyes disappeared, and she looked gentle and easy to talk to. “Yes, I’m not in a hurry. Let’s have lunch together.”"]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 It’s Fine, I’ll Settle It","paragraphs":["1643 It’s Fine, I’ll Settle It","“Sure.” No longer embarrassed, Aunt Chen immediately beamed and said happily, “I’ll go to the market to buy a fish, to make your favorite boiled fish.”","“Okay,” Qiao Nian replied.","At this moment, the noblewoman, who had hesitated not far away, walked towards them. She greeted the girl awkwardly, “Nian Nian, long time no see. You’ve grown taller and thinner. You’re even more beautiful than before.”","Her greetings were very dry. Madam Fu felt embarrassed and uneasy. She wished she could find a hole to hide in.","!!","Except she was forced into a corner.","Yesterday, Fu Sinian told her that Bai Lin’s cousin had done something and provoked Qiao Nian.","She hadn’t slept well all night.","Over the past year, the Fu family had been going downhill, especially after the female celebrity Fu Sinian raised outside caused trouble. Everyone saw the Ye family’s attitude towards them.","The Fu family’s already difficult days became even more difficult.","Without the Ye Family’s backing, they were struggling even in a small place like Rao City.","She was worried that Wei Xueying’s matter would make the Fu family’s already difficult path even more difficult. She was even more worried that Ye Wangchuan would vent his anger on them because of this matter... Therefore, after she couldn’t sleep last night, she thought about this method.","She wanted to build a good relationship with Aunt Chen, as well as Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan.","Although this method was a little thick-skinned, it was better than doing nothing.","After thinking about this, Madam Fu calmed down a little and forced a smile. She continued, “It’s like this. I heard from Fu Ge that Uncle Chen had an operation some time ago. I’ve always wanted to visit him, but I was so busy that I didn’t have time. I finally found time today, so I bought some gifts for Uncle Chen, but Aunt Chen refused to accept them.”","Fu Ge used to go to the Qiao Family’s house a lot in the past.","Aunt Chen was a helper there, so they knew each other.","However, Aunt Chen only knew Fu Ge and did not have much contact with him, let alone with Madam Fu.","Madam Fu didn’t even like Qiao Chen back then, let alone the rest of the Qiao family.","At this moment, she acted as though they were close to each other. Feeling uncomfortable all over, Aunt Chen grabbed her hands and explained to Qiao Nian in a low voice, “Those gifts are too expensive. I-I can’t accept them.”","The girl was wearing a baseball cap and a light-colored sweater today. She was dressed simply, but her aura could not be ignored.","Fu Ge was standing not far away. He wasn’t as thick-skinned as his mother and was too embarrassed to come over.","However, he was looking in the direction of the girl the entire time.","However, the girl didn’t even look at him. After listening to their conversation, she patted the back of Aunt Chen’s rough hand, hummed softly, and said, “It’s fine. I’ll settle it.”","“Nian Nian, you...” Aunt Chen looked at her again. Although the current situation left her at a loss, she had never thought of asking Qiao Nian to stand up for her.","She was about to muster up the courage to reject Madam Fu when the girl took a step forward and stood in front of her unobtrusively, then said lightly to the noblewoman, “Are these the gifts?”","Madam Fu was still feeling uneasy and worried that Qiao Nian wouldn’t be willing to give her face. Now, she immediately pursed her lips and smiled. “Ah, right. I bought some health supplements for Uncle Chen. They’re all nourishing supplements. I specifically asked the doctor, and he said that they’re most suitable for patients.”"]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 Face Slap, Transfer the Money to Them!","paragraphs":["1644 Face Slap, Transfer the Money to Them!","Qiao Nian glanced at the bag. The paper bag looked very expensive. It was obviously not cheap.","Then, she saw some writing on the package.","Ginseng, antler, and bird’s nest?","Tsk. Qiao Nian’s black eyes darkened, and her eyes were filled with frustration. She looked a little surly and difficult to approach. “How much did you pay for these things?”","!!","“Huh?” Madam Fu was confused by her question.","The purpose of her gift was to please Aunt Chen and her. It was definitely not for money.","However, Qiao Nian directly asked how much it cost","Madam Fu’s face heated up. She felt awkward and a little uneasy. “Qiao Nian, these are the supplements I bought for Uncle Chen...”","“I know.” Qiao Nian’s expression didn’t change at all. She took out her phone from her pocket and asked, “How much?”","Uncle Chen had undergone surgery before Chen Yuan’s college entrance examination.","Now, Chen Yuan went to university in Beijing.","Madam Fu belatedly came to visit the person who had finished the surgery with a gift... Anyone with good brains could tell what she was up to.","Qiao Nian didn’t know if Wei Xueying knew Bai Lin, whom she had met once before, or if they were relatives. Furthermore, Bai Lin had an ambiguous relationship with Fu Sinian.","She hadn’t checked any of that.","However, she could more or less guess what Madam Fu was thinking.","The girl looked like she was about to give her money. Madam Fu didn’t know what to do.","She stood frozen to the spot.","With so many onlookers around, her face heated up. She opened her mouth to say something, but when her gaze met the girl’s cold black eyes, she could not open her mouth.","She felt guilty. If she said that to a girl, it might be even more embarrassing than now.","But if she accepted the money, wouldn’t she have made a wasted trip? “Qiao Nian, I didn’t bring these things here for the money. I just want to visit Uncle Chen. After all, Fu Ge knows Aunt Chen. As a junior, he should...”","Madam Fu had yet to sort out her messy thoughts and was talking nonsense. She was still thinking about how to persuade the other party to accept the gifts.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian’s eyes flashed. She didn’t seem to want to argue with her. Holding her phone, her fingers moved quickly.","Before she could finish, she heard the girl’s slightly hoarse voice say coldly, “I transferred the money to your bank account. Take a look for yourself.”","At the same time, Fu Ge’s phone pinged.","He took it out and looked down. Sure enough, there was a transfer of over 10,000 yuan, about the same price as his mother’s gift.","The money that had entered his bank card felt like a slap to his face. His expression changed slightly, and his handsome face flushed slightly with embarrassment.","Madam Fu was interrupted by the girl and was still in a daze. Fu Ge had already walked over from behind her and pressed her shoulder. He said in a deep voice, “Mom, stop it. Miss Qiao has already transferred the money to me.”","The money had been transferred so quickly?!","Madam Fu was a little stunned, and her eyelids twitched. She was surprised that Qiao Nian had Fu Ge’s bank account.","However, this was no longer the time to think about this. Her original plan had been disrupted by the other party’s unpredictable actions. For a moment, she didn’t know if she should leave or continue pestering her."]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 Sister Nian: Ye Wangchuan Is My Boyfriend","paragraphs":["1645 Sister Nian: Ye Wangchuan Is My Boyfriend","Ignoring them, Qiao Nian turned around and said casually to Aunt Chen, “I bought the items. They’re all Chinese herbs. Keep them for now. I’ll tell you how to use them later.”","Although Chinese herbs like ginseng and deer antlers were nourishing, they would have the opposite effect on people like Uncle Chen who was sick in bed all year round.","Chinese medicine emphasized quantity.","If the same prescription was measured differently, the final effect might be very different.","The Fu family didn’t understand this at all. They only bought these things in the pharmacy before running over.","Qiao Nian’s expression turned cold again. However, she didn’t say too much to Madam Fu in front of Aunt Chen.","“I’ll help you pack up. We’ll go back now.” Qiao Nian’s voice was very soft. At least, she didn’t have the same attitude as Madam Fu.","Aunt Chen watched as the girl quickly began to help her clean up the stall. Not caring less about what Madam Fu and the others wanted to do, she quickly went over and stopped the girl. “Don’t, Nian Nian. Sit at the side and rest. I’ll do it myself. I’ll finish cleaning up quickly.”","“It’s not like I haven’t helped you do this in the past.” Qiao Nian acted naturally. She dodged her hand, bent down, picked up a plastic stool, and stacked it together. Then, she quickly packed up the chopsticks.","She didn’t put on airs and did it naturally, as if she didn’t care about her image.","Fu Ge saw the girl pick up the plastic stools and put the overlapping plastic stools on the cart. She turned around and went to clean up the simple wooden table.","He couldn’t help but think of Qiao Chen.","Qiao Chen never did these things. At least when outside, she was like a delicate little princess who usually didn’t do anything. She was delicate and gentle, making people want to dote on her.","It was just that these tender feelings would tire him over time.","Sometimes, he would realize that Qiao Nian was completely different from Qiao Chen. However, at that time, he didn’t overthink it and wasn’t willing to admit that he was blind.","It wasn’t until the end that he understood what everyone told him. Madam Fu watched as the girl cleaned up Aunt Chen’s stall and said anxiously to him, “Xiao Ge, what are you waiting for?”","Fu Ge took a deep breath. When the girl packed her things and was about to help Aunt Chen push the tricycle away, he suddenly blocked the way.","“Qiao Nian, I...”","“Move.”","The girl looked at him impatiently.","Fu Ge couldn’t breathe for a moment, but he took a deep breath to calm himself down. With his handsome face, he focused his gaze on the girl and said, “Qiao Nian, I want to treat you to a meal.”","There was some silence.","What?","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and raised her eyebrows.","However, in the blink of an eye, she smiled. The corners of her lips curled up evilly and irritably. “Fu Ge, are we close?”","Then, she felt bored.","Qiao Nian refused concisely. “No need. My boyfriend will mind.”","Fu Ge’s expression changed at her first words. He looked even more embarrassed at her second sentence. He had heard a little about it in Qing University but could not enter Beijing’s circle. He could only hear the rumors and could not know more.","He clenched his fists tightly at his sides and lowered his voice. “Ye Wangchuan is your...”","Qiao Nian was open and honest, not hiding anything from Aunt Chen. She admitted readily, “Ah, he’s my boyfriend.”","Fu Ge’s mind seemed to have exploded into fireworks and then went blank. His throat was dry, and he was speechless!"]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 Our Goods in the Independent Continent Were Robbed","paragraphs":["1646 Our Goods in the Independent Continent Were Robbed","In the Ye family’s simple courtyard, Ye Maoshan sat on a mahogany chair in the main room instead of fixing flowers and playing with birds. A cup of tea was in front of him. Ye Maoshan picked it up a few times but was not in the mood to drink it, so he put it down in the end.","Beside him sat a dignified and graceful middle-aged woman. She was slightly smaller than Ye Lan, but she was not young either. She was probably in her 40s.","She was wearing a royal blue cheongsam and a light-colored square scarf. Her aura was quite outstanding.","The outline of the Ye family could also be seen in her eyes.","The butler also made her a cup of tea in a set of porcelain-white cups with gold patterns. He didn’t make the same clear tea as Yap Maoshan, but a cup of Western black tea in a mellow color.","“Thank you.”","Ye Shan thanked the butler politely and took a leisurely sip of tea.","Butler Ye retreated to the side and placed his hand in front of him obediently.","Ye Lan was also there, but she wasn’t as relaxed as the other person. She was still in the mood to drink tea at this time.","There was a layer of frost between her eyebrows. Although she was controlling her emotions, her eyes were anxious.","“They’re not back yet, Dad?”","Ye Maoshan looked outside. His heart sank and he shook his head. “Wait a little longer.”","Finally, someone hurried in the direction of the main room.","Ye Maoshan picked up his teacup for the fifth time. Then, he saw the person who came in from the corner of his eye and immediately placed the cup on the table again. He immediately asked, “How is it?”","The person who came in was also about 40. He was neither tall nor short, probably above 1.75 and less than 1.8 meters tall. He looked more rugged than the others in the Ye family, with a square face.","Ye Keji was very respectful to Elder Ye. Even though he had been travel-worn and hadn’t taken a break, he didn’t complain. He immediately said, “Our cargo on Independence has been hijacked. The other team leader, Wang Fei, who was in charge of transporting this cargo, has disappeared with it. Our people on the independent continent haven’t figured out the situation yet. They’re trying to track it down. They’ll tell us when they have news.”","Ye Maoshan stood up and paced around anxiously with his hands clasped behind his back. Then, he stopped and unconsciously looked at him. “That batch... was robbed?”","“Yes.”","Ye Keji wasn’t a direct descendant of the Ye family, but he was also a close relative of the branch family. He was considered a cousin of sorts.","He poured a glass of water and gulped it down. His expression turned grim as he emphasized it to Ye Maoshan. “The situation is that the people responsible for transporting this shipment have also disappeared. We won’t be able to figure out who touched our goods for a while.”","The forces in the independent continent were complicated, even more so than in Beijing.","If they didn’t know who did it, there was no way to recover the shipment or figure out why they were robbed.","“I remember that Wang Fei is working for Wangchuan?” Like Ye Keji, Ye Shan was a member of the Ye family branch.","She spoke suddenly, and everyone turned in her direction.","Ye Shan calmly put down the cup of tea and smiled. “Isn’t it obvious?” she said lightly, as if joking. “Don’t let someone steal the goods and do a disappearing act... everything will be resolved.”","Ye Lan frowned and questioned her coldly, “Ye Shan, what do you mean?”"]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 The Other Party Has Other Plans","paragraphs":["1647 The Other Party Has Other Plans","“I’m just making a guess. You can think I’m joking, too. There’s no need to get so worked up...”","Then, she suddenly said, “I heard that Wangchuan got a little girlfriend recently? This little girlfriend of his is from Rao City, the girl who has been missing from the Jiang family’s main branch?”","Ye Lan’s frown deepened and her eyes sharpened. “What are you trying to say? If you have something to say, just say it. Don’t beat around the bush!”","Ye Shan was different from Ye Keji. Her relationship with the direct line of descent had always been average.","!!","She felt that even if she was a cousin, she was still an elder, after all. Old Master Ye shouldn’t have directly passed by her generation and handed the future of the Ye family to a junior.","Therefore, Ye Shan was always targeting her nephew. She would always push the blame on Ye Wangchuan.","This time was the same.","Ye Shan played with her nails disapprovingly. She raised her eyelids and said with a faint smile, “The Ye family’s people in the independent continent are all old people from the past. Only this Wang Fei was introduced by him. Now that our goods have been robbed for no reason, and this Wang Fei has even disappeared, it’s not too much for me to reasonably suspect Wangchuan, right?”","“You...” Ye Lan’s eyelids twitched.","Ye Shan didn’t give her a chance to speak and continued calmly, “I’m not against young people dating. It’s just that even if they’re dating, they shouldn’t be focused on dating and forget their own business! It’s fine if he likes that girl, but not everyone in our family can have her. At the very least, we have to investigate her background and see if she’s clean.","“After all, the Ye family’s lifeline is in his hands alone. He’s also in charge of the Ninth Branch. This time, the Ye family’s goods in the independent continent were robbed...”","She had yet to finish speaking when a voice as cold as frost and faintly sinister sounded.","“This time, the Ye family’s goods in the independent continent were robbed. Then?”","Ye Shan’s expression changed and she immediately shut up, afraid to say more.","She saw a young man dressed in black walking in from outside the courtyard. The prayer beads on his wrist were exceptionally eye-catching, but they couldn’t compare to the man’s bad temper.","It was Ye Wangchuan!","Ye Shan’s heart jumped. She wasn’t sure when the man had arrived and how much he had heard.","Although she had never been close to her nephew, she didn’t dare to confront him directly.","After all, compared to Ye Lan and Ye Maoshan, Ye Wangchuan was not a soft-hearted person. If he said that he wanted to touch her, he might really do so.","Ye Wangchuan was followed by Gu San. As soon as Gu San entered, he greeted Old Master Ye, Ye Lan, Ye Keji, and the others. As for Ye Shan, he seemed to not have seen her.","Ye Shan was so angry that her mouth was crooked, but she didn’t dare to be impudent in front of Ye Wangchuan.","After Ye Wangchuan walked in, he raised his eyelids and looked at her with his dark eyes. He asked lazily, “What did Eldest Aunt say about my girlfriend?”","Ye Shan’s aura immediately deflated. She stammered, unable to hide her embarrassment. She said awkwardly, “I didn’t say anything. I just heard that you have a girlfriend and told your aunt that it’s best to investigate her identity and background. There are all kinds of people outside now. Families like ours should be careful... If the other party takes a fancy to our background and has other motives...”","Gu San couldn’t help but laugh when he heard her words."]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 Don’t Worry About My Girlfriend!","paragraphs":["1648 Don’t Worry About My Girlfriend!","Eldest Aunt Ye was too ridiculous!","Miss Qiao liked the Ye family’s background and wanted to covet the family’s assets???","She must have drunk a few pounds of white wine outside to say such brainless words.","Did she know anything about Miss Qiao’s background?","With that thought in mind, Gu San looked at Ye Shan’s wild appearance and felt that it was not strange for her to say such things.","How could Ye Shan know that Miss Qiao was the Red Alliance’s Sun and one of Cheng Feng Corporation’s owners? Furthermore, she knew Lu Zhi and the others...","In Ye Shan’s eyes, the Ye family was like a ceiling.","The others were all thinking about the Ye family’s assets because she had been thinking about these herself! Therefore, she felt that others had the same thoughts as her!","Ye Shan gathered her thoughts a bit more clearly and spoke with a bit more confidence. “And did you know that a shipment of the family’s goods is missing from the independent continent? Your man was in charge of the delivery this time, Wang Fei. He has disappeared.”","Ye Shan and Ye Keji both had a portion of their people in the independent continent. They were mainly responsible for some of the family’s goods.","So this time, Ye Shan followed.","It wasn’t easy for her to get a hold of Ye Wangchuan’s weakness, so of course, she had to take it out and trample on it. “I didn’t agree with you planting a newbie in the first place. The people outside don’t know anything, so something will inevitably go wrong. Our goods in the independent continent are so important. Now that something has happened... It’s already tiring enough for you to be busy with the Ninth Branch. You even have to manage the independent continent. Why don’t you...”","What she meant was that Ye Wangchuan should not interfere with the Ye family’s matters in the independent continent.","Ye Wangchuan walked past her. The butler quickly poured him a glass of water, but he didn’t drink it. He found a seat and sat down.","Only then did he lift his eyelids and glance sharply at the garrulous Ye Shan. His tone seemed gentle, but there was a cold ruthlessness in it. “Have you been very free recently, Aunt?”","His words shut Ye Shan up.","“I’m just concerned about you.” Ye Shan was a little embarrassed and her face was a little hot. In addition, she felt that Ye Wangchuan’s attitude towards her was not respectful enough. She suppressed her anger and didn’t dare to show it too obviously.","Ye Wangchuan nodded. His eyes darkened as he looked at her again. “I’ve already gotten someone to investigate Wang Fei’s matter. Before the truth is out, you shouldn’t keep saying that you’re a thief. Otherwise, when the time comes to investigate, you’ll be slapping yourself in the face. I don’t like to argue, but if you say that in front of everyone, and if this matter has nothing to do with Wang Fei, I’ll also be embarrassed if you still have to apologize to a junior at your age.”","He seemed to be telling Ye Shan with a few neutral words that if this had nothing to do with his men, then she would have to apologize to Wang Fei!","Ye Shan’s face turned the color of a pig’s liver, green and red. It was brilliant. She looked at him in disbelief.","Ye Wangchuan let her look as much as she wanted.","“Also, you don’t have to worry about my girlfriend’s background! Even if my girlfriend is after our family’s money, I’ll give it to her as long as she wants it.”","He even sounded a little regretful. “It’s just a shame she won’t spend my money yet. If you have a way of getting her to spend mine, I’d love to hear it.”","Ye Shan’s old face was almost shattered by his words. It was no longer the color of a pig’s liver. Her flushed face was about to turn purple. She was about to faint from anger."]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 There’s Such a Local Product in Rao City?","paragraphs":["1649 There’s Such a Local Product in Rao City?","“I only said a few things in passing. You—”","She had wanted to say that she was just a girlfriend. Did Ye Wangchuan have to embarrass her like this?","Unfortunately, she didn’t have the chance to finish her sentence.","Old Master Ye had already coughed and said sternly, “Alright, don’t you know how old you are? Why are you still so nosy?”","“Old Master.” Ye Shan obviously couldn’t take this lying down.","She thought that even if she wasn’t as precious as Ye Wangchuan in the family, at the very least, she was better than a country bumpkin from Rao City.","“I said enough. How many more times do you want me to say it before you’re willing to shut up?” Old Master Ye clearly didn’t like her attitude. He stopped her very seriously and raised his hand. “I’ll tell you if there’s any progress with the batch of goods from the independent continent. You can go back first today. I’m tired.”","Ye Shan took a few deep breaths before pulling a long face. Then, she picked up her bag and left without looking back.","Ye Keji rubbed his nose awkwardly and said to the old master, “Then, I’ll leave first. I’ll go back and take a shower.”","Old Master Ye waved his hand.","Ye Keji left the old residence.","After the two of them left, Old Master Ye glared at a certain someone in disagreement and said angrily, “You, you, how many times have I told you? Don’t argue with your aunt, you know her personality. Her father took a bullet for me and passed away early. Can’t you just let her do this?”","He originally wanted to say that Ye Shan’s IQ was only so-so, so why should Ye Wangchuan argue with her?","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were calm as he said noncommittally, “I’ll let her win next time.”","Next time?","How long would it be?","Was he still planning to embarrass Ye Shan next time?","Old Master Ye glared at him again. Seeing that Ye Wangchuan wasn’t even looking at him, he picked up the glass of water and lowered his head to take a sip. He immediately felt bored and pretended to be angry. “Young brat, don’t think I don’t know. You embarrassed her because your aunt said bad things about Qiao Nian!”","“Tsk.”","Ye Wangchuan put down his teacup and looked up at him with a faint smile. He asked leisurely, “Aren’t you the same?”","Old Master Ye was speechless.","This unfilial grandson!","However, he snorted and put his hands behind his back without denying it.","He was indeed unhappy when Ye Shan brought Qiao Nian out to talk about something just now. Hence, when she wanted to say something, he forcefully interrupted her and chased her away.","Old Master Ye’s thoughts were exposed by him. He held back his anger and rolled his eyes at him, but he didn’t want to admit or deny it. He tried his best not to sound so boastful. “Nian Nian just sent me a message. She said that she would come over later to deliver medicine to me.”","Worried that Ye Wangchuan wouldn’t understand, he coughed again and explained, “It’s that health supplement. The small white pill.”","He had previously gone to the pharmacy to buy it, but he hadn’t been able to buy it.","“The health supplement Nian Nian bought is quite effective. I heard that it’s a local specialty from Rao City.” Old Master Ye’s face was filled with curiosity. “You’ve been to Rao City before. Have you heard of this local specialty?”","He had heard of local specialties for eating and playing in the past, but he had never heard of medicine being used as a local specialty.","Even if this medicine was a health supplement, he still felt that it was very rare. At least, he had never heard of such a specialty before.","How should he put it?","Old Master Ye couldn’t think of a suitable adjective.","After thinking about it, he could only think of it as ‘very unique’!"]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 If There’s No Way, I’ll Make a Personal Trip to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1650 If There’s No Way, I’ll Make a Personal Trip to the Independent Continent","Ye Wangchuan was stunned for a moment and didn’t answer him immediately.","Old Master Ye picked up his teacup. He wasn’t in a hurry, mainly because he didn’t think too much about it. He treated the small pill as a local specialty that Qiao Nian had mentioned.","“Speaking of which, that medicine is really good. I’ve been eating well and sleeping soundly recently. My legs are much stronger than before.”","Old Master Ye smiled and turned to Ye Wangchuan. “That’s why I told Nian Nian to bring me more. I’ll give some to my friends later.”","The corners of Gu San’s mouth twitched. He couldn’t help but ask, “What did Miss Qiao say?”","Old Master Ye saw his strange expression and looked at him strangely. “Nian Nian said that she would bring me two bottles and asked me to deliver them.”","Gu San was speechless.","F*ck!","His expression froze. He raised two fingers at Old Master Ye, his facial muscles twitching as he stammered, “Two... two bottles?”","“Miss Qiao said that she would bring two bottles? Two bottles of that small white pill? Two bottles in one go?”","Old Master Ye wasn’t stupid. He immediately put down the teacup and looked at him strangely. “Is that medicine very expensive?”","Gu San immediately shook his head.","Old Master Ye rolled his eyes again, feeling more and more that he was strange. “Then why are your hands trembling like a chick’s claws? I thought it was very expensive.”","Gu San was speechless.","He silently grabbed his hand and wanted to say, “It’s not expensive. One pill is only a few million yuan.”","The price of two bottles... was enough to buy a courtyard house in Beijing!","However, he didn’t dare to say it.","Previously, he had been despised by Master Wang for having a big mouth. This time, Gu San was determined not to say anything. However, he felt especially uncomfortable holding it in. His heart itched, and he really wanted to explain to Old Master Ye what a small pill on the black market was.","Old Master Ye had indeed never thought that the health supplements Qiao Nian had casually given him would be related to the small pills on the black market. Seeing that Gu San was silent, he didn’t think too much about it.","However, Ye Lan knew.","She also heard from Old Master Ye that Qiao Nian was going to get him two bottles of ‘health supplements’. Her expression was a little calmer than Gu San’s. She secretly glanced at her silent nephew and rubbed her temples, then said earnestly, “Dad, if the health supplements Nian Nian gave you are effective, you can keep them for yourself. If you want to give them to your friends, I’ll buy you some other nutritional supplements another day.”","Although Old Master Ye didn’t understand why their attitudes became so strange when they mentioned Rao City’s local specialties, he didn’t think too much about it. He nodded in confusion and then looked at Ye Wangchuan. “By the way, Nian Nian’s plane will arrive at 1:30 PM. Go to the airport and pick her up. Don’t let her take a taxi back. I’ll call the Imperial Mansion to reserve a private room. We’ll treat her to a meal. She definitely didn’t eat lunch. The food on the plane isn’t delicious, either. I’m afraid she’ll go hungry. She’s still growing at this age and can’t go hungry.”","“I understand.” Ye Wangchuan stood up and said to Old Master Ye unhurriedly, “I’ll get someone to investigate Wang Fei’s matter. I’ll tell you when there are results.”","He thought for a moment and added, “If it really doesn’t work out, I’ll go to the independent continent myself.”","Old Master Ye didn’t say anything and urged him to hurry to the airport to pick up Qiao Nian.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t delay and gave Gu San a look, and the latter quickly followed him.","As soon as they left, Ye Lan immediately tilted her head and asked Old Master Ye, “Dad, are we still going to the Wei Family’s birthday banquet?”","Old Master Ye picked up his teacup again and looked up. He said coldly, “Isn’t Nian Nian and Wei Ying on bad terms? We won’t go.”","Ye Lan understood immediately.","That would be disrespecting Wei Ying!","“I understand.” Ye Lan retracted her gaze and stopped asking."]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 Are You the VIP Who Came to the Birthday Party Today?","paragraphs":["1651 Are You the VIP Who Came to the Birthday Party Today?","Qiao Nian arrived at the capital airport early in the afternoon.","After getting off the plane, she took a taxi to the Imperial Mansion.","Many cars were parked outside the Imperial Mansion today. All kinds of big luxury cars. It was as if a big lunch banquet was being held here.","Cars drove in one after another after Qian Nian arrived.","She casually glanced at them and realized that each of the cars looked more valuable than the other, but their license plate numbers were very ordinary.","Some of them weren’t even from Beijing.","One had to know that in a place like Beijing, there were countless people who could afford to drive luxury cars. Everyone was already used to seeing good cars. Compared to good cars, people in Beijing liked to look at license plates more.","For example, Ye Wangchuan’s red flag.","From the outside, it looked very low-key. At first glance, it even looked the same as a random car that cost more than 100,000 yuan or 200,000 yuan.","However, with his license plate hanging on it, no one would think that the person in the car was an ordinary person that could be casually interacted with even if they didn’t know the car.","However, these cars looked very ostentatious today. Any one of them was a million-dollar luxury car, but it looked more like they were watching a show.","There wasn’t even a slightly better license plate from Beijing, which showed these people’s status.","Qiao Nian raised her hand and pulled down her hoodie. She expressionlessly put her hand in her pocket and walked in casually...","“Hello, are you the VIP who came to attend the birthday banquet today?” The waiter from the Imperial Mansion was very polite and wouldn’t judge a book by its cover.","After smiling at Qiao Nian, he reminded her considerately, “If you are, please go to Banquet Hall C1. If not, please go to the second floor or the hall to eat.”","Qiao Nian nodded and said gently, “I’m here to eat.”","“Alright. The second floor and the other halls can be used normally. Please go over directly. Someone will receive you there.” The waiter didn’t say much. He smiled and extended his hand to invite her in.","Qiao Nian walked in boldly.","However, she didn’t go up to the second floor, nor did she go to the other halls on the first floor. Instead, she walked straight to Banquet Hall C1 which the waiter had said was holding a birthday banquet at noon today.","* * *","Outside Banquet Hall C1.","Wei Ying, Wei Ling, and Shen Jingyan were all there.","Wei Ying was dressed exceptionally well today. The red modified Tang suit looked good on her, and her appearance was much better than before. She seemed to be in a good mood.","With her status and seniority, she no longer needed to greet guests. She only needed to stand there.","As for the important guests, she had to personally entertain them.","However, there were only a few families in the upper echelons of Beijing. Only a handful of people were worthy of her personal reception.","Wei Ying wasn’t too busy today. Wei Ling and Shen Jingyan were basically the ones who handled the guests for her.","“No one from the Ye family is here yet?”","As noon approached, Wei Ying roughly looked at the guests who had arrived and frowned slightly, feeling a little dissatisfied.","“Only Wen Ziyu came from the Wen Family? Madam Wen and Wen Ruxia didn’t come?”","Wei Ying thought that her seniority was high.","In addition, when Old Master Wei was around, the Wei Family was glorious.","She had a high status, so everyone was willing to give her face.","Wei Ying was already used to living a high and mighty life. She was also used to being surrounded by people and being praised by everyone. Thus, she was clearly dissatisfied with the current situation."]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 Ye Lan Can’t Even Be Bothered to Find an Excuse","paragraphs":["1652 Ye Lan Can’t Even Be Bothered to Find an Excuse","Today was her 50th birthday. According to tradition, her birthday called for a big celebration.","However, she was not satisfied with the people who came today.","They were all small fries who clung to the Wei and Shen families. Only a few people in the capital’s circle came. In Particular, none of the Ye and Wen families came.","At least Wen Ziyu from the Wen family came.","It was almost midnight, but no one from the Ye family came.","“Chief Wen said that she has a meeting to attend and is not in Beijing. She asked me to congratulate you on your happiness and longevity. She can’t come.”","Shen Jingyan personally contacted Wen Ruxia. She spoke politely on the phone and found a reasonable excuse not to come.","“Mrs. Wen isn’t here, either. Only Young Master Wen is representing his family at your birthday banquet.”","Wei Ying pulled a long face and her eyebrows twitched. She held a string of beads in her hand. She looked loving and gentle on the surface, but it was just a cover-up. “Hmph, I think they don’t want to come!”","“Mom, how could that be? Don’t think too much. Isn’t Young Master Wen here? It’s good that someone is representing the family.” Shen Jingyan tried to smooth things over and coax her.","Wei Ying knew all too well.","Ever since Old Master Wei passed away, she had fallen out with her younger brother, Wei Mingxuan, because she had asked Liang Lu to perform surgery on her father.","The family’s reputation was not as good as before.","Those families that still clung to them and were on good terms with them were all smart. They all stood on Wei Mingxuan’s side and collectively isolated her.","These people did not want to fall out with him. Thus, they all found excuses not to come.","In the end...","Wasn’t it because Wei Mingxuan and Wei Lou refused to attend her birthday banquet?!","Those people were just following Wei Mingxuan’s orders.","All of them were smart.","“Where’s the Ye family? If no one from the Wen family doesn’t come, then no one from the Ye family will come either?” Wei Ying quickly fiddled with the beads as she spoke.","Shen Jingyan found it difficult to speak.","Wei Ling had no choice but to tell her personally, “I just called Ye Lan. President Ye said that they won’t be coming.”","“What?” Wei Ying did not react at first and thought that she had not finished speaking. Seeing that Wei Ling had stopped talking, she looked shocked. “They’re not coming? That’s all? She didn’t say why?”","Wei Ling’s face felt hot and awkward. She didn’t know how to break it to her. She held her arm and shook her head. “President Ye didn’t say anything. She only said that they weren’t coming. I didn’t know how to answer for a moment. After that, I hung up in a daze without asking why she wasn’t coming.”","If Ye Lan did not come, Old Master Ye would not lower himself to come.","However, the other party was too lazy to even find an excuse. That was extremely disrespectful to them!","Wei Ying was so angry that her mouth was crooked, and she almost couldn’t breathe. Her expression instantly turned ugly. “What, what do they mean?”","Shen Jingyan and Wei Ling stood still. Neither of them answered.","The couple looked at each other and saw the anxiety and discomfort in each other’s eyes.","However, since no one was willing to give Wei Ying face, they were even more helpless.","At this moment.","Shen Jingyan was in a terrible state when he suddenly saw a person walking towards them. He was stunned for a moment before shouting, “Nian Nian?!”","Qiao Nian?","Wei Ying and Wei Ling looked up in unison, their faces filled with surprise as if they didn’t understand why Qiao Nian had come."]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 Sister Nian, You Know Ji Qing?","paragraphs":["1653 Sister Nian, You Know Ji Qing?","However, the girl was wearing a sweater and a cap, and her hands were in her pockets. She only had a black shoulder bag and nothing else.","But who else could it be other than Qiao Nian?","“Why are you here?” Wei Ling thought of her brother’s matter and still had a knot in her heart about Qiao Nian. At the very least, she couldn’t act as if nothing had happened. Her expression was tense as she spoke.","Wei Ying was even more restrained. She didn’t say a word and was expressionless. Her mean eyes stared at the girl sharply.","“Nian Nian, why are you here?” Shen Jingyan was much more natural than the two of them. He walked over and asked gently, “Are you here to eat?”","He asked again before Qiao Nian could speak, “You’re alone? No friends with you?”","Shen Jingyan’s brows relaxed, and he looked very sincere as he invited her. “Today is your Grandma Wei’s birthday. We’re holding a banquet here. Since you’re alone, why don’t you come with us?”","Wei Ying’s expression changed slightly as soon as he finished speaking. At the thought of her youngest son, who had yet to come out of prison after being sent there by Qiao Nian, she gritted her teeth in hatred. She also thought about her current dire situation. Even the Ye family refused to come, and Qiao Nian had a good relationship with them.","Especially with Ye Wangchuan... Their relationship was not ordinary.","She took a deep breath and thought about the pros and cons. She forced herself to show a ‘kind’ expression and continued, “Yes, you’re already here. Why don’t you go in and we eat together? I’ll get your uncle to arrange a seat for you.”","“There’s no need. I’m here to meet someone.” The face under the hoodie was exquisite and violent. Her sharp black eyes looked at Wei Ying and she asked concisely, “Do you know Ji Qing?”","Wei Ying’s expression changed drastically. She immediately frowned, and her attitude changed 180 degrees. She said coldly, “Qiao Nian, today is my birthday party. Don’t cause trouble here.”","Qiao Nian didn’t waste any time. She took out her phone from her pocket and played a conversation she had intercepted from the black box in front of her.","Wei Ying’s name was mentioned.","The recording was not long, only about ten seconds.","However, Wei Ying’s reaction was intense. At first, she wanted to act like an elder, but when she heard the recording, her expression changed drastically. She asked her sternly, “Where did you get this recording?”","It was fine if she asked a question, but she even wanted to snatch the phone.","Qiao Nian put away her phone and asked calmly, “You know Ji Qing?”","Shen Jingyan didn’t understand what was going on at all. In a dilemma, he turned to ask Wei Ying, “Mom, what was that recording just now? Was the person they were talking about you?”","Wei Ying didn’t say anything, but her expression was still ugly. She couldn’t hide her ruthlessness when looking at Qiao Nian.","Seeing her reaction, Shen Jingyan was basically certain that the “Wei Ying” mentioned in the recording was his mother-in-law.","He rubbed his temples and tried to smooth things over helplessly. “Nian Nian, are you talking to the wrong person? There are so many people with the same name outside. They might not be talking about your Grandma Wei. Perhaps it’s someone with the same name.”","Qiao Nian’s gaze was annoyed as she raised her eyes.","She wanted to question the Wei family ever since she received the recording from the black box.","However, she was busy going around the city to get something, so she pushed this matter back until now."]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 So What If I Turn the Sky Upside Down!","paragraphs":["1654 So What If I Turn the Sky Upside Down!","She did not come to look for Wei Ying today to get the inside story from her. She knew that Wei Ying would definitely not say anything.","She was just here to confirm it!","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened, and the corners of her lips curled up. Her hostility was quite strong. Looking at the silent person, she was basically certain that Wei Ying had something to do with her mother’s death.","At the very least, she was involved.","!!","As for how much insider information there was, she would only find out when she went to the Independent Continent to meet the Ji family.","“Alright, I know the answer.” Qiao Nian had achieved her goal of coming here. Not wasting her breath on Wei Ying and the others, she retracted her gaze casually and said in a low voice, “I’ll investigate the connection and the meaning of what they said in this recording.”","Wei Ying watched as she was about to leave.","Anxious and flustered, and unable to hold it in anymore, she called out to her in a heavier tone, “Qiao Nian, are you trying to turn the sky upside down?!”","The girl didn’t even look back. She only stopped in her tracks and spoke disdainfully and arrogantly. “Pfft, so what if I turn the sky upside down!”","She wanted to see how powerful the Independent Continent was.","The Ji family of the Independent Continent could not be provoked.","She wanted to flip over the ‘sky’ that they thought could cover things up and see what secrets were hidden!","The girl walked away without looking back.","Wei Ying’s face was pale as she stood rooted to the ground. Anyone with a discerning eye could tell that she was burning with anxiety.","“Mom, what’s going on? Ji Qing? I remember that this is Nian Nian’s biological mother? What’s up with her? Do you know her?”","There was no family with the surname Ji in the capital, and he had never heard of a Ji Qing.","However, from his mother-in-law’s reaction, it seemed that this Ji Qing’s background was extraordinary. At the very least, not any small family could evoke such a reaction from her.","But the Ji family?","Was there such a family in Beijing?","Shen Jingyan felt a headache coming on. “You and Nian Nian—”","“Don’t listen to her nonsense. She can’t find anything!” Wei Ying was still immersed in her own thoughts, and she spoke quickly and anxiously. Her tone was heavy, and her eyelids twitched. “What kind of place does she think the Independent—”","Halfway through her sentence, she realized that she had almost let it slip.","She swallowed her words and shut up.","What she wanted to say was: What kind of place does Qiao Nian think the Independent Continent is? Does she think anyone can go and investigate as she pleases? Qiao Nian doesn’t even have the right to go to the Independent Continent! How can she investigate Ji Qing, the Ji family, and the things she was involved in in the past?!","“Independent... what?” Shen Jingyan waited for a long time, but she didn’t continue. He couldn’t help but ask her again.","However, Wei Ying’s face was cold and she was unwilling to say anything more. “It’s nothing. I’m just saying that she’s so young. She’ll suffer a huge loss one day if she continues to be so arrogant!”","Shen Jingyan didn’t comment on her words. He looked in the direction the girl had left and couldn’t come back to his senses for a long time.","He had thought of this before and even said something similar to Wei Ying.","In the end, reality slapped him hard a few times.","Qiao Chen was ruined.","The Qiao family was ruined too.","Even Qiao Chen whom he chose back then was now stuck in Beijing!","Would he still be like this now if he had chosen Qiao Nian back then?","Shen Jingyan’s mind raced. He had asked himself this question countless times. Every time he thought of this, he regretted it dearly. He wished there was a cure for regret in the world.","Otherwise, he would have been like Wei Lou or Yuan Yongqin.","He wouldn’t be standing on Wei Ying’s broken ship that was about to collapse and sink with her."]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 Some People Are Destined to Shine","paragraphs":["1655 Some People Are Destined to Shine","No matter what Shen Jingyan thought, Qiao Nian had already left the Imperial Mansion. After she left, she wasn’t in a hurry to return to the Rhine Apartments. Instead, she called Nie Mi and went to Qing University.","She had not been to Qing University in a long time. It was still the same and full of vitality.","The campus was filled with youthful university students carrying books. They walked together in groups of threes and fours, chatting about which professor’s class they chose and which professor was giving an exam today...","Qiao Nian put on her earphones and lowered the brim of her cap. Her goal was clear as she walked towards the principal’s office.","She kept a low profile.","However, her aura was too strong.","Along the way, many people noticed her.","Everyone at Qing University knew that there was an amazing freshman this year. In just half a year, she won first place in two international competitions—the Medical Competition and the World Software Competition. She defeated many famous overseas contestants and brought glory to the country.","Moreover, this newcomer was especially good-looking.","Qing University’s forum regarded this first-year junior as a godly beauty. From first-year to fourth-year students, and even to the research institute, everyone acknowledged this new student as the campus belle.","Moreover, she was an academic researcher and rock musician. Recently, she had even shown a hand in restoring cultural relics on a variety show...","Therefore, Qiao Nian was very popular at Qing University.","She had already kept a low profile, but people still stopped on the way and pointed at her.","“Could that be... Qiao Nian?”","“F*ck, God Qiao has returned to school?”","“Why didn’t anyone from the Traditional Chinese Medicine Department say that Elder Huang has a class today?”","“I don’t think so.”","“Then why did God Qiao return to Qing University?”","The boys from Dorm 3306 also heard people talking on the way back from the basketball court. Zhou Yang held the basketball as he bumped Wen Ziyu with his hand.","“Young Master Wen, I heard your goddess’s name. She seems to have returned to school.”","Wen Ziyu only went to Wei Ying’s birthday banquet to show his face.","He found an excuse to slip away as soon as Qiao Nian left.","He had just arrived at school.","There was no need for Zhou Yang to say anything. Wen Ziyu could already see the girl’s back view not far away. Her back view was memorable.","“Aren’t you going to catch up and chat with her?” Zhou Yang also saw Qiao Nian not far ahead and was quite excited. He elbowed Wen Ziyu’s arm again and urged him.","Wen Ziyu didn’t move, his handsome face briefly hesitating before calming down.","He snatched the basketball from Zhou Yang, hooked his arms around his neck, and dragged him to the basketball court. “Let’s go, play a game with me!”","Zhou Yang was still thinking about Qiao Nian, who was not far away. As he was dragged back by him, he said, “Your goddess is just ahead. If you miss her, who knows when you will see her again? Don’t you usually care about your goddess’s status the most? You’re the most active on Weibo. You don’t even go up to greet her. How are you going to chase a girl like this?”","“Chase my ass!”","“Don’t you like—”","“Who said that I have to chase her just because I like her!”","Wen Ziyu raised his eyebrows. Without another word, he pulled him onto the field.","“Play ball! Play ball!”","Seeing that he was really not chasing after her, Zhou Yang rubbed his nose and followed him to the court to vent his anger.","Halfway through, Wen Ziyu suddenly stopped. He turned around and looked at the back of the girl who was walking further and further away. After taking a deep look, he turned back and hugged the basketball with both hands, walking steadily.","Some people were destined to shine. When she was close to you, you would be attracted by her radiance."]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 I’ve Decided, I Agree to Go to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1656 I’ve Decided, I Agree to Go to the Independent Continent","But she was in a world you could never touch.","Qiao Nian was such a person!","Wen Ziyu took a deep breath, and his heavy heart became relaxed once more.","No matter what, even if he could never become someone from that world, he was attracted by that brilliance and followed it. In the end, he would become a better version of himself!","...","In the principal’s office.","Nie Mi had been waiting for a long time.","He immediately put down his teacup and stood up when he saw the girl knocking on the door. “You’re here?”","“Yeah.”","Qiao Nian entered after knocking on the door politely.","Liang Conglin, Shen Yugui, and the others were all there. There were also a few unfamiliar faces that Qiao Nian did not recognize. They were probably from the research institute.","Everyone looked in her direction.","Qiao Nian greeted them politely. “Principal Liang. Hello, teachers.”","Her aura was quite restrained.","However, all the teachers at Qing University knew her.","Even though she had tried her best to restrain her aura, everyone could still feel it.","She was wild and arrogant.","“...I came over to say that I’ve thought about the previous matter.” The girl’s voice was soothing and had the power to calm people down.","Nie Mi’s eyes lit up. He saw hope. “Nian Nian, have you thought it through? You...”","“Yes.” Qiao Nian didn’t beat around the bush and said concisely, “I’ve thought about it. I’m willing to go to the Independent Continent.”","She wanted to go to the Independent Continent, but it was not appropriate for her to go as part of the Red Alliance or a diamond merchant from the illegal zone.","Those two identities were too high-profile.","Countless eyes would immediately target her the moment she arrived at the Independent Continent if she used those two identities. It would be inconvenient for her to do what she wanted.","Therefore, following Nie Mi and the others was the best choice.","“That’s great!” Nie Mi was overjoyed.","Liang Conglin also revealed an obvious smile. “It’s good that you’re willing to go. It’s good that you’re willing to go. Elder Nie and I were worried that you wouldn’t be willing.”","“Then, I’ll contact Master Cheng and tell him that you’ve decided.” Liang Conglin paced back and forth, clapping his hands again, then asked Qiao Nina as if remembering something.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were calm as she nodded. “Okay.”","Liang Conglin beamed and quickly went to make the call.","Nie Mi pulled her aside and asked, “Nian Nian, why did you suddenly decide to go? I thought...”","He had thought that she would make the decision when the agreed time approached.","Who knew that it was brought forward by more than a week?","“I have something to do.” Qiao Nian didn’t hide it from him, but she didn’t say it too clearly. “By the way, do I need to prepare anything in advance?”","Nie Mi was curious about what she had to do. Then, he came back to his senses and said, “You don’t have to prepare anything specifically. Hmm... Prepare a few sets of clothes and some daily necessities for going out. Just make it simple. The hotel in the Independent Continent should have prepared other things such as toothpaste and toothbrushes. You be the judge. Do you want to bring a set? It’s fine if you don’t. They definitely have them over there!”","Qiao Nian nodded, seemingly listening attentively.","Nie Mi’s gaze was gentle as he continued, “In the past, we mainly went there to negotiate some scientific research authority issues. There will be a few banquets after this negotiation meeting. The attendees are all forces from the Independent Continent. You don’t have to worry about the negotiations. Master Cheng and I will do as we see fit.”"]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 No One to Pick Up","paragraphs":["1657 No One to Pick Up","“The main reason I want you to go this time is to introduce you to the people from the Independent Continent. This will help you in the future.”","Qiao Nian looked calm. “Mm.”","Nie Mi patted her shoulder and looked at her lovingly as he continued, “Of course, you don’t have to worry too much. Master Cheng, your father, and I will definitely protect you. It’s not that scary over there. They don’t eat people there, haha.”","He was worried that Qiao Nian would be under too much pressure, so he teased her.","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids. She didn’t feel as pressured as he imagined. She placed her hand in her pocket and said casually, “I know.”","“Huh? You know?” Nie Mi was confused by her calmness.","Qiao Nian didn’t let him probe further. She changed the topic. “Other than that, do I need to prepare any identity information?”","“Ah, right, right, right.” Nie Mi finally remembered and smiled. “I would have forgotten if you hadn’t mentioned this. Wait a moment.”","He ran over to get a form and handed it to her. “Fill out this form when you have time. We have to hand it over to the Independent Continent for review.”","Qiao Nian skimmed through the form. It requested detailed personal information, home address, and upbringing.","Seeing that she was checking out the form, Nie Mi relaxed his eyebrows and said, “You don’t have to worry too much. The main thing is for you to fill in your basic information. The Independent Continent is very strict. Not everyone can go there. They don’t want irrelevant people to sneak in.”","As he spoke, Qiao Nian had already finished reading the contents of the form. She had a rough idea of what it was. She put it away and said, “I understand. I’ll fill it out for you in two days.”","“There’s no hurry.” Nie Mi smiled and waved his hand. He didn’t rush her. “You grew up in Rao City, so there’s nothing for them to investigate. I asked you to fill in this form just to go through the process. The Independent Continent should approve it directly.”","“Yes.”","Qiao Nian wasn’t too worried that the Independent Continent wouldn’t approve it.","Her information had long been wiped clean by her. No one could find out anything unnecessary that she didn’t want others to know.","She was confident.","It would be the same on the Independent Continent’s side.","They wouldn’t be able to find anything she didn’t want them to know!","Her profile would only be clean and simple.","...","Qiao Nian didn’t stay at Qing University for long. Not long after she got her things, she received a call from Ye Wangchuan.","“Oh? I’m not at the airport. I took a different flight and arrived early. Now?” She walked to the side to answer the call. She looked up at the people in the office and raised her hand lazily. “I’m at school. I have something to do.”","“Are you done?”","The voice on the other end of the phone was low and slightly hoarse. It was very pleasant to the ears.","Qiao Nian’s ears almost got pregnant. She couldn’t help but raise her eyebrows, her black eyes clear and calm. “Almost.”","She looked at Nie Mi, who was still communicating with Liang Conglin, and said, “There’s one last thing left to do. Half an hour at most.”","“I’ll come and pick you up.” After all, there was no one at the airport for him to pick up.","Before Qiao Nian could speak, the male voice on the other end of the phone said unhurriedly, “Grandpa was afraid that you hadn’t eaten lunch, so he booked a private room at the Imperial Mansion. They’ve already gone over.”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes, her brows gradually relaxing. She raised her hand and rubbed her temples. “Then come and pick me up. I’m looking for Grandpa Ye.”"]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 Sister Nian: Ignore Her","paragraphs":["1658 Sister Nian: Ignore Her","She had brought the old master a newly modified pill. It was a local specialty from Rao City and the kind that had no packaging.","There were exactly two bottles.","If Ye Wangchuan didn’t come to look for her, she would go to look for Old Master Ye.","She wanted to give the pills to the old master.","Coincidentally, the old master had booked a room at the Imperial Mansion, so she could pass the bottles to him during the meal.","“Wait for me.”","There was something seductive about those words.","Qiao Nian’s ears felt a little hot. She mumbled something and hung up.","...","It took him about half an hour to drive from the airport to Qing University.","He sent Qiao Nian a WeChat message when he arrived.","Coincidentally, Liang Conglin and the others had also spoken to Master Cheng.","Seeing that it was about time, Qiao Nian informed Nie Mi. She took the form and left the school.","After Ye Wangchuan picked her up, they went to the Imperial Mansion to meet Old Master Ye.","They had lunch together.","Qiao Nian also gave him the local specialties she had brought for him.","The meal was harmonious and pleasant.","After dinner, Old Master Ye wanted to take her to the old residence to take a look. He had even suggested taking her to the mall.","However, he was stopped in time.","When they were about to part ways, Old Master Ye held the girl’s hand reluctantly and kept saying that he would bring her to the old residence to visit next time.","When he said this, he did not forget to glare fiercely at his precious grandson. It could be said that he was very unhappy.","Ye Lan was both angry and amused. She had been trying to smooth things over, saying that Qiao Nian had just returned and needed to rest. Only then did Old Master Ye reluctantly let her go.","Back at Rhine Apartments.","Qiao Nian first went upstairs to take a shower. After changing into a set of clean clothes, she pulled out a stool and grabbed the phone charger.","The phone lit up at this moment.","A message from Continent O was received.","With a towel draped over her body, she picked up her phone and looked at it.","It was from the Pharmacy Association.","A text message.","The sender was Zhong Yiliu.","[Zhong Yiliu: The new member of the Pharmacy Association you mentioned to me last time, Jiang Xianrou, got first place in the newcomer assessment. Should I give it to her?]","What he meant was that he knew that she had a conflict with Jiang Xianrou. He was on Qiao Nian’s side.","If Qiao Nian was unwilling to give this opportunity to her, he would definitely not give it to her.","She got first place?","The girl’s eyes were calm, and she looked a little surprised. However, it was only for a moment. She did not take this matter to heart and sent a message.","[Q: Don’t worry about her.]","Zhong Yiliu’s message came immediately.","[Zhong Yiliu: I understand. Then I don’t have to pay special attention to her, right? You specially mentioned her. I thought she was someone important. Alright, I won’t care about her anymore.]","Qiao Nian read through it quickly.","She did not reply.","The fact that Xiang Xianrou had gotten first place in the newcomer assessment was indeed a little out of her expectations, but it had nothing to do with her.","She was now focused on the Independent Continent’s Ji Family.","As long as Jiang Xianrou did not cause trouble for her, she couldn’t be bothered with what she was doing.","Qiao Nian put her phone to charge. She pulled out a stool and sat down, then took out her notebook from her bag, turned on her computer, and erased the information related to her online again..."]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 What a Coincidence, I’m Going Away Too","paragraphs":["1659 What a Coincidence, I’m Going Away Too","Qiao Nian’s slender fingers had just hit the final Enter button on the keyboard when she leaned back in her chair and waited for the computer to update.","The digital code on her notebook kept refreshing.","The progress bar was also moving forward.","Qiao Nian picked up the mineral water bottle on the table. She unscrewed the cap and took a sip. Her gaze was still on the computer, waiting for the information related to her in the database to be modified...","!!","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and put down the bottle lazily. “Come in!”","Ye Wangchuan came in with a glass of milk. When he saw the girl sitting there playing with the computer without drying her hair after taking a shower, he couldn’t help but smile. He walked over and placed the glass on her table. “Gu San heated a glass of milk for you. I brought it here for you.”","“Ah.” Qiao Nian’s head hurt again when she saw the milk in the glass. She reached out and pressed her temples, looking irritable, but she didn’t say that she wouldn’t drink it. “I’ll drink it later.”","His gaze was as dark as ink as he glanced at her laptop and saw the progress bar being refreshed. He pursed his thin lips but didn’t ask her what she was doing.","He remembered something. After putting down the milk, he leaned against the side and said, “I’m going away in a few days.”","Qiao Nian looked up at him in surprise.","He looked at her. “I’ll be gone for a long time this time. If everything goes well, I might be back in three to five days. If things don’t go well, I might not be back for ten days to half a month. Are you afraid of being alone at home? Why don’t I ask Aunt bring Chen Chen over to accompany you? Chen Chen has wanted to come over for a long time. His final reconstruction has been completed. He’s definitely willing.”","Qiao Nian recalled that she had promised Ye Lan to let Chen Chen move in. In the end, she had been so busy outside every day and rarely returned to the apartment.","The matter of Chen Chen moving in had to be postponed.","“I’m going away too.” Qiao Nian didn’t feel good, but she did have to travel. She couldn’t ask the little guy to stay with her. “Let’s talk when I come back.”","“You’re going away too?” Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows.","Qiao Nian nodded and didn’t hide anything from him. “I’m going to check the recording in the black box, so I’ll be out for a few days.","“The timing is about the same as yours. If it goes well, it will take three to five days. If it doesn’t, it might take ten days to half a month.”","She had not asked Nie Mi how long they would be gone this time, but she guessed that it would not be long. It would be between one and two weeks.","After all, outsiders were not allowed to stay there for too long.","Qiao Nian rested her chin on her pale hand and said casually, “I won’t know the details until I get there.”","“Do you want Gu San to go with you?” He hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to leave at the same time as him.","However, he had never thought that she would go to the Independent Continent. He had thought that Qiao Nian would go to the plane crash site to investigate the details.","Originally, he had wanted to bring Gu San to the Independent Continent, but... he was worried about Qiao Nian being alone.","“Or I can get Qin Si to accompany you.”","He wouldn’t be in Beijing, so Bo Jingxing had to stay in Beijing to keep an eye on the Ninth Branch. Otherwise, the Ninth Branch would be in chaos.","Qin Si was free.","He played games at home all day and happened to be free.","This time, Qiao Nian was going away with Liang Conglin, Nie Mi, and the others. She was the one who had been chosen to see the world. How could she bring anyone else?","She rejected his kindness without thinking. “No need. I’ll go with Elder Nie.”"]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 You’re 19? Nominal Age of 20?","paragraphs":["1660 You’re 19? Nominal Age of 20?","He frowned and looked at her with his deep eyes. He did not understand how this matter was related to Nie Mi.","However, he relaxed a little since someone was with her. “Alright, call Qin Si if there’s anything. That person is at home every day. He’s either playing games or going out to the Lan Pavilion to play. He doesn’t have anything important to do. Call him if you need him.”","“Yes,” Qiao Nian replied.","The progress bar on her computer finally reached 100% at this moment.","!!","Qiao Nian saw it from the corner of her eye and reached out to type another code.","She wanted to erase all the information related to the Red Alliance’s Sun on the Internet again so that the Independent Continent would not find any clues. It was troublesome!","Ye Wangchuan looked at the girl’s beautiful side profile. The white light shone on her face, making her skin look even fairer and more eye-catching.","His gaze gradually softened, and he suddenly whispered to the girl, “I remember that your birthday is in August?”","“Huh?” The girl was focused on the computer and didn’t listen to him seriously. Her voice rose at the end, and she clearly wasn’t in the mood to respond.","Then, she realized something and stopped what she was doing. She turned around and looked at the man. This time, she clearly reacted. “Yes.”","Qiao Weimin said that her birthday was on August 18th.","Many people would come on that date.","“What happened?”","Qiao Nian was confused. She didn’t know why he had brought up her birthday.","However, although she was asking a question, her gaze had already subconsciously shifted to the computer code. She lowered her eyelashes as if she was thinking about what information she should change for herself.","Sun, male?","Height...","Her fair hand paused on the keyboard as she fell into deep thought. After a while, she casually tapped the keyboard a few times.","The information about Sun on the Internet became—Sun: male, 1.60m tall, slightly plump, square face, in his 40s, no photos.","She hid this information in the Red Alliance’s database. In addition, she tampered with the Hacker Alliance’s database and changed it to information that was similar to what she had just made up. She only changed her height slightly.","She changed the height of 1.60m stated in the Red Alliance to about 1.58m.","This man could be considered very ‘special’.","Ordinary people would definitely notice his height when they saw this message, so it was easy for them to ignore other things.","Qiao Nian pressed the Enter key and shamelessly pasted her current editing into the information bank.","She typed codes.","These codes were translated into text that was displayed.","However, it was basically impossible to tell what she was doing.","When he saw the string of complicated codes pouring out, he immediately understood what Qiao Nian had done.","His thin lips curled up slightly, but his eyes were filled with love. He did not ask her why she was changing the information. He crossed his arms and lowered his black eyelashes. With his eyes half-closed, he said, “You’ll be 19 this year. Your nominal age will be 20.”","Qiao Nian had just copied and pasted the things she had made up. She turned around and raised her eyebrows in confusion when she heard what he said. “Huh? So?”","So what if her nominal age was 20?","He seemed to know what she was thinking and smiled. The chuckle that came out of his throat was seductive, and his eyes were deep. “There’s still a year to go. When you turn 20, many things will be legal for you.”","“For example? What’s legal?” Qiao Nian hadn’t thought of the legal age of marriage yet. She thought he was talking about the legal age of an adult."]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 I Heard That There’s a Spot to Visit the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1661 I Heard That There’s a Spot to Visit the Independent Continent","He glanced at her moist lips and paused for a moment. However, he did not say it explicitly. He only said, “It’s nothing. You’ll know in the future.”","Qiao Nian found him inexplicable. He only spoke halfway, and when she asked him, he was so mysterious that he refused to explain clearly.","She was not someone who liked to dwell on things. Ye Wangchuan had only said half of it, and she was too lazy to investigate the rest.","“Oh,” she replied readily. “Then we’ll talk about it later!”","!!","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were deep. Seeing that the girl was defenseless, his smile deepened. He took the towel and straightened her shoulders. “Sit down. I’ll dry your hair for you. It’s easy to catch a cold with wet hair.”","Qiao Nian had rarely been taken care of like this. She was also used to taking care of herself alone. Her shoulders stiffened, but she didn’t move. “Mm.”","He wiped the water droplets on her hair and said, “Remember to drink that glass of milk.”","A little tired from his gentle drying of her hair, Qiao Nian narrowed her sleepy eyes and responded lazily, not wanting to move.","She did not move.","She didn’t really want to drink it.","However, he was still thinking about her age. He urged her softly, “Be good. Get up and drink a little. Just a little. You’re still growing. You don’t have to drink it next year.”","He mentioned next year again. She wanted to ask him what was going on next year, but she was so sleepy that she soon forgot about it.","Although she was reluctant, she reached for the glass of milk and casually drank half of it.","* * *","The Jiang family.","Over the past few days, the house had been busy with the moving process. Things were piled up everywhere in the four-story villa. It was a mess.","“Xianrou, your assessment results for the Pharmacy Association are out? How is it?” Tang Wanru video-called Jiang Xianrou as she sat on the sofa in the living room.","Jiang Xianrou had just come down from the second floor when he heard her cheerful voice.","“It’s okay. I got first place.”","“You got first place?!” Tang Wanru stood up and danced excitedly. She was even happier than her daughter. “That’s great. I knew you could do it. You’re the best.”","She saw Jiang Yao coming downstairs from the corner of her eye. She couldn’t stop smiling and called out, “Jiang Yao, come over quickly. Your sister got first place in the Pharmacy Association’s assessment this time. Do you want to say a few words to her?”","In the past, Jiang Yao would definitely congratulate her and encourage her to continue working hard.","However, he was exceptionally cold this time. He walked straight towards the entrance and said, “You can continue chatting. I’m gonna see Jiang Li.”","Tang Wanru’s eyelids twitched. She wanted to reprimand him, but she was still on a video call with her daughter and could not speak.","She could only watch as the young man left the house.","Naturally, Jiang Xianrou heard their conversation. She had just come out of the Pharmacy Association and was walking towards the dormitory. Her happy expression turned cold, but she was still calm. “Is Brother angry with me?”","“Don’t worry about him. He has a bad temper. He’s probably in a bad mood because things didn’t go well with Tian Chen. It has nothing to do with you. Don’t think too much.”","Tang Wanru was unhappy and changed the topic. “By the way, I heard the country has a spot to go to the Independent Continent this time. I wonder who will get it.”"]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 The Calm God, Sister Nian!","paragraphs":["1662 The Calm God, Sister Nian!","“If you had known earlier, you wouldn’t have been in such a hurry to go to the Pharmacy Association. You could have used other connections to get this chance to go to the Independent Continent.”","She was quite regretful.","However, she had already let it go. “I’m fine now. I’ve thought about it carefully. So what if I go to the Independent Continent this time? I’ll just get to know a few people with Dean Zhong and the others. Then? Nothing will change after that.","“Previously, we got to know the Qi family and Qi Yan. But what happened in the end? We were still restricted and controlled by others. It’s not a long-term thing.","“I don’t want to muddle forever! I can only become stronger and seize all the opportunities and fate by myself.”","Tang Wanru did not expect her to say this. She was a little stunned and touched. “Xianrou...”","She actually did not expect the Qi family’s matter to have such a huge impact on her daughter.","“I’m sorry.” Tang Wanru felt a little guilty. “... Otherwise, you could have gone to the Independent Continent.”","It was mainly because that person’s attitude was so vague.","If that person was willing to help, so what if Qiao Nian knew Zhong Yiliu and had a good relationship with him?","They couldn’t stop Jiang Xianrou from going to the Independent Continent!","She said indifferently, “I don’t care if I go to the Independent Continent anymore. I already have a better goal now.”","“You...” Tang Wanru wanted to ask her what her goal was.","However, Jiang Xianrou did not intend to tell her. “Mom, I’ll tell you about this later. In short, it won’t affect anything even if I don’t go to the Independent Continent!","“I will only become stronger and stronger in the future. I don’t need to rely on anyone, and they won’t dare to underestimate me.”","* * *","In the next few days, Qiao Nian was busy preparing to go to the Independent Continent.","Ye Wangchuan seemed to be very busy too.","Qiao Nian realized that many unfamiliar faces had come to look for him recently.","All of them had a murderous aura that was completely different from the people who led a comfortable life in the capital. They were like sharp knives that were frozen in ice!","It was obvious that they were not from Beijing.","She didn’t care too much and didn’t ask who those people were.","However, when Qiao Nian passed by the living room once, she heard him call out one of their names. It seemed to be Mo Dong.","She had some impression of this name.","There was such a person in the illegal zone.","However, he had no conflict with the Red Alliance, and she had not specially investigated his background. However, he should be the same as Ji Lin, whom she had met in Country M. He was also one of Ye Wangchuan’s subordinates. There was a high chance that he was related to Bright Gate, which she had investigated the previous time.","No one in the capital knew about Ye Wangchuan’s relationship with Bright Gate.","Aunt Ye and Old Master Ye probably didn’t know about this. Qiao Nian guessed that this was one of his forces overseas.","As for whether he had any other forces other than the Bright Gate?","Qiao Nian wasn’t sure, nor did she want to find out.","In any case, since he had called these people here, he definitely had no intention of hiding anything from her. If she asked, he would definitely tell her.","However, Qiao Nian didn’t ask.","It was unnecessary.","She had a lot of aliases before, so she had no right to ask him about this.","Over the past few days, Qiao Nian watched the men in black enter and exit the apartment. They basically pretended not to see her. They were very ‘sensible’.","Every time she passed by them to get water, it was like she had the words ‘I can’t see, you guys chat’ on her forehead."]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 Miss Qiao Knows Many People","paragraphs":["1663 Miss Qiao Knows Many People","On the other hand, the young man in the living room, who was covered in wind and frost, had seen the girl coming down to get something several times.","This time, he finally couldn’t help but look at the girl’s lazy back. He lowered his voice and asked, “Is that Miss Qiao that Ji Lin mentioned before? She knows someone from the Pharmacy Association? She even had a conflict with Qi Yan from Country M?”","He was slightly taller than Gu San, and the scar on his face was very eye-catching.","However, he looked dignified and solemn. His entire body emitted a bloodthirsty aura. His face was not too disfigured by the scar. Instead, it made him different from other men in the capital.","Gu San was very respectful to him and made him a cup of tea.","He had just put down the teacup when he heard his question. He turned to look at Qiao Nian, who had opened the fridge door and was casually taking water. Without waiting for Ye Wangchuan to speak, he said, “Miss Qiao knows quite a lot of people.”","Mo Dong raised his eyebrows and looked in the girl’s direction in disbelief.","He looked her up and down. No matter how he looked at her, he felt that she was just an ordinary person. There was nothing special about her.","Mo Dong retracted his gaze and simply ignored Qiao Nian. He crossed his legs on the other side of the sofa and rested them on the coffee table and then said in a low voice, “We’ve already found out who stole the Ye family’s goods this time. It’s a small gang. They don’t seem to have any background at first glance. The Independent Continent is filled with such small groups of outlaws. They often rob and intercept goods.","“But while they’re a motley crew, they’re not completely brainless.","“At most, they’ll snatch things from small families with no background or merchants who go to the Independent Continent to start businesses. They won’t touch families they can’t afford to offend.”","Mo Dong was annoyed for no reason. He picked up his tea. “Their behavior was very strange this time. I caught one of them. That small fry insisted that they didn’t know that they were snatching the Ye family’s goods. They thought that it was a small businessman’s goods... But the Ye family’s goods are rare materials, and the Ye family’s logo was on them. They insisted that they didn’t know. They were just talking nonsense to me~!”","Ye Wangchuan remained calm.","His gaze was not on him, but on the girl getting water from the fridge not far away.","He saw the girl take out a bottle of cold water from the fridge with ease. He raised his eyebrows, his eyes burning. “Nian Nian, have you forgotten what I told you a few days ago?”","The girl stopped twisting the lid and looked over impatiently.","He was in a good mood. “You can’t drink cold water for the next few days. I put some water at room temperature in the pantry for you. Drink that first.”","Mo Dong still had a stomach full of unfinished words. His eyelids twitched and he looked in the girl’s direction upon seeing that Master Wang was not listening to him.","“Be good, hold on a little longer.” He raised his thin lips and coaxed her.","After a moment of silence, the girl put the ice water back on the fridge and grabbed the normal-temperature mineral water. Then, she went upstairs.","He watched the girl go up to the second floor before slowly looking away. He leaned towards Mo Dong, who was already speechless, and asked lazily, “Where’s Wang Fei? Did you find him?”","Mo Dong didn’t react for a moment. Then, he shook his head and said solemnly, “No. I don’t know where Wang Fei went. The goods we found don’t match up, either. More than half of them are missing!”"]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 Someone Else’s Behind This","paragraphs":["1664 Someone Else’s Behind This","A chuckle escaped his throat as if he’d expected it. He didn’t comment. “Someone else’s behind this.”","Rare earth elements were not an ordinary resource.","The Ye Family’s influence was not present on the Independent Continent, but there had always been rare earth goods supplied and traded on the Independent Continent. It could be considered a part of the Ye Family’s underground influence.","This part of the business had always been managed by Old Master Ye, with the help of a few relatives.","!!","He usually did not care about this matter.","Now, the Ye family was busy investigating the theft of the goods, but they were not as fast as him. He had already found some of the goods in just a few days.","However, there was still no news of the remaining items and people.","“I also know that there’s probably someone behind this, but those people are each more tight-lipped than the other. I suspect that they’re all stupid and have been used by someone else! They don’t know the identity of the person who instigated them at all! This is the most troublesome thing. It’s equivalent to the clues we’ve painstakingly found being cut off again.” Mo Dong frowned irritably.","Ye Wangchuan crossed his legs and rested his hands on his lap, tapping his fingers irregularly. He grunted but didn’t say anything immediately. He seemed to be thinking about something.","Not daring to disturb him, Mo Dong shut his mouth again and took a sip of tea.","The green tea that Gu San had brewed for him was strong. It tasted a little astringent in his mouth, but it was sweet again when it rolled down his throat.","Mo Dong had not drunk tea from his hometown for a long time. His brows slowly relaxed. Seeing that Ye Wangchuan was still thinking, he put down the cup and said, “Master Wang, why don’t we look for the Red Alliance? They’re good at tracking. We’ll find the rest of the goods as long as we find where Wang Fei is.”","“The Red Alliance isn’t free recently.” The man’s voice was light.","Mo Dong was dumbfounded. “How do you know that the Red Alliance isn’t free?”","He glanced at him and said calmly, “I just know. The Red Alliance won’t be free for the next two weeks, and I don’t want to involve them in this.”","Mo Dong was speechless.","His eyelids twitched a few times, and the scar-faced man was filled with confusion. He wanted to say, “Master Wang, why do you sound like we’re married to the Red Alliance? You’re even protecting them.”","However, he felt that this thought of his was quite perverted.","It was said that the boss of the Red Alliance, Sun, was a man. He was a middle-aged man in his forties. Him and Master Wang... Mo Dong looked at the noble and lazy young man not far away and felt even more disgusted. He was ashamed of the perverted thoughts in his mind just now.","“Since you can’t find out, I’ll go to the Independent Continent tomorrow,” Ye Wangchuan said concisely, not knowing what he was thinking.","Mo Dong immediately replied, “Okay. I’ll tell the others to get ready.”","...","Over the past few days, Mo Dong ran back from the Independent Continent because of the robbery of the Ye family’s goods. He had discussed the Independent Continent with Ye Wangchuan and left in a hurry, preparing to arrange the trip to the Independent Continent.","The Independent Continent had been quite lively recently.","All the forces would gather there, and there would be several banquets.","He had to be even more careful with such a complicated time. He needed to make proper arrangements for Master Wang’s trip to the Independent Continent.","Gu San sent him out.","Mo Dong walked to the elevator door and pressed the button.","He thought of the girl again and couldn’t help but ask Gu San curiously, “Is Miss Qiao Master Wang’s girlfriend?”"]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 Thinking That Big Boss Would Find Someone From His World","paragraphs":["1665 Thinking That Big Boss Would Find Someone From His World","Gu San nodded. “Yes.”","He then asked him, “What’s wrong with Miss Qiao being Master Wang’s girlfriend?”","Mo Dong’s expression was indescribable, but as a man, he could not do something like gossip behind people’s backs. He only shook his head with a regretful expression. “I’m just asking.”","He had always thought that someone like Master Wang would definitely find someone of equal social status who he could walk side by side with.","Unexpectedly, he found a 19-year-old student.","Mo Dong did not say that in his eyes, the two of them were more or less not compatible. Ordinary people like Miss Qiao would most likely never understand Master Wang’s world. He did not know why Master Wang had fallen in love with an ordinary student.","Coincidentally, the elevator arrived at this moment.","Mo Dong shook off his doubts, bid farewell to Gu San, and left in a hurry.","* * *","The following day.","Nie Mi contacted Qiao Nian at eleven in the afternoon and said that they had changed the time at the last minute. They were going to the Independent Continent a day earlier.","Qiao Nian didn’t have much luggage, so it didn’t take her long to pack. She arrived at the airport terminal in about an hour.","She was early.","Nie Mi and Liang Conglin had yet to arrive.","Only a few people from the research institute came, including Jiang Zongjin.","When the middle-aged man saw Qiao Nian coming over with only a school bag in her hand, he immediately stopped talking to the person beside him and went up to help the girl carry her things.","Qiao Nian was used to doing things herself. She didn’t ask him to help her. Instead, she calmly slung her bag over her shoulder.","Jiang Zongjin estimated that her bag was light. Perhaps she did not even have many clothes in it. He felt guilty when he thought about how his niece always carried many bags when she went out. He tugged a corner of his clothes, unable to raise his head. “It’s all Dad’s fault for being too busy these few days. I should have bought you a few clothes and helped you prepare your luggage. In the end, I didn’t do anything. You often have to worry about me.”","He had a lot of things to do in the research institute. There were many things that he had to do personally.","Even if he did not do it personally, he had to at least be present to command the others. Otherwise, a screw loose could cause irreparable losses to the country during scientific research.","Jiang Zongjin had always wanted to spend time with his daughter, but the project was already in progress. He often felt helpless.","In addition, Qiao Nian didn’t need anyone to take care of her. He didn’t know how to interact with his daughter... The more Jiang Zongjin thought about it, the more guilty he felt. He was too ashamed to face her.","He made up his mind.","After finishing the negotiations on the Independent Continent, he would take leave from the research institute and spend more time with his daughter.","Jiang Zongjin felt a little less upset after deciding. He smiled again and said to Qiao Nian, “So be it. It’s okay. I’ll buy you more when we reach the Independent Continent.”","Qiao Nian had only brought one or two sets of clothes and had never thought of buying more. However, she didn’t refute him.","Jiang Zongjin asked worriedly, “Nian Nian, did you bring your toothbrush?”","“Yes.” The girl’s voice was low and pleasant.","Jiang Zongjin looked at the girl’s beautiful face and felt proud. “I also brought you a set of toiletries. By the way, I also got someone to buy you a set of face wipes. They’re in my suitcase. I’ll give them to you when we get there.”","He knew that Qiao Nian liked simplicity. Jiang Zongjin had seldom seen her with makeup.","He didn’t know how to take care of his daughter, but he had heard his colleagues talk about their daughters in the past. They mentioned what brands of skin care products and what perfumes they liked."]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 Sister Nian Is Heading to the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1666 Sister Nian Is Heading to the Independent Continent","He didn’t buy perfume.","His intuition told him that Qiao Nian didn’t like perfume.","However, this time, he had guessed that Qiao Nian wouldn’t bring face wipes with her. He quietly asked his colleague to tell him the brand that girls liked to use. Then, he ran to the mall to buy a set for Qiao Nian and put it in his suitcase.","He even took out some documents to make space.","Qiao Nian glanced at him. She didn’t say anything, but her eyes darkened. “Okay.”","Nie Mi, Master Cheng, Liang Conglin, and the others arrived as they spoke.","Qiao Nian estimated that about thirteen people were going to the Independent Continent this time. It was a small team, but more people than the last time they went to the illegal zone.","Moreover, they seemed to have a higher status than the people who went to the illegal zone last time.","At least she had never seen these faces on the news.","She had heard that many big researchers hid their identities. She wouldn’t see these people unless it was an important occasion.","The person who came with Master Cheng and the others looked like these kinds of people.","Everyone knew each other.","They greeted each other warmly.","The people who came this time were all dressed plainly. Like Jiang Zongjin, they did not look like they were wearing branded clothes.","They seemed to know her father.","A few people came over to greet Jiang Zongjin. Then, they noticed Qiao Nian and would look back and forth in surprise. They smiled at her when they heard Jiang Zongjin’s introduction.","Qiao Nian was more solitary and cold.","However, she was not a rude person. Basically, when the elders who came to greet Jiang Zongjin smiled and spoke to her, she would answer politely.","Everyone had a good first impression of her.","Someone even asked Nie Mi if Qiao Nian was the young person in the quota for the Independent Continent visit this time.","Nie Mi didn’t reveal too much information about Qiao Nian. He only answered a portion of the questions, addressing them superficially.","He didn’t go into detail.","After everyone was gathered, they were about to set off.","They were taking a private plane this time, so they did not need to go through security checks. Special staff members also helped everyone carry their luggage and lead the way.","Qiao Nian boarded the plane and found a seat in a corner.","Master Cheng had something to say to Jiang Zongjin, so he didn’t come over.","Qiao Nian sat alone in the row. She stretched her legs comfortably and took out her phone from her pocket.","She turned it on and saw there was a signal on the plane. A WeChat message from a certain someone was waiting for her.","[I’m here.]","Qiao Nian glanced at the message and typed a reply.","[QN: I’m preparing to set off too.]","Then, she opened her WeChat Moments and scrolled through them.","Only two of her friends were active.","One was Qin Si.","The moment she clicked on it, the first thing she saw was a screenshot of the game team that Qin Si had sent five minutes ago. He cried on his WeChat Moments again.","The other was Lu Zhi.","His profile picture was quite simple.","“L”.","Still...","Qiao Nian scrolled down and clicked her tongue.","Lu Zhi’s WeChat Moments were filled with corny love words. He maintained the frequency of one post every day and sent different corny love words every day.","Moreover, it was corny to the extent that it hurt one’s eyes.","He was as old-fashioned as an old man next door.","Qiao Nian’s eyes hurt every time she saw it.","She Liked Lu Zhi’s latest post. Then, she turned off her phone and put it aside. Next, she took out an eye mask from her bag and put on her earphones.","She planned to sleep on the plane."]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 Is the Sky Blue? You’re Mine!","paragraphs":["1667 Is the Sky Blue? You’re Mine!","Tian Chen Headquarters.","Jian Jin opened Lu Zhi’s office door with gum in her mouth and gave him an invitation.","“The Independent Continent’s invitation this year has been sent over.”","Halfway through her sentence, her bright eyes saw that the man sitting behind the spacious desk was holding his phone and looking at it. He didn’t even look in her direction.","Jian Jin walked over speechlessly and placed the gilded invitation letter on his desk. She emphasized again, “Boss, the Independent Continent’s invitation letter has been sent over this year! I checked it. The Ji family is holding a banquet this year.”","The handsome and beautiful man finally raised his head. His eyes were bright, and he seemed to be in a good mood.","He placed the phone on the table and smiled happily. “Huh? The Ji family is holding a banquet this year?”","Jian Jin looked at him strangely. After a long time, she asked curiously, “Boss, do you have a fever?”","Lu Zhi was speechless.","“If you don’t have a fever... The Ji family is holding a banquet this year. Why are you so happy?” Jian Jin could tell what he was thinking and complained.","However, complaining was one thing.","She never slacked off when it came to proper business. She immediately said seriously, “In the past, the small families on the Independent Continent would rope in foreign forces and hold one or two banquets. A family like the Jis would never lower their status to participate in such a small matter.","“But they are holding a banquet this year...”","Jian Jin’s brows were tightly knitted together. She felt that the Ji Family’s behavior this time was too abnormal.","She handed the invitation to him. “The Ji Family also invited you. They sent it in advance. This is their invitation.”","The Ji family’s invitation letter was placed together with the Independent Continent pass.","Lu Zhi picked it up nonchalantly and skimmed through it. His eyelashes covered the emotions in his pupils, making him look unpredictable.","Jian Jin was waiting for him to read the invitation when she glanced at his phone on the table from the corner of her eye.","Coincidentally, the phone screen hadn’t dimmed yet.","She saw what Lu Zhi was looking at.","WeChat Moments?","Jian Jin stopped chewing gum. A little surprised, she looked again.","Good lord, she almost vomited!","[L: The sky is blue, the sea is blue, and you are mine.]","“Pfft!”","Luckily, she didn’t spit out the gum.","What kind of circle of friends did he have? These words were too corny. She probably wouldn’t be able to find such romantic words online.","Where did Boss find such... romantic words? He even dared to post them on his WeChat Moments!","Jian Jin noticed that an hour ago, there was a Like on his WeChat Moments.","It was from Qiao Nian.","She gave a thumbs up.","There was nothing else.","It was quite cool.","Jian Jin instantly understood why Lu Zhi was in such a good mood today. The corners of her mouth twitched, and she forced herself to hold back her laughter. She looked at the man looking at the invitation letter. She really wanted to say, “Big boss, you’ve misunderstood. I think Qiao Nian’s ‘Like’ doesn’t mean that she really liked it, but that... you’re so awesome that you hurt her eyes!”","However, she held back her words.","It was especially hard to endure, like resisting the urge to scratch the ears and cheeks.","“Boss, you...”","“Hm?”","Lu Zhi happened to finish reading the invitation letter at this moment. He glanced at the time on the letter and casually placed it on the desk. Then, he tugged at his collar and said nonchalantly, “I definitely have to go to the Ji Family’s banquet. As for other activities in the Independent Continent, I won’t participate.”"]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 First Time in the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1668 First Time in the Independent Continent","All small overseas forces would be discussing the distribution of scientific research authority. There was no need for him to go.","If not for the Ji family’s unusual banquet this year, there was a high chance that he would not have gone to the Independent Continent to join in the fun this time.","“Other than the Ji family’s banquet, help me reject the remaining banquets.”","“Tell them I don’t have time. I’m busy.”","Jian Jin finally snapped out of her thoughts and nodded. “Okay!”","Lu Zhi picked up the phone again. His slender fingers rested on the phone. His fingers were fair and slender, as if he was thinking about something. “Do you think I should bring some specialties back from the Independent Continent this time?”","“Huh?”","A question mark slowly appeared in Jian Jin’s mind.","At the same time, she wondered what specialties there were in the Independent Continent.","Independent Continent’s specialty? Erm... Did gunpowder count?","She immediately realized why Lu Zhi was asking this. Jian Jin’s reaction was huge. She immediately waved her hand. “Don’t. I advise you not to buy special items!”","Lu Zhi glanced at her lightly.","Jian Jin’s expression was indescribable. “Qiao is studying. It’s not convenient for her to accept it.","“I was the one who brought your gift to Qiao last time. If you buy gunpowder, you won’t be able to pass the customs.”","Lu Zhi’s eyes deepened. He didn’t say anything, but he seemed to agree with her words. “There’s nothing special this year. I’ll go a day earlier. Also, help me arrange a trip to the Pharmacy Association.”","“Sure.”","Qiao Nian had hacked all the information about her on the Internet before she set off. Almost no one knew that she had gone to the Independent Continent.","Jian Jin naturally didn’t know that Qiao Nian had gone to the Independent Continent alone with the research team from Qing University.","As for Lu Zhi...","Every year, he would take some time to go to the Pharmacy Association for Zhong Yiliu to take a look at his legs. It was not strange for him to go to the Pharmacy Association before going to the Independent Continent.","Then, Jian Jin left.","Lu Zhi watched her leave before he focused on his phone again. He looked at the Like a few more times seriously.","He logged out of his WeChat and opened a browser to search for the ‘Top 10 Love Words That Will Move Girls’ encyclopedia. Then, he started to choose again.","* * *","More than ten hours later.","Qiao Nian arrived at the Independent Continent.","Along the way, Master Cheng handled various procedures and they passed through various checkpoints.","Qiao Nian followed behind them, keeping a low profile.","They arrived at their hotel as evening approached.","This time, Master Cheng, Nie Mi, and the others went to settle the procedures. Qiao Nian held her bag and stood calmly in a corner, waiting.","At the same time, she took a look at the hotel.","This was her first time coming to the Independent Continent.","The Independent Continent sent an invitation to the Red Alliance every year, but Qiao Nian had never come.","The main reason was that the trip would take at least a week. At that time, she was in high school and time was tight. She also had classes on weekends.","Usually, if there was no reason for her to skip class for a week, the school would criticize her and make her do a reflection speech in the Monday morning reading.","Coupled with the Qiao family’s matters, she did not want to cause trouble or be criticized by Qiao Weimin and Shen Qiongzhi, so she had never been to the Independent Continent.","This was her first time stepping onto the Independent Continent’s territory.","The hotel they were staying at tonight looked even more luxurious than the illegal zone’s.","Including the hotel’s doorman, the other staff were all well-trained people."]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 Meeting a Group of People Similar to Those Who Frequented Rhine","paragraphs":["1669 Meeting a Group of People Similar to Those Who Frequented Rhine","She casually found a corner and waited.","While Qiao Nian was waiting, people arrived one after another. It was obvious that they were also participants in this Independent Continent gathering.","There were about eight people in the other party’s group. They had blonde hair and blue eyes. They looked typical of foreigners, with high noses and deep eyes. They all looked straight ahead when they walked in. They restrained their auras and went to the hotel reception to settle the procedures. The rest of them found a corner to wait like Qiao Nian.","A few of them had a sharp aura that could not be restrained.","The feeling they gave off was a little like those people who often went to Rhine.","They all deliberately restrained their auras to the best of their abilities.","Qiao Nian couldn’t help but take another look at them.","Someone on the other side seemed to have realized that she was looking at him. A pair of sharp eyes immediately looked in her direction.","Qiao Nian was a little surprised by the other party’s sensitivity. She casually looked away and pulled down her cap to cover her face.","...","“What happened?”","Not far away, one of the people Qiao Nian had noticed patted the man’s shoulder and asked.","The first man to notice Qiao Nian looking in their direction slowly retracted his gaze. He frowned slightly and shook his head in confusion. “Nothing. I just realized that someone was looking at us, so I followed their gaze and looked over. In the end, I realized that it was a girl. She didn’t look too old. She looked away when she met my gaze. I guess I was thinking too much. It was just an accident. She thought that there were many of us and curiously took a look.”","As he spoke, the people beside him also looked in Qiao Nian’s direction. They saw that she was just an ordinary girl. They couldn’t tell anything.","He couldn’t help but laugh. “I think you’re overthinking it too. How old is she? Probably eighteen or nineteen years old. She must still be a student. She might have come with her mentor. Don’t think too much.”","“Sure.”","Mo Xi pursed his lips, then frowned and glanced in the girl’s direction again.","The girl stood alone at the side. Not far away, there were indeed a few middle-aged men who seemed to be researchers. They looked very much like the instructors his companions had mentioned.","He looked at the girl again. She was dressed simply and did not bring anything else with her. No matter how he looked at her, she looked like an ordinary person.","Reassured again, he decided he’d been too tense and was overthinking things.","“Master Wang!”","Mo Xi didn’t wait for the other party to finish. He retracted his gaze and lowered his voice. “Master Wang and the others have already arrived and are staying elsewhere. Master Wang asked us to stay in this hotel for now. There might be news of Wang Fei here.”","The person beside him fell silent and nodded, indicating that he understood.","* * *","Qiao Nian didn’t look over. She stood there in boredom for a while.","Finally, Master Cheng and Nie Mi returned together.","However, both of them did not look good.","“What’s wrong? What happened?” Liang Conglin immediately followed and asked.","Master Cheng was furious. “The room that was originally reserved for us was changed from the standard rooms in Area A to a large bedroom. They said that the number of people coming this time exceeded their expectations. There were not enough rooms reserved in the hotel previously, so they could only change it to a large bedroom for us.”","They had originally planned for two people to share a room.","It was more convenient to stay in the standard room.","It was inconvenient for two people to sleep on the same bed!","Liang Conglin was also dumbfounded. “Master Cheng, how should we arrange the rooms now?”"]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 Sister Nian: It Shouldn’t Be That Coincidental, Right?","paragraphs":["1670 Sister Nian: It Shouldn’t Be That Coincidental, Right?","Master Cheng looked at the other people. This time, all of them were men, and Qiao Nian was the only girl. He rubbed his temples before forming a plan. “How about this? Let’s squeeze in a little and stay in the room we were allocated. Nian Nian can stay in a room alone. Is that okay?”","“I...” Qiao Nian wanted to say that she could squeeze in with them.","However, Jiang Zongjin beat her to it and immediately agreed. “Yes, I think that’s for the best too. Nian Nian is a girl, and it’s not good for girls to squeeze in with us. Wouldn’t there be two empty rooms if we distribute them like this?”","He then said sincerely, “Why don’t you and Elder Nie each have one of the remaining rooms?”","!!","“I think so, too.” Now that things had come to this, Liang Conglin was not overly conflicted. He immediately added to Jiang Zongjin’s suggestion, “You and Elder Nie are old. You won’t be able to rest well if you sleep in the same room as us young people. Especially Master Cheng. Your sleep quality is not good, to begin with. You won’t be able to sleep if you squeeze in with other people.”","Master Cheng originally wanted to say something, but Liang Conglin did not give him the chance. “Let’s arrange it like that. Does anyone have any objections?”","“No objections.”","“I have no objections, either.”","“Let’s arrange it that way. I think it’s pretty good.”","The others had no objections.","They were all scientific researchers, so they were not that particular about food, clothing, accommodation, and transportation.","There was an accident this time, but they could accept the subsequent arrangements. At most, it would be a little troublesome. They would just tolerate it for a while.","After all, the Independent Continent was not like other places. The forces here were complicated. They were really nothing here!","Everyone went to their rooms to tidy up and rest after the rooms were allocated.","Qiao Nian was assigned a separate room.","After entering her room, she took a cold shower, put on a bathrobe, and came out.","The room was not small, but it was not especially big. The facilities were complete. The hotel was very thoughtful.","She raised her eyebrows and pulled out a chair to sit down, then crossed her legs. She was drying her hair when she thought of the people she just met downstairs.","No matter how Qiao Nian thought about it, those people gave off a similar feeling to those who came to Rhine previously.","She raised her eyebrows. Perhaps she might be overthinking.","However, when she thought of this, she remembered that she had not told him that she had arrived. Hence, she got up and found her phone in her bag. After turning it on, she sent a message to a certain someone to inform him that she was safe.","[QN: I’m here.]","The other party did not reply immediately. It was obvious that he might not have looked at his phone.","Qiao Nian didn’t mind. She scrolled through her Moments next.","L actually posted on his Moments again.","She glanced at it and her eyes stung again.","This time, she reacted quickly and directly clicked on the other party’s WeChat Moments to remove it from view. Her WeChat Moments instantly became much cleaner and more refreshing.","At the same time.","Jiang Li sent her a screenshot from Beijing.","Qiao Nian took a look and saw that it was another WeChat Moments. Her fingertips paused for a moment. She casually looked at it again and realized that it was a screenshot of Jiang Xianrou’s WeChat Moments.","She posted a photo of a place that looked like a library.","It looked familiar.","Jiang Li’s message came as scheduled.","[Xianrou got first place and can now enter the Pharmacy Association’s library to study. Nian Nian, pretend not to hear it if my mother says anything to you. She’s feeling smug now and might annoy you again.]"]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 Sister Nian: I’ve Been Poor Recently, No Money!","paragraphs":["1671 Sister Nian: I’ve Been Poor Recently, No Money!","Qiao Nian sat there lazily, her long legs crossed. Her dark eyes swept over Jiang Li’s message, and the corners of her lips curled up as she smiled lazily and arrogantly.","She held her phone with both hands and replied to him.","[QN: She probably won’t have the chance to bother me.]","This was because she had already blacklisted Tang Wanru’s phone number and WeChat. Even if she wanted to find her, there was a high chance that she would not be able to.","!!","After all, she was Jiang Li’s mother. Qiao Nian didn’t go into details.","She sent another message to him.","[QN: Are you feeling better? Did my teacher go over to check on you regularly?]","Jiang Li had yet to reply to her when the person who didn’t reply to the message called her directly.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows slightly, staring at the flashing video call on her phone. She propped her chin on her hand and placed the phone on the table, leaning against the cup. Then, she pressed the answer button.","The internet speed was quite fast.","The video flickered and quickly changed from a completely black screen to the backdrop of a bright and spacious hotel room. She estimated that it was at least a suite that was much better than hers.","The black leather sofa placed indicated that the person was rich!","She got up to get a bottle of water and then sat back down.","Qiao Nian could already see that the camera had been fixed. It was no longer swaying wildly. She could roughly see the situation on his side.","Gu San was also there.","However, he was talking to someone not far away.","Qiao Nian couldn’t hear what they were talking about. From Gu San’s frown, she could guess that it had something to do with why Ye Wangchuan had gone out this time. They were most likely discussing serious matters.","Standing opposite Gu San was a familiar face.","It was the man she had met a few times in Rhine. He exuded an aura that he was not to be trifled with, like a knife soaked in ice all year round. He was sharp and dangerous.","It gave off the same feeling as the group of people she had met in the hotel lobby!","She did not expect this person to be with him.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows slightly and retracted her gaze. She was already focused on the person who video-called her.","“Oh, why are you suddenly video-calling me?”","“I was busy just now. I just saw the WeChat message you sent me, so I called you...”","The young man couldn’t hide the fatigue in his eyes, as if he had not rested well. A faint layer of green could be seen under his eyelids. He was too attractive, and the fatigue from not resting well did not affect his appearance. He was still eye-catching.","He paused and his thin lips curled up slightly, looking quite cheeky. “I’m checking up on you.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","“Just joking.” He relaxed his eyebrows and placed his hand on the back of his head. He leaned lazily on the sofa and then chuckled, as if a smile was overflowing from his throat. “You’re at the hotel?”","Flustered by his bewitchment, Qiao Nian casually unscrewed the cap of the bottle, rested her legs on the table, and hummed. “I just arrived.”","He could roughly see the environment of her hotel through the video. “Why didn’t you choose a better room?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids, her eyes wild and arrogant. She was quite calm. “I have no choice. I’ve been poor recently.”","He was silent for two seconds before saying in a low, hoarse voice, “Send me your bank account.”","He knew very well that Qiao Nian wasn’t poor, but his expression was doting. “I’ll transfer money to you.”","Qiao Nian paused. She capped the bottle and placed it back on the table. Her eyes were wandering, and her face was arrogant and unrestrained. However, it was obvious that she was not at ease. “There’s no need. I was just joking.”","She was just joking. How could she really want his money?"]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 Do You Want to Meet Master Cheng and the Others?","paragraphs":["1672 Do You Want to Meet Master Cheng and the Others?","“We came late. There were no more rooms, so we could only make do with it. Anyway, we won’t stay for long. It’s just a few days. We’ll see when the time comes.” She raised her eyebrows slightly and said in a clean and low voice, “I still have enough money. I’ll ask you for more when I lack money in the future.”","She knew that Ye Wangchuan should be quite rich.","He probably had around a hundred million. His wealth was almost unimaginable to ordinary people.","Of course, in the world of big shots, these were just basic traits.","“Elder Nie—”","Qiao Nian knew what he was going to ask. “He’s in the room next to mine.”","“Okay, that’s good.” He was slightly relieved.","As they spoke, Qiao Nian saw that Gu San had finished chatting with the familiar-looking man. Both of them were looking in their direction.","She wasn’t into public displays of affection, so she coolly said, “I’ll tell you more later. I’ll hang up now.”","Before Ye Wangchuan could say anything else...","Qiao Nian quickly hung up.","The phone screen went dark. He couldn’t see the girl’s exquisite and outstanding face anymore. He felt quite regretful as he slowly put away his phone.","Mo Dong waited at the side for a long time. When Ye Wangchuan finally finished the call, he immediately told him about the serious matter. “Master Wang, Mo Xi and the others have already checked into the hotel. When they find an opportunity, they will approach the president of the Independent Continent Chamber of Commerce Alliance to investigate.”","The structure of the Independent Continent’s forces was complicated. Apart from the three top forces, the Independent Continent also had hundreds of other forces of various sizes.","The major powers naturally formed their own factions.","In order to gain a foothold in the Independent Continent, the minor factions had also thought of a way to join forces and bring each other up.","Many associations and organizations were thus born.","For example, the Pharmaceutical Association, the Hacker Alliance, and the Chamber of Commerce Alliance were all organizations unique to the Independent Continent. It was precisely because they joined forces that they formed a medium-sized force.","This time, it was one of the forces that attacked the Ye family’s goods.","The Chamber of Commerce Alliance!","Mo Dong was still puzzled as he mentioned this. “We’ve always been friendly with the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. There’s no reason for them to do this. I don’t understand why they want to touch our goods.”","Previously, they had found out that someone had hired a group of desperadoes from the Independent Continent to hijack the Ye family’s goods. After that, this source was cut off.","Yesterday, Master Wang came over and swiftly destroyed those small fries’ nest. He directly captured their boss and found out that the mastermind was from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","Mo Xi and the others had brought a small team to investigate.","“Oh, right.” Mo Dong remembered another thing. “This time, all the major overseas factions have gathered at the Paradise Hotel. The delegations from various countries are there. The people from China are also there. Master Cheng and the others should be there, too. Master Wang, do you want to meet Master Cheng and the others?”","The Ninth Branch and Bright Gate belonged to two different organizations.","Everyone in Bright Gate knew about the Ninth Branch, but the Ninth Branch didn’t realize that Bright Gate was with them.","This time, Master Cheng of the Ninth Branch led a team to the Independent Continent. Master Wang happened to be here, so Mo Dong remembered to ask Master Wang if he wanted to meet him.","“Not for now.” His voice was low and hoarse. His gaze was still on his phone. “Master Cheng doesn’t know that I’m on the Independent Continent. It’s too troublesome to explain to him. Let’s wait for the right time!","“Our purpose for coming to the Independent Continent is not to meet anyone, but to find out where our goods are.”"]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 I Heard That He Also Invited the Illegal Zone’s Diamond Boss","paragraphs":["1673 I Heard That He Also Invited the Illegal Zone’s Diamond Boss","“...I understand.”","Mo Dong responded in a muffled voice. He kept looking in the young man’s direction and only saw that he seemed to be transferring money to someone. He couldn’t see the person’s name.","However, even if he couldn’t see clearly, he knew who he was transferring the money to—Qiao Nian!","Master Wang’s girlfriend in Beijing.","He had clearly heard the girl crying to Master Wang that she was poor and that she didn’t have money to stay in a good hotel.","Mo Dong frowned nonchalantly but did not say anything.","He had always thought that good men were ambitious. As for spoiling women, so be it.","However, women had to be sensible. It was fine if they made a fuss usually, but if the man was doing serious business outside, it would be insensible of them to be noisy.","He felt that Master Wang’s girlfriend was not very sensible.","However, Mo Dong felt that it was not strange for her to do such a thing when he thought about her identity as a Qing University student.","“Master Cheng and the others will be staying in the Independent Continent for about a week. Mo Xi called me just now and said that he met Master Cheng and the others in the lobby, but Master Cheng doesn’t know him. Master Cheng and the others came with more than ten people this time... Quite a lot. After the negotiations are over, they will probably attend some cocktail parties later. The Ji family is also holding a banquet this time. I heard that they have invited the illegal zone’s diamond big shot. A lot of people will be going... With the Ji family’s standards, Master Cheng and the others shouldn’t be able to attend.","“Master Cheng and the others will probably go back after attending a few banquets held by ordinary families,” Mo Dong said after thinking for a moment.","On the Independent Continent, even an ordinary family was out of reach of many forces.","So why was the Independent Continent detached from all continents?","It was because the forces there were too powerful.","For example, the Pharmaceutical Association was an existence that looked down on all heroes in Continent O. Even the royal family of Country M had to rely on them. In the Independent Continent, they were only mid-level.","This time, some overseas forces could participate in a few ordinary cocktail parties in the Independent Continent. It was an opportunity that others couldn’t even dream of.","Ye Wangchuan’s gaze deepened, but he didn’t say anything. “Ask Mo Xi and the others to take care of Master Cheng. Help them if they need it.”","Mo Dong nodded in understanding. “I know. I’ll tell him.”","Ye Wangchuan placed his hand on the back of the sofa, looking lazy and noble. Then, he turned his attention to the transfer page and keyed in nine digits.","He transferred the money to Qiao Nian’s bank account.","* * *","Ding!","On the other side.","Qiao Nian received a message from the bank notifying her that a total of nine digits had been transferred to her bank account.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and counted. He was quite generous.","She did not return the money. Instead, she transferred it to the Pharmacy Association and sent a message to Zhong Yiliu, asking him to help develop a prescription suitable for children with natural leg diseases.","After doing this, Qiao Nian went down to eat.","She bumped into the scar-faced man she met in the lobby again in the elevator, but she didn’t pay much attention to him. She lowered her cap to cover her face.","She did look at him overly much.","The other party observed her for a little while, but Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to say anything. When she arrived, she stepped out of the elevator and went about her business.","Nie Mi and the others were very busy for the next two days.","Jiang Zongjin and the other scientific research professors had to participate in intensive negotiations. He was worried about Qiao Nian being alone in the hotel, but there was nothing he could do about it. He could only remind her not to run around. The security in the Independent Continent was too chaotic, and it was dangerous for her to go out alone.","Qiao Nian listened obediently. She didn’t show annoyance no matter how much he nagged at her.","She looked very obedient."]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 Treating the Hacker Alliance Database as a Backyard Every Day!","paragraphs":["1674 Treating the Hacker Alliance Database as a Backyard Every Day!","Jiang Zongjin was relieved. He had been working with Nie Mi and the others for the past two days. However, he would try his best to find time to eat with Qiao Nian at night after he was done with work.","Qiao Nian had also been very busy these past two days.","Her purpose in coming to the Independent Continent this time was to investigate the Ji family, but she realized that they were not so easy to investigate after coming here.","She did not dare to alert the enemy lest her identity was exposed.","!!","In these two days, she had only found some clues through the Independent Continent’s Internet. These clues were clearly not enough to achieve her goal.","Moreover, through her investigation, she discovered that even in the Independent Continent, all information about Ji Qing had been wiped clean.","If not for the fact that she had the Ji family’s lost family emblem, Qiao Nian would have suspected that Ji Qing had nothing to do with them.","However, the more it was deliberately erased, the more it meant that something fishy was going on!","Qiao Nian used her microcomputer to search for information about the Ji family for the nth time. What she could find was basically what she had found previously.","She leaned back in her chair and focused for a long time. Her phone rang while she was busy thinking.","Qiao Nian came back to her senses and picked it up.","She looked down and saw it was a call from Nie Mi.","She put the phone to her ear and said in a slightly hoarse voice, “Hello.”","“Nian Nian, have you eaten? Come down. There’s a cocktail party in the banquet hall on the first floor. I’ll introduce a few people to you.”","Qiao Nian’s mind was still filled with thoughts about the Ji family and Ji Qing. She was a little distracted. “Yes?”","In a good mood, Nie Mi happily urged her to go down. “I’ll introduce you to a few people from the Independent Continent. It’ll be good for your future development. Your father and Master Cheng are also here. Come down quickly. I’ll wait for you downstairs.”","“Hello...” Nie Mi hung up before Qiao Nian could reject him.","She glanced at the data on the microcomputer that was only half-entered. She had no choice but to close the computer and change into a fresh set of clothes. Qiao Nian picked up the cap on the table and put it on. After making sure that it covered her eyes, she left the room unhurriedly and walked towards the first floor...","...","Independent Continent, Hacker Alliance Headquarters.","A middle-aged man sat in front of a computer. A few computers were lined up in front of him. They were all supercomputers that were not available on the market.","At this moment, the data on the screens was constantly being updated.","“Here we go again!”","“What’s happening again?” A man with cornrow hair leaned over to take a look.","The middle-aged man’s tone was not very good. “Someone has been hacking into our database and stealing our information for the past two days. The other party came again today, and it was a one-time success. More than half of our new defense system has collapsed. Now, ‘he’ suddenly stopped attacking. I don’t know what he’s thinking.”","“Who the f*ck is so bold as to attack our Hacker Alliance’s system? Let me see.” The man with cornrow hair snatched his seat.","With a slice of bread in his mouth, he looked indignant and wanted to fight back.","The middle-aged man didn’t stop him.","It was mainly because the other party was too arrogant. Their Hacker Alliance had been in the Independent Continent for so long, but no one had ever treated them as their backyard!","His fingers flew over the keyboard.","Half an hour later, several computers flashed at the same time.","Ka!","All the screens went black.","At the same time, three words appeared on them—Don’t court death.","“F*ck!” The man with bread in his mouth opened his mouth, causing the slice of bread to fall to the ground. He stared at the screen in front of him with his mouth agape. It took him a long time to find his voice. “So fierce? Who is this!”","He was so arrogant!","The other party was obviously skillful and arrogant!"]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 Hacker Alliance: Do You Have Manners?","paragraphs":["1675 Hacker Alliance: Do You Have Manners?","The middle-aged man found a chair beside him and sat down. He crossed his arms and looked at his messy hair in anger and amusement. He said, “You only know how to be fierce now?”","The Chicken Nest Hair man had suffered a terrible blow and was speechless for a moment.","“Three days ago, I discovered that someone had hacked into our system and was looking for something in our database. I took countermeasures! In the end, it was similar to what happened this time. The other party also hacked my computer, but they didn’t do anything else. I think ‘he’ doesn’t have any ill intentions. He just wants to find something from us.”","The middle-aged man spoke generously.","In fact, he was also furious at the beginning.","It couldn’t be helped. They were the Hacker Alliance, but the other party didn’t take their computer defense system seriously. Shopping through their database was as easy as shopping in a supermarket.","Was that having manners?","What a slap in the face!","However, he had been slapped in the face for three consecutive days. He was already numb.","As expected, his face would not hurt anymore after being hit too many times.","“Boss—” The Chicken Nest Hair man was stunned.","What was this? This was called having no ill intentions? Boss’s temper had gradually improved recently!","The middle-aged man touched his nose and avoided his stunned gaze. He said expressionlessly, “Try restarting it.”","“Ah, oh oh oh.” The man with messy hair came back to his senses, turned off the power of the hacked computer, and started it again.","With a click, the computer did not get infected. It restarted smoothly.","At first, he thought that they were infected with a virus. Now that he saw the central computer that was fine, he could not recover for a long time.","“This... There’s no virus?”","Only then did the middle-aged man stand up and take his teapot. He sat down again and said leisurely, “No, I was worried about this at first. However, I realized that my worries were unnecessary over the past few days! The other party really didn’t have any intention of provoking us. He left a message saying ‘don’t court death’. The general meaning is that as long as we don’t try to check ‘his’ IP location, ‘he’ doesn’t intend to hack our system.”","The man with messy hair had an indescribable expression on his face. He turned to look at the computer in front of him, and it seemed to be fine on the clean and refreshing table...","Everything was so ‘harmonious’!","The corners of his mouth twitched, but he still felt suffocated.","They were the Independent Continent’s Hacker Alliance. Usually, they were the only ones who could hack other people’s computers. But they didn’t even have a chance to retaliate when someone else attacked and hammered them. They could still brew a cup of tea here and lament about other people’s skill level?","The middle-aged man glanced at him and could roughly tell what he was thinking. He poured him a cup of tea and pursed his lips, then his gaze landed on the computer. “The other party’s technique reminds me of someone.”","“Who?” The messy-haired man was indignant. His eyes lit up at this moment.","The middle-aged man did not answer immediately.","After a long time, he said, “You’ve heard of ‘him.’ Red Alliance’s Sun.”","The uncrowned king of hackers!","Their Hacker Alliance had been unable to become the number one hacker organization on the Independent Continent until now because they lacked this person.","This was how Sun did things. He was simple and direct. He didn’t beat around the bush, but he would crush you with his strength.","“Sun?” The messy-haired man’s eyes were filled with confusion. After a long time, he muttered, “Did he come to the Independent Continent?”","The middle-aged man did not say anything.","However, his gaze gradually darkened."]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 Someone Is Deliberately Making Things Difficult","paragraphs":["1676 Someone Is Deliberately Making Things Difficult","On the other side.","]Qiao Nian had just walked out of the elevator. She heard Nie Mi arguing with someone before she could meet up with him and the others.","“Why can’t you let us in?”","“I’m so sorry.”","“I’m not forcing you to apologize. You have to give us a reason for suddenly not letting us in. Otherwise, what will we think when so many of us are here?”","“Sorry.”","“I told you, I don’t want your apology. I just want to know why you stopped us outside! We have an invitation to your cocktail party, but you don’t let us in or give us a reasonable explanation. Is this how you treat your guests in the Independent Continent?!”","Qiao Nian looked up slightly, surprised.","It was rare for Nie Mi to get so angry. He must have encountered something fierce.","The collar of her shirt was slightly open. With one hand in her pocket, she walked in the direction of the argument.","She immediately saw Master Cheng, Liang Conglin, and the others. Her father and a few old professors were also there.","Nie Mi was arguing with the doorman at the entrance of the banquet hall. He was so angry that his face was red and his neck veins were bulging. He looked furious.","She walked over and looked up slightly. “Dad, what’s wrong?”","Jiang Zongjin turned around and saw Qiao Nian. He explained in a low voice, “Elder Nie brought us to attend the cocktail party. We took out the invitation card, but the doorman insisted on not letting us in. He also won’t tell us the reason. Elder Nie was so angry that he started arguing with them. However, other than apologizing, the other party refused to give a reason...”","Qiao Nian instantly understood.","This situation was indeed infuriating.","Qiao Nian looked up and saw that the doorman’s attitude was still the same. His apology was sincere, but he refused to let them in. “I’m very sorry.”","Master Cheng walked over at this moment. He greeted Qiao Nian upon seeing her. Then, he said to Jiang Zongjin and the others, “I asked around. The other party vaguely revealed to me that we offended the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. The Chamber of Commerce Alliance deliberately prevented us from entering.”","“How could they?” Liang Conglin understood the reason before he could finish the sentence. His expression immediately turned ashen. “Is it because of the chip?”","“I think so.” Master Cheng nodded.","Liang Conglin immediately choked. “The Qi family was unreasonable and wanted to forcefully pin the plagiarism on us. We just defended ourselves. How can they pin all the blame on us?”","Master Cheng’s expression was cold and solemn, and he was not in high spirits. “The Qi family is one of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance’s members. They will definitely protect their own people. Even if the Qi family has already fallen, they still have to stand up for them. To put it bluntly, they are not deliberately making things difficult for us for the Qi family, but to regain face for their Chamber of Commerce Alliance!”","The Chamber of Commerce Alliance wasn’t a particularly impressive force in the Independent Continent, but it was still mid-sized.","They were outsiders.","A powerful dragon could not suppress a local snake, let alone a group of scientific researchers like them!","In the Independent Continent’s territory, there was nothing they could do if others wanted to make things difficult for them!","“Tell Elder Nie to come back! We won’t be attending the cocktail party tonight,” Master Cheng said calmly.","However, he knew very well that the Chamber of Commerce Alliance would not stop at this.","They would definitely cause trouble in the dark. He was afraid that the cocktail parties they were supposed to attend in the next few days would not let them in like today."]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 Suddenly Letting Them in Now","paragraphs":["1677 Suddenly Letting Them in Now","“Tell Elder Nie to come back. We’ll discuss the countermeasures when we return to the room. We’ll only make a fool of ourselves if we make a fuss now.”","Liang Conglin took a look around. Indeed, many people in the lobby were looking in their direction. He rubbed his temples and said, “I understand. I’ll call Elder Nie.”","...","Qiao Nian listened from the side. She basically understood what was going on.","!!","She had never thought that the Qi family had joined the Independent Continent’s Chamber of Commerce Alliance. She did not expect that even though the Qi family was finished, the people from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance would still jump out to make their presence known.","She leaned against the wall and lazily bent her long legs. Her lips curled into a faint smile. With one hand in her pocket, she used her other hand to send a message to Slim Waist Control.","A few minutes later, Liang Conglin returned with Nie Mi.","Nie Mi’s expression was very bad. He pursed his lips tightly and did not say a word. Clearly, he was so angry that he could not speak.","Master Cheng patted his shoulder silently.","Then, he looked up and said to the others, including Qiao Nian, “Let’s go back!”","Everyone was depressed. They were no longer as happy and relaxed as when they called Qiao Nian and asked her to come down to attend the cocktail party.","Just as everyone was about to walk towards the elevator...","Suddenly, a voice stopped them.","“Honored guests, please wait a moment!” The person who chased after them was the doorman who had stopped Nie Mi from entering.","The doorman seemed to have changed into a different person. After catching up, he faced everyone’s respectful attitude. “I’m sorry, you can go in now.”","“Huh?” Nie Mi was confused by his inconsistent attitude. He didn’t understand what they were doing.","He subconsciously looked at Master Cheng. “Master Cheng, you think...”","Master Cheng didn’t understand what was going on, either. They could suddenly enter now. Didn’t they say that President Torre of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance had announced that he wouldn’t let them in?","They all stood rooted to the ground.","Seeing this, the doorman hurriedly apologized to them. “Dear distinguished guests, I’m very sorry. I was rash just now. The cocktail party has already begun. Everyone, hurry up and go in!”","Master Cheng and Nie Mi looked at each other.","Master Cheng spoke first. “Let’s... let’s go in!”","With Nie Mi’s fiery temper, if such a thing happened in the country, he would definitely not enter.","However, this was the Independent Continent, not Beijing.","He noticed the girl’s expression out of the corner of his eye. Thinking of his motive for coming to the Independent Continent—introduce a few people to Qiao Nian.","He endured it and agreed. He said in a muffled voice, “Since it’s like this, let’s go in.”","Everyone was confused. They followed the doorman back into the cocktail party.","Only Qiao Nian knew what was going on. She casually put her hands and phone back into her pocket and followed Nie Mi and the others without saying a word...","* * *","The lights in the hall were bright and dazzling.","Men in suits and leather shoes were chatting. The women also looked fashionable.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and glanced around. Realizing that it was no different from a cocktail party in Beijing, she lost interest and didn’t look around anymore. She basically followed Nie Mi and the others, keeping a low profile.","On the other side of the banquet.","A middle-aged man was surrounded by many people. He was like the moon surrounded by stars. The middle-aged man took good care of himself. His blue eyes were a little gray upon a closer look. He looked like a smart and capable person."]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 They Have Someone Backing Them Up, Face Slap","paragraphs":["1678 They Have Someone Backing Them Up, Face Slap","He was holding the cocktail he got from the waiter. He held the end of the glass and casually swirled it as he talked to someone.","Suddenly, he noticed Nie Mi and the others enter from the corner of his eye.","His expression suddenly turned cold. After barely chatting with the person who came over to strike up a conversation, he instructed someone to call the organizer of the cocktail party.","“President.”","Torre grunted in displeasure and stuck out his chin. He was impeccably dressed and his eyes hid his fierceness. “What’s going on? Didn’t I say not to let them in?”","Although the Qi family was useless, they were still a member of their Chamber of Commerce Alliance. But they were actually bullied by a research team from Qing University in the illegal zone.","This time, the research team even came to the Independent Continent.","Of course, he was not standing up for the Qi family. He was standing up for their Chamber of Commerce Alliance!","Today’s banquet was ordinary. It didn’t involve the few flourishing forces of the Independent Continent. As the president, he still had some face. Therefore, Torre was impolite and deliberately got someone to block the people from Qing University’s scientific research team from entering.","His original intention was for other people to see Nie Mi and the others as a joke and to know that their Chamber of Commerce Alliance was not to be trifled with.","Unexpectedly, everyone came in so quickly.","Wasn’t this a slap to his face?","Therefore, Torre’s words were very impolite. He was unable to suppress his anger. “What do you mean?! You’re not giving me face?”","Paradise Hotel had a strong background in the Independent Continent.","The person in charge smiled slightly. He looked respectful, but in fact, he was not sincere. He said, neither servile nor overbearing, “President Torre, of course, I’m not disrespecting you. It’s just that they have someone backing them up. Aren’t I in a difficult position too? Don’t make things difficult for me anymore!”","“You say they have someone backing them up?” Torre hesitated, but he was still unhappy.","Who was so disrespectful to him?","The person in charge still had that respectful expression and was all smiles. “Yes, Mr. Nie and the others know the diamond big shot in the illegal zone, Q. The people from Q personally contacted me and asked us to let them in.”","Torre looked surprised. “Q? You mean that Q?”","Q was inextricably linked to the Red Alliance and Tian Chen. Q wasn’t afraid of him even with his power in the Independent Continent!","“Yes, you also know that the Ji family invited Q to the banquet this time. Although that person isn’t sure if he will show his face, at least the other party is someone the Ji family wants to rope in. Since he has asked me, how can I refuse?”","The person in charge smiled harmlessly. “So, President Torre, don’t be too calculative with Mr. Nie and the others. Harmony makes money!”","“But how do they know Q?” The middle-aged man still had doubts, but his expression showed that he was very afraid of Q and the Ji family.","Still, he couldn’t take this lying down. “They touched my people and made such a scene. If I forget about it this time, then where will our Chamber of Commerce Alliance put our face!”","“Didn’t you block them outside for so long just now? Mr. Nie and the others were already in a sorry state.” The person in charge knew how to find a way out for him. “President Torre, why don’t you forget about it for my sake! I’ll treat you to a meal later and ask Mr. Nie and the others to apologize to you.”","“Hmph.” Torre snorted coldly, and his expression finally relaxed. “Forget about apologizing. I don’t want to accept their apology!","“A bunch of country bumpkins. I can’t be bothered with them. Let’s talk about it later!”"]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 There’s an Auction Later That You Might Be Interested In","paragraphs":["1679 There’s an Auction Later That You Might Be Interested In","The Independent Continent’s cocktail party was no different from the ones in Beijing.","It was an occasion for influential people to socialize.","Nie Mi and Master Cheng brought Qiao Nian around to get to know everyone. After a round, she changed three types of drinks in her wine glass.","Finally, Qiao Nian met the last person. Nie Mi brought her to meet Master Cheng and the others.","On the way back, Nie Mi placed the wine glass on the tray of a passing waiter. Then, he turned to the nonchalant girl and said, “Nian Nian, do you remember the people I introduced you to just now?”","Qiao Nian nodded casually. “Yes.”","Seeing Nie Mi’s serious expression, she fell silent for half a second before placing the glass on the waiter’s tray. She clapped her hands and stuffed them into her pockets. “I remember.”","“Mm. It’s good that you remember!” Nie Mi had always been at ease with her. His gaze was far-reaching. “Those people just now are all from the Independent Continent. They might be able to help you in the future. With them around, you can at least get in touch with the Independent Continent.”","Qiao Nian looked up, her dark eyes clear and bright. She didn’t say anything, tacitly acknowledging his good intentions. “I know.”","“I know you usually know more than me, but it’s not easy to form connections in the Independent Continent. With this opportunity, I still want to bring you to meet more people. If you have the chance to come into contact with this circle in the future, you won’t be unfamiliar with everyone...” Nie Mi rambled on.","Qiao Nian listened to him obediently.","Dressed in black and wearing a cap, she looked cold and cool. She was especially eye-catching at such a high-end cocktail party! Qiao Nian had lowered the brim of her cap, hiding half of her face in the shadows. Unfortunately, her aura was too eye-catching.","“Oh, yes.”","Halfway through, Nie Mi quickly walked back to Master Cheng, Jiang Zongjin, and the others. Seeming to have thought of something, he suddenly stopped in his tracks, turned to the girl beside him, and said, “There’s an auction later. You can see if there’s anything you want to buy.”","Qiao Nian had been bored to death ever since she entered the venue. She wasn’t interested in anything.","It was not until Nie Mi mentioned the auction that she became interested. She raised her eyebrows. “Auction?”","“Yes.” Nie Mi smiled. “This can be considered a specialty of the Independent Continent’s cocktail party! The latter half of the party will be an auction. The items auctioned are usually the collections of the organizers. Some good things will occasionally come out.”","“Mm-hm.”","“Don’t you like strange things? You can take a look later. There might be something you’re interested in!”","Qiao Nian didn’t know if there would be anything she was interested in, but Nie Mi’s sudden mention of the auction still piqued her interest.","...","On the other side, almost at the same time.","A scar-faced man entered the cocktail party with an invitation letter in his hand. He did not go around trying to build connections like the others.","Instead, he found an inconspicuous corner and took a glass of water. He leaned against the wall and observed his surroundings.","“Brother Xi, that Torre is over there.” The companion he brought in was the first to spot his target and gestured with his chin.","“Don’t be so obvious. Be careful not to be discovered,” Mo Xi reminded him as he casually looked in the direction his companion was pointing at.","He didn’t see Torre.","Halfway through, he was attracted by a girl’s tall and slender back.","The other party’s aura was too unique.","He recognized her at a glance as the person he met in the lobby two days ago."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 Missed the Perfect Opportunity to Take a Photo","paragraphs":["1680 Missed the Perfect Opportunity to Take a Photo","“It’s her?” Mo Xi was stunned. He then looked around and saw a group of elders dressed as professors nearby.","One of them was Master Cheng.","His furrowed brows relaxed again, and he no longer paid attention to Qiao Nian. He deliberately waited for the girl to pass by before secretly taking out his miniature phone and taking a photo of the man not far away, sending it to the group.","[Mo Xi: I saw Torre. He came to the Paradise Hotel to attend a cocktail party. He’s very cautious and has quite a number of people with him.]","!!","[Mo Xi: Photo.jpg]","He lowered his head. Soon, someone in the group replied to him.","[Y: You don’t have to do anything. Just keep an eye on him. See who he comes into contact with and remember those people.]","[Mo Xi: Okay, I understand!]","It was not good to keep playing with his phone in such a place. It was easy to be noticed.","Mo Xi didn’t keep looking down and sending messages.","After he sent the photo he had just taken, he knew what he should and shouldn’t do next. He knew what to do and stopped playing with his phone.","However, Mo Xi hesitated again when he caught a glimpse of the girl with Master Cheng from the corner of his eye. He hesitated about whether to tell Master Wang and the others that Master Cheng and the others were also there.","However, he did not have time to hesitate for long. The lights dimmed, and it was now too late for him to take a photo. He was attracted by the auction stage that rose in the middle.","* * *","“The auction has begun.”","Nie Mi spoke to the girl with familiarity after the lights dimmed.","They were all focused on the auction stage in the middle. Everyone’s attention was basically attracted by the auction stage.","Qiao Nian raised her cap and looked over.","Soon, the auctioneer went up, followed by a high-tech robot delivering the first item.","A precious herb.","The people below bid sparsely. They did not seem to be interested in such a conventional auction item.","On the other hand, Liang Conglin was quite interested. He waited for the bidding to end before shouting, “No. 015, 680,000 yuan.”","From the beginning, Qiao Nian had noticed that there was a number on everyone’s invitation.","At that time, she did not know the meaning behind it.","It was not until Liang Conglin shouted that she understood its use. It should be something the organizers used to differentiate the guests’ identities.","The first auctioned item was a medicinal ingredient, a type of Chinese medicine.","Although it was very precious, the majority of the people did not believe in Chinese medicine. Naturally, they did not believe in the medicinal herbs that were used in Chinese Medicine. They thought that it was just some random plant.","Liang Conglin’s bidding was not low.","As soon as he shouted 680,000 yuan, the few people who had bid previously fell silent. Clearly, they felt that it was not worth it to spend hundreds of thousands to buy Chinese medicine.","Qiao Nian watched as the auctioneer on stage raised his hammer, preparing to announce the success of the auction.","However, a repulsive voice sounded at this moment.","“001, 700,000.”","The other party’s voice was low and hoarse. It sounded disgusting and subconsciously dangerous.","Liang Conglin frowned.","The number was related to the customer’s identity. Number 001’s identity was definitely not simple.","He hesitated for a moment, and in the blink of an eye, the auction was successful.","The meat Ganoderma he thought highly of had been taken away by the other party.","Although Liang Conglin felt a little regretful, he did not think too much about it. He thought that it was a coincidence."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 Sister Nian: What Does He Want to Do?","paragraphs":["1681 Sister Nian: What Does He Want to Do?","However, what happened next gradually allowed them to understand that it was not an accident at all!","The auction items became increasingly rare as time passed.","Some were precious chemical materials and high-tech space instruments... Master Cheng, Nie Mi, and the others gradually joined the bidding.","But a strange phenomenon happened!","!!","As long as they were interested in bidding for something, bidder 001 would definitely come and disrupt the situation. He would not let them bid for anything as long as they showed interest in it.","This obvious deliberate targeting attracted the attention of many people.","“What’s going on?”","“Who’s 001?”","“Don’t you know? President Torre of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance is here today. 001 is him. These people seem to have offended him. This is a show of strength.”","“Tsk, no wonder. I knew it couldn’t be a coincidence.”","...","Qiao Nian hadn’t seen anything she liked, so she hadn’t participated in any bidding. Later on, her gaze gradually darkened when she realized that something was wrong.","She listened to the whispers from all sides.","Then, she looked at Master Cheng and Nie Mi’s ugly expressions.","The corners of her lips curled up into a smile!","It was quite evil.","She kicked away the chair beside her.","Master Cheng, Nie Mi, and the others were still angry that the Chamber of Commerce Alliance had deliberately humiliated them like this. When they turned around and heard Qiao Nian’s movements, they were shocked.","“Nian Nian?”","Qiao Nian looked past them and at Nie Mi. “What does he want to fight for?”","“Uh...” Nie Mi didn’t react for a moment. Then, he tried to persuade her. “Forget it. This is the Independent Continent. If he wants to fight...”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows, her eyes cold and dry. She beat him to it and asked, “So what about the Independent Continent?”","She wouldn’t hold back just because they were on the Independent Continent!","“He didn’t come here just to cause trouble for us. He must have a reason.”","Over the past few days, she had heard Nie Mi talk about many things related to the Independent Continent. She was almost certain that a banquet of this level would not invite anyone at the level of the president of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","The other party didn’t know that they would come. It was impossible for him to be here specifically for them.","They were just incidental.","The other party must have come over for a reason!","Nie Mi naturally thought of this as well. He rubbed his temples and said with uncertainty, “It’s said that they’re auctioning a very precious rare earth material today. This is a raw material for space aviation. It’s also very rare in the Independent Continent! He’s probably here for this auction item.”","Rare earth.","Qiao Nian’s eyes gradually darkened. Her beautiful lips pursed slightly, and her expression was arrogant. “Alright, I’ll wait for him!”","...","The auction itself was coming to an end.","Half an hour later, the final item was sent to the auction stage.","The middle-aged man, who had been chatting and laughing with the people around him, stopped. His expression was serious, and his sharp eyes gradually became determined.","After the auctioneer waited for the robot to deliver the last item, he smiled and said loudly, “I believe everyone knows what our last item is today. I won’t keep you in suspense. The starting price is 800,000 yuan. Everyone, you can start bidding...”","Rare earth materials were very attractive to the guests.","As soon as he finished speaking.","Immediately, someone raised a sign and placed a bid. “Number 016, one million.”","The bidding price increased by 200,000 yuan.","However, this price was not enough to scare people.","Someone immediately raised the price before the previous person could put down the sign. “Number 012, 1.3 million.”"]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 Slap in the Face, One More Yuan Every Time","paragraphs":["1682 Slap in the Face, One More Yuan Every Time","“No. 023, 2 million.”","“No. 007, 2.43 million.”","“No. 011, 3.78 million.”","The price soared, and soon, it reached five million.","!!","Some people began to retreat. It was not that they could not fork out five million yuan, but mainly because everyone could see the bidding situation today.","In the end, the precious auction items were worth at least eight figures.","Some people wanted to buy this thing purely to give it away. It wasn’t worth it. Naturally, some people chose to give it up.","But most people still persisted.","Worried that Qiao Nian would act on impulse, Nie Mi looked at her and saw that the girl had her eyes lowered and didn’t seem to be paying attention to the bidding. He relaxed a little and turned his gaze back to the auction stage.","At this moment, the price had already soared to 9 million. As it approached 10 million, more and more people chose to give up.","But the price increased more and more towards the end.","No. 001’s Torre never participated.","He finally made a move when the price soared to 30 million. He slowly raised his sign and said in the same tone as before, “No. 001, 60 million.”","“60 million?! That’s double the amount! As expected of the president of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. He’s rich and overbearing. I can tell he’s extraordinary the moment he makes a move,” someone whispered.","Someone was envious. “60 million is not a low price. It’s a jump away from 100 million. There shouldn’t be any competition, right?”","“The Chamber of Commerce Alliance has already doubled the price. What competition can there be?”","“True.”","Everyone was discussing in whispers.","In the corner.","Scar-faced Mo Xi’s expression was ugly. He hammered the wall and said, “Damn it! They actually auctioned off the Ye family’s rare earths. They’re too bold. Unfortunately, I can’t appear!”","He also felt that the rare earth that would be auctioned off would most likely fall into Torre’s hands. His mood was extremely bad as he stared fiercely at the auction stage.","At this moment.","A lazy female voice said, “Number 015, 60 million and one yuan.”","Mo Xi’s temples had been about to explode with anger. He was stunned to hear this and burst out laughing. “Who is this?”","At the same time, he turned around.","Almost everyone present had the same reaction as him. They all looked in the direction of the voice—","A girl!","An excessively young girl!","She was dressed in black and wore a cap. The brim of the cap was pulled down very low, revealing only a small portion of her chin. Her skin was fair and translucent under the light.","“Is she the one who bid just now?”","“It’s an unfamiliar face. I’ve never seen her before.”","“Me neither...”","“Who dares to snatch things from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance?”","...","There was a commotion at the banquet.","Nie Mi’s temples throbbed. He turned to look at Qiao Nian, not having a chance to speak. “Nian Nian, you...”","Torre’s voice rang out again. “No. 001, 70 million.”","Tsk!","Qiao Nian’s upturned eyes were filled with evilness. Still holding her phone, under everyone’s gaze, she said indifferently, “Number 015, 70 million and one yuan.”","“80 million.”","“80 million and one yuan.”","No matter how slow Torre was, he could still react in time. Qiao Nian had come for him. She was doing it on purpose!","His face was ashen as he clenched his fists and said coldly, “100 million!”","This was not a small sum.","He deliberately added more money to make the other party retreat. At the same time, he wanted to tell the other party that this was the Independent Continent!","The Independent Continent was not a place for outsiders like them to be impudent.","Even if they were crazy, they had to know their place!","Unexpectedly, the girl’s voice sounded again in the next second. “Oh, 100 million and one yuan.”"]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 Sister Nian: Playing Around Is Exciting!","paragraphs":["1683 Sister Nian: Playing Around Is Exciting!","Torre suddenly stood up and said to the girl fiercely, “200 million!”","The entire place fell silent as soon as he spoke.","Then, there was a commotion.","“F*ck, 200 million? Doubled again?”","“200 million. This price is almost higher than the market price, right?”","“I don’t know. Even if it’s not higher than the market price, it’s almost the same!”","What was an auction?","It was best to get things at a lower price than the market rate.","If Qiao Nian didn’t interfere, Torre would definitely get the rare earth at a price lower than the market price.","However, she threw a wrench in the works!","She blocked his path!","However, he was already relieved when Torre shouted this price. He knew that the other party would not dare to continue competing with him.","Otherwise, it would be disrespectful to the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","She was openly going against him.","“Ha.”","Everyone’s attention was focused on the girl. She chuckled and pressed her cap down lazily. Her fingers shone with a white luster under the light. Her hand was porcelain-white and beautiful like a work of art.","“200 million and one yuan.”","The entire venue fell silent again. Everyone at the cocktail party was dumbfounded.","Another one yuan.","It was neither too much nor too little.","The price Qiao Nian offered would always be one yuan more than the Chamber of Commerce Alliance!","What could one yuan do?","It would be gone after buying a lollipop.","However, the other party only bidded one yuan more. One yuan was more than the original price!","Who would dare to say that this was not intentional?","Anyone with a discerning eye could tell that Qiao Nian was deliberately slapping his face!","There were only so many people at the banquet venue. Everyone had seen Torre deliberately target Nie Mi and the others. They had just wanted to watch the fun. Who knew that this group of people would dare to go against the Chamber of Commerce Alliance?","This was too... arrogant!","But it felt good for some reason.","Torre’s face darkened completely. The people around him could feel his anger. He clenched his fists and gritted his teeth. “300 million!”","“300 million and one yuan.”","It was still an extra yuan.","Her tone was still neutral.","Torre laughed in anger. His gaze was like a knife as he stared in Qiao Nian’s direction. “400 million.”","He was in a difficult position now.","If he gave up today, the entire Independent Continent would know that their Chamber of Commerce Alliance had been slapped in the face by a foreign girl at a low-level cocktail party.","Did the Chamber of Commerce Alliance still want face?","Therefore, he had to endure it even if he lost money!","Torre’s eyes flickered. At this price, even his heart would race. He didn’t believe that a mere girl could match his price.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were dry. Her cynical tone was always unhurried. “400 million and one yuan!”","She actually dared to match his price!","The venue was so quiet that one could hear the sound of a needle dropping on the floor. No one believed that Qiao Nian still dared to compete. They were all stunned by this bidding war.","There were all kinds of auctions every day in the Independent Continent. There was no lack of famous scenes that people talked about, but most of them were held at higher-level banquets.","Today was just a low-level banquet. Among the people who attended, Torre’s identity was already at the top.","None of the big families in the Independent Continent came to participate. And a single item would be sold for 400 million in such a small auction.","400 million!","Not 400,000.","People would take a second look at such a price even in the Independent Continent.","“Qiao... Qiao Nian, isn’t this price too high...” Liang Conglin watched helplessly as Qiao Nian and Torre raised the price to 400 million."]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 The Highest Price at an Auction in the Independent Continent in the Last Month","paragraphs":["1684 The Highest Price at an Auction in the Independent Continent in the Last Month","His eyelids twitched. Even though he was experienced, his expression still changed slightly. “I know you want to stand up for your teacher and the others, but this price is too high. Why don’t we forget about it?”","Before Qiao Nian could speak...","Jiang Zongjin, who had been silent all this while, had a solemn expression on his face. He was the first to speak. “It’s fine. Let Nian Nian compete if she wants to!","“The Jiang family doesn’t have much money, but we can still fork out 400 to 500 million. If she wants to compete, I’ll support her even if I have to sell my house.”","Liang Conglin was speechless.","The Jiang family’s assets were brought up.","If it was really as Jiang Zongjin had said, it wasn’t impossible for Qiao Nian to spend all her money here.","It was just an auction. Was there a need to put in so much effort?","Was he going to burn down the entire Jiang family’s wealth?","Liang Conglin’s worried gaze landed on the girl.","Qiao Nian had always been quite calm, her half-closed eyes hiding an insufferably arrogant look.","At this moment, her gaze softened a little. She said to her father, “Don’t worry, you won’t have to sell the house.”","Jiang Zongjin was stunned for a moment before he smiled. He was very open-minded.","He touched the girl’s shoulder, silently giving her strength. “I’m not afraid of selling the house. Anyway, Dad doesn’t value these things. As long as you’re happy.","“Just be at ease and follow through boldly. Your grandfather has the same attitude. If our Jiang family wants to do something, we have to do it to the end!”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes slightly and tightened her grip. She hummed softly.","She wasn’t short of money.","So what if she took out a billion to play with Torre today?","She didn’t take the money seriously at first, but at this moment, her heart was warm, as if someone was standing behind her.","It didn’t matter even if her back was not guarded.","...","“500 million.”","“500 million and one.”","“700 million.”","“700 million and one.”","...","As the price soared, everyone at the scene was about to fall into a state of madness.","Their way of bidding made everyone feel that money was not money.","Compared to the girl’s arrogance, the more Torre added, the slower the bidding speed became.","Every time the hammer was about to fall, he would reluctantly increase the price.","“800 million.”","It was close to a billion.","Torre’s heart was pounding so hard that it stopped when he spoke.","It was an indescribable, complicated feeling.","He was worried that the other party would not compete.","He was also afraid that the other party would continue to compete.","He was almost out of breath waiting for Qiao Nian.","“800 million?”","“800 million already?”","“F*ck, this is the highest bidding price in the past month, right?”","“Today is a low-level cocktail party? Hurry up and pinch me. I feel like I’m attending the Ji family’s banquet. This price is too terrifying.”","800 million was the highest price Torre could afford.","Even he had to think twice before exceeding this number.","He stared at the auction stage expressionlessly. His heart was beating very fast. Time was stretched infinitely for him. He watched as the auctioneer raised the mallet.","The final decision was about to be made!","“Tsk.”","A frivolous laugh broke through his tension.","Torre instinctively looked in the girl’s direction.","The girl was still dressed in black with her cap low on her head. She seemed to be a little tired of playing. At this moment, she stood up leisurely and leaned against the wall beside her then looked in his direction. “One billion.”","One billion!","As soon as this price was quoted.","The auctioneer’s mallet, which was about to fall, stopped again.","The crowd erupted after three seconds of silence!","..."]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 Torre Leaves in Anger","paragraphs":["1685 Torre Leaves in Anger","“F*ck, f*ck!”","“My f*cking hairs are standing on end! A billion.”","“Ten counts.”","“Did I just say that this is the highest price in the Independent Continent’s auction house in the past month? I take back what I just said. Today’s definitely the highest price in the past three months or even half a year.”","Many people gasped.","The Independent Continent had money and power.","Tens of millions were like spilled water here. Luxury sports cars were everywhere on the road... but no one had so much money.","One billion.","This amount was not on the same level as tens of millions.","It was not common to encounter people spending so much at auctions. Only once or twice a year.","“Who can tell me who this girl is?”","Finally, someone began to pay attention to Qiao Nian’s background.","After all, the people of the Independent Continent were generally superior to others. They often looked down on outsiders and did not want to come into contact with forces outside the Independent Continent.","However, Qiao Nian successfully attracted their attention.","“I don’t know. I haven’t heard of her before. I think she’s from Country Z.”","“Country Z is playing so big now?”","...","Jiang Zongjin’s temples twitched when he heard Qiao Nian’s bidding price.","Even though he was mentally prepared, his heart still skipped a beat when his daughter offered the Jiang family’s hundred-year-old assets.","However, he quickly adjusted his mentality and didn’t dwell too much on these things. He said, “Nian Nian, you can’t bid much higher. Our family can take out another 300 million at most. If you bid higher, we’ll have to borrow it from your second uncle’s family.”","He was worried that even if Jiang Zongnan was willing to lend it, Tang Wanru and Jiang Yao might not be willing.","“Yeah.”","The girl’s slightly open collar revealed a fair and exquisite collarbone. Her tone was very calm as her lazy gaze landed on the middle-aged man not far away. “Don’t worry, he won’t dare to compete with us anymore!”","She was already tired of adding one yuan every time.","One billion was the limit that the other party could bear from the beginning.","The other party definitely did not dare to continue competing.","The other party wasn’t sure how much she dared to play.","Reality proved that Qiao Nian’s judgment of people was very accurate.","After she finished speaking, Torre glared at her fiercely, as if he wanted to eat her up.","Instead, before the auctioneer brought down the mallet, he did not raise the price again.","The mallet fell.","The auctioneer suppressed his excitement and announced, “Today’s last item has been sold for 1 billion. It belongs to customer 015!”","The people clapped after watching a good show.","Qiao Nian saw the foreign man in the VIP area leave in a huff.","She slowly retracted her gaze and suppressed her frustration. She took out a black card from her pocket and handed it to the auctioneer. Her voice was low and arrogant. “Use this card.”","“Nian Nian, you...?”","Jiang Zongjin wanted to negotiate with the staff to transfer the money in three days.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Nian took out a bank card.","“Okay.” The auctioneer liked such straightforward and generous guests. Overjoyed, he went to swipe her card.","Jiang Zongjin looked at the person with the card, still in a daze.","Nie Mi patted his shoulder. “Zongjin, Nian Nian is very rich.”","“Huh?”","Jiang Zongjin looked at him blankly, clearly still not understanding the extent of Qiao Nian’s wealth."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 Sister Nian Exposed Herself!","paragraphs":["1686 Sister Nian Exposed Herself!","He also felt that Qiao Nian was richer than ordinary students at most because she had a lot of New Year’s money and the pocket money that Old Master Jiang had transferred to her.","But Qiao Nian had burned a billion this time!","This number could even make the front page of social news in the country. Why was Elder Nie still so calm?","Nie Mi wasn’t stupid. He could tell that since Qiao Nian had caused such a huge commotion, she didn’t want to hide it from her father.","!!","Hence, he smiled and said, “Ah, she’s one of the three partners of the Cheng Feng Corporation.”","Jiang Zongjin was speechless.","“Every year, she gets more than a nine-figure dividend. Yuan Yongqin even bought her a lot of houses. In the past few years, the value of each house has increased to eight or nine digits.","“In addition, she’s also Zhui Guang. You know this, right?”","Jiang Zongjin nodded numbly.","“The copyright fees should be around nine digits a year.” Nie Mi tried his best not to sound smug, but he was actually quite so. “...That’s why I didn’t say anything to her just now.”","Jiang Zongjin’s mind was buzzing. He felt that Nie Mi was talking nonsense, but he also felt that he couldn’t be lying.","His soul seemed to be pulled by two ends. He couldn’t calm down at all.","He seemed to find his voice when the person who had taken Qiao Nian’s black card to swipe returned it to the girl respectfully. “Elder Nie, Nian Nian is one of the three partners of Cheng Feng Corporation?”","He had no idea about this before.","He had been prepared to empty his pockets, but Nie Mi had told him that Qiao Nian didn’t need his help at all.","“Yes. Cheng Feng Corporation has a total of three partners. One is Yuan Yongqin, one is Young Master Wei from the Wei family, and the last is Nian Nian.”","Nie Mi spoke to Jiang Zongjin, but also to the others. “Previously, Nian Nian was still in her third year of high school. She was also suppressed by the college entrance examination. Therefore, the Cheng Feng Corporation hid the news very well. However, Nian Nian is one of their three partners.”","Jiang Zongjin had mixed feelings.","He looked at the girl again.","The girl put on her sweater loosely and frowned slightly. She was still communicating with the auction staff about how to deal with the subsequent items.","The arrogance in Qiao Nian’s aura from kicking the stool had gradually disappeared. She was as low-key and calm as usual.","Her exquisite face under the cap was a little careless.","Jiang Zongjin gradually calmed down. He turned around and said to Nie Mi, “No matter what, it’s best if this matter can be resolved successfully. However, I’m worried that the other party will try to take revenge. After all, this is the Independent Continent. I...”","He didn’t say anything else.","Nie Mi also fell silent. “Let’s take a look first.”","* * *","“Brother Xi, Torre has gone out.” In a corner of the hall, a young man lowered his voice and said, “Should we follow him?”","Mo Xi’s gaze lingered on the girl not far away for a long time. He wanted to take a photo, but time didn’t allow it.","“Let’s go. Follow him. Don’t lose him.”","“Okay.”","The two of them chased after Torre.","...","Outside.","The man in the suit didn’t go far. Angry, he stopped in the lobby on the first floor.","He seemed to be on the phone with someone. “I’ve lost all my face today. I have to teach her a lesson! Otherwise, how can our Chamber of Commerce Alliance stand on the Independent Continent in the future? What? No! She’s not from the Independent Continent... She’s from overseas. A country bumpkin.","“I’ll get someone to check her background later and send you the information!”"]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 Ask Master Wang","paragraphs":["1687 Ask Master Wang","Mo Xi pretended to be on the phone in a corner outside the reception room. He frowned and pursed his lips when he heard this. He didn’t expect Torre to be so magnanimous as to want to settle the dispute in the auction house in private.","He wanted to hear more clearly.","Unfortunately, Torre did not stay long.","He strode out as he made the call.","It was not good for Mo Xi and the others to follow them, for fear of being discovered.","Thus, they didn’t hear who the other party was looking for to ‘take care’ of Qiao Nian.","After they left.","The person beside him asked, “Brother Xi, are we going to interfere?”","Mo Xi rubbed his temples and didn’t answer him right away. He seemed to be thinking.","“Didn’t Master Wang ask us to take care of Master Cheng and the others? This matter is related to them. I’m afraid that girl will face retaliation if we don’t do something.”","Mo Xi put his hand down in annoyance. “Let me think about it some more!”","He paused for a second and looked back at the restaurant. Many people had come out, but he didn’t see Master Cheng and the others.","Mo Xi retracted his gaze and lowered his voice. “I’m not saying that I don’t care. It’s just that it’s not easy for us to interfere in this matter!","“Torre will definitely notice us if we make a move. After a while, he will know that we are investigating him behind his back. It was not easy for us to disguise ourselves as outsiders. We will definitely alert the enemy once our identities are exposed! It won’t be so easy to find an opportunity to monitor him then.”","Mo Xi’s fears were not unreasonable.","Once Torre discovered that Bright Gate was investigating him, he would definitely be on high alert and not contact his backer for some time.","Master Wang meant that there were still people behind Torre.","They wanted to investigate the power behind the theft of the Ye family’s goods!","His companion fell silent. He hesitated for a moment, but in the end, he couldn’t bear to remain silent. “If we don’t do anything, what about that girl? The Chamber of Commerce Alliance won’t let her off easily.”","That girl was quite tough at the auction!","She was also Master Cheng’s team member.","In addition, the other party had helped them recover a portion of the goods.","Logically speaking, they couldn’t possibly leave them alone, right?","This was not Bright Gate’s style.","Mo Xi would have made up his mind long ago if he hadn’t been struggling with that.","His resolute face was cold and solemn as he picked up his phone. “I’ll tell Master Wang about the situation and see what he decides.”","* * *","On the other side, in an underground casino on the Independent Continent.","Big men were smoking and playing cards. All of them looked fierce, and they were obviously not people to be trifled with.","At this moment.","In a room in the casino, a scruffy-looking man with dyed blond hair hung up the phone unhappily and cursed. “F*cking people who treat us as dogs! Bah, what is this! If it weren’t for—”","He warily shut his mouth halfway through his sentence.","He threw his phone on the table and said to his subordinates, “It’s time to work.”","“Boss, what is it?”","“Wait a minute.”","The fax machine quickly printed out a document.","The blond man walked over and picked it up impatiently. His expression darkened after he finished reading it.","They really f*cking made them do all the sewer work!","He suppressed his anger and threw the document to his subordinates. “Look, we’ll go to the Paradise Hotel to find this person later. She offended President Torre, and President Torre wants us to teach her a lesson as soon as possible.”"]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 They Still Want Sister Nian to Kneel and Beg For Mercy","paragraphs":["1688 They Still Want Sister Nian to Kneel and Beg For Mercy","His subordinate picked up the fax and looked at it.","He couldn’t help but say, “Boss, isn’t this girl an ordinary person? She’s not from our Independent Continent. If word gets out—”","Before he could finish speaking, an apple hit his head and he fell silent.","The blond man was full of anger as he shouted at them, “I f*cking know that it doesn’t sound good! But they came to us and insisted that we teach this girl a lesson. What can I do? Stop f*cking nagging. What’s the use? Shut up and work.”","!!","Someone picked up the fax again and asked hesitantly, “Boss, how do you plan to teach this Qiao a lesson?”","The blond man really didn’t want to bully the weak, especially women. Although they weren’t good people, they didn’t want to hit women.","“President Torre didn’t say. He only said that he wanted to teach this girl a lesson.”","He frowned. “How about this? We’ll bring her back first, then make her kneel and beg for mercy in front of President Torre. As for what to do with her in the end, it depends on whether President Torre will forgive her.”","His subordinates looked at each other and nodded repeatedly, thinking that this was a good idea.","They had seen the information on the fax.","The other party was not from the Independent Continent. She was just an ordinary first-year student from Country Z. She had just become an adult.","She looked clean and ordinary.","They were too embarrassed to be ruthless.","However, Qiao Nian was unlucky!","She could offend anyone, but she offended the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","The Chamber of Commerce Alliance was famous for being petty. She had only been here for a few days, but she had already stirred up a hornet’s nest!","Hopefully, the Chamber of Commerce Alliance would let her off when she knelt down and admitted her mistake.","* * *","Qiao Nian, who had stirred up a hornet’s nest, was chatting with Nie Mi and the others with her legs crossed.","They didn’t stay for long.","After staying in Qiao Nian’s room for a while, seeing that nothing was wrong, they returned to their rooms in relief.","Qiao Nian sent them off and went about doing her things.","She had just turned on her computer and glanced at the pop-up window that reminded her that the Hacker Alliance’s attack had failed. She closed it with one hand and dragged the stool away with the other. She had yet to sit down...","Knock knock.","There was another knock on the door.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. Her dark eyes were beautiful and bright. The collar of her clothes was slightly open, giving off a casual and unruly feeling. She paused, closed her laptop, and walked over to open the door.","The moment the door was pulled open...","A gentle and refined young man immediately smiled at her. He looked gentle and easy to get along with, and his voice was also pleasant.","“SN, long time no see.”","Qiao Nian raised the corners of her eyes and lazily turned to make way. “Come in.”","Ji Nan smiled and went in.","Qiao Nian closed the door.","“Why did you suddenly come to the Independent Continent?” Ji Nan was actually not very familiar with her, but as netizens, they were quite familiar with each other. At least, they were considered friends.","Actually, he didn’t know much about Qiao Nian, other than that time when he happened to be in Beijing and Qiao Nian invited him to the school advancement banquet.","His understanding of Qiao Nian was still limited to the stock market.","Therefore, this time, Qiao Nian sent him a message saying that she was coming to the Independent Continent. He had been very surprised and thought that he saw it wrong.","It was not until the other party sent him the hotel address and room number that he rushed over."]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 Someone Knocked on the Door Again","paragraphs":["1689 Someone Knocked on the Door Again","After Ji Nan entered the room, he only sized her up like a gentleman.","He realized that the girl didn’t bring much.","He only saw a laptop.","There were also a few sets of clothes by the bedside.","He didn’t even see a suitcase. It was obvious that Qiao Nian hadn’t brought a suitcase with her at all.","“Isn’t this room too small? Do you want me to get someone to change you to a better room?” Ji Nan always gave off a gentle feeling. When he spoke, his eyes were always smiling.","However, in Qiao Nian’s impression, his smile was like a sly fox.","The girl was still dressed in black, but she was not wearing a cap in the room. Her exquisite face was very eye-catching.","“No, thanks.”","Ji Nan raised the corners of his lips. “Don’t tell me you’re not changing rooms because you’re afraid that it’ll be troublesome?”","Qiao Nian also looked at him, her clear eyes seemingly saying, “Why are you thinking so much?”","“My teacher and the others are in the rooms in front. It’s not convenient to change rooms. I’ll stay in this room. It’s fine to live alone.”","Ji Nan touched his ear awkwardly and smiled. “I even said I would be a good host...”","He changed the topic and asked the same question as before. “By the way, why did you come to the Independent Continent this time?”","Actually, even if Qiao Nian hadn’t said anything, Ji Nan had already guessed something.","After all, she had mentioned the word “teacher” just now.","Ji Nan guessed that she had come with the scientific research team from her country.","Hence, after Qiao Nian gave him a simple explanation, he looked as if he had expected this. He turned his head and said, “Then, haven’t you gone out for a walk in the past two days? Do you have any plans for tonight? If you don’t, I’ll take you out for a walk and treat you to a meal.”","Qiao Nian leaned against the table, one hand in her pocket. Her eyes were lowered, and her dark eyelashes hid the emotions in her eyes. She seemed nonchalant. She was about to tell Ji Nan why she had called him over.","Unexpectedly, there was another knock on the door at this moment.","This time, the other party knocked quickly and urgently.","They were here!","Qiao Nian’s eyes turned cold. The corners of her lips curled up into an evil and arrogant smile.","“Who is it?” Ji Nan happened to be closer to the door. Without waiting for Qiao Nian, he rushed over to open it.","The door opened.","There were a few people in hotel uniforms outside. When they saw him, they seemed to be dumbfounded and stood rooted to the ground.","“Hello, may I ask... may I ask if Miss Qiao lives here?”","Ji Nan could tell at a glance that something was wrong with them.","His expression did not change as he blocked the door with one hand and did not move aside. There was a smile on his lips, but his eyes were sharp. “Are you from the hotel?”","They were already drenched in a cold sweat. Their faces were pale, and their eyes were flickering.","“Are you guys from the hotel?” Ji Nan asked again.","The leader, a blond man, stammered. “Ah, right, sorry. We might have the wrong room number.”","“Didn’t you say that you were looking for Miss Qiao?” Ji Nan’s smile deepened at his reaction. He said calmly, “You’re right. This is Qiao Nian’s room. What’s your business?”","They were so frightened that they didn’t even dare to look at him. They had almost the same reaction and shook their heads violently. “I’m sorry, I’m sorry. We found the wrong person. We found the wrong person.”","“Excuse me, we’ll check again.”","After saying that, seemingly afraid that he would continue asking and so frightened that they peed their pants, they ran away without looking back."]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 Who the F*ck Said That Qiao Nian Doesn’t Have a Background!","paragraphs":["1690 Who the F*ck Said That Qiao Nian Doesn’t Have a Background!","“Heh.” Ji Nan watched them run away in a sorry state and sneered. He had no intention of chasing after them.","He closed the door and turned back, then raised his eyebrows and asked the girl, “Did you provoke someone from the Independent Continent?”","Qiao Nian had originally planned to tell him, but she hadn’t expected the other party to arrive so quickly.","She admitted frankly, “Ah, I did provoke one person.”","Ji Nan, on the other hand, was a little overwhelmed by her straightforward admission. He rubbed his forehead and looked at her with a headache. “You’ve only been in the Independent Continent for less than three days and you’ve already provoked someone?","“Forget it. Do you know who you’ve offended?”","Ji Nan added, “I think they got someone from the Radiant Gang to teach you a lesson.”","The Radiant Gang was small in the Independent Continent. They were neither powerful nor small. They didn’t have any rules and were typical hooligans.","There were many such gangs in the Independent Continent.","Ji Nan rarely interacted with these people.","Qiao Nian glanced at him as if she was looking at something. Ji Nan rubbed his face uncomfortably and frowned. He was about to ask her what she was looking at when Qiao Nian retracted her gaze. She pulled out a chair and sat down casually. “I think the person from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance is called...”","Ji Nan’s heart skipped a beat when she mentioned the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","The girl supported her chin with her cold white hand, looking lazy. She thought for a moment and seemed to remember. Then, she turned her head and said to him, “Torre.”","Torre of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance!","Ji Nan’s eyebrows twitched. He looked the girl up and down with reverence and gave her a thumbs up. “Awesome!”","How long had she been in the Independent Continent?","In just three days, she had offended the president of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","He was in awe of Qiao Nian’s ability to offend people.","“How do you plan to solve this?” Although Ji Nan joked, he was still worried about her.","After all, he had been Qiao Nian’s ‘internet friend’ for so many years.","He was more or less an old friend.","He didn’t want anything to happen to her in the Independent Continent.","Qiao Nian glanced at him again, her eyes deep, as if she was thinking about something.","She supported her chin with her hand, and there was a hint of coldness between her eyebrows. The corners of her slightly upturned eyes were restrained.","She said impatiently, “Not sure. If he wants a peaceful solution, then so be it. If he doesn’t want a peaceful solution, then that’s okay too!”","He was only the president of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. It was just inconvenient for her to directly make a move.","The other party was quite daring to look for her.","However, towards Ji Nan, Qiao Nian restrained the coldness in the corners of her eyes, looked up at him seriously, and said, “Thank you for just now.”","She had guessed that Ji Nan was from the Ji family.","Now, it was basically confirmed.","However, she did not want to use his trust to get information about the Ji family. This would be unfair to him.","“I’ll treat you to dinner tonight.” Qiao Nian changed the topic. She sat diagonally and leaned back, playing with her phone with one hand. “Lead the way. It’s my treat.”","Ji Nan was stunned for a moment, but he did not argue with her about who would pay. He said brightly, “Sure, I know a good local restaurant. I’ll take you there later.”","“There’s no need to wait. I’m free, anyway. I’m a little hungry. Let’s go now.” Qiao Nian picked up her phone and stood up.","Ji Nan thought about it and nodded at the girl. “Okay, I’ll get them to reserve a table.”","* * *","Outside Paradise Hotel.","The blond man and his subordinates ran out in fear and finally reached a safe path.","The leader took off his disguise cap and threw it on the ground. “Damn it, who the f*ck said that Qiao Nian doesn’t have a background?”"]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 I Knocked on the Door and Saw Someone From the Ji Family","paragraphs":["1691 I Knocked on the Door and Saw Someone From the Ji Family","Without another word, the blond man took out his phone and made a call.","...","At the same time, at the Chamber of Commerce Alliance Headquarters, at the president’s office.","Torre had just returned to his office and hadn’t even sat down when the phone rang.","!!","He took off his leather gloves, his gaze sharp as he picked up the call. “Hey, how’d it go?”","“I quit!”","Torre frowned. He distanced the receiver from his ear and looked at the phone number that had been dialed in from the internal line. His tone was not good. “What do you—”","The other party spoke before he could finish his question.","“I also want to ask you what you mean. Why? Why do you want us brothers to die?!”","The other party was so angry.","Torre was confused. “...What are you talking about? I don’t understand.”","The other party sneered, seemingly laughing out of anger. He changed his tone and questioned him, “Fine! You don’t understand, right? Let me change it to something you understand. Didn’t you tell me that Qiao Nian doesn’t have a background? Do you know that you almost killed me today?!”","Torre suspected that the other party was deliberately finding fault with him.","Before he could speak, he heard the man’s emotional voice on the other end of the phone. “I followed the information you gave me to the hotel. Do you know who I saw when I knocked on the door?”","“Who?” Torre didn’t think he would see anyone special. He picked up the file on his desk and asked disapprovingly.","“Hmph!” The other party was so angry that he laughed again. Then, he threw out a name. “Someone from the Ji family.","“I knocked on the door and saw someone from the Ji family.”","“Who are you talking about?” Torre had been listening to him distractedly before, but now he put down the document abruptly. His expression was serious, his gaze sharp, shocked, and suspicious.","“I personally saw someone from the Ji Family!”","Torre didn’t believe him.","The other party did not care if he believed him or not. He said indignantly, “You told me that she had no background, so I went straight to her door to look for her. In the end, I saw someone from the Ji family. Fortunately, I ran away quickly. If I had run slower, I might have died there today!”","“Are you mistaken? How does an overseas person know someone from the Ji family?” Torre still didn’t believe it.","“Hehe, did I see wrongly?” The other party sneered, probably not wanting to talk to him anymore. “President Torre, just take it that I saw wrongly!","“In short, I don’t know if that person from the Ji family recognized me. I don’t know what to do next. I hope he’s magnanimous and won’t argue with a small fry like me.","“In addition, because of you, we provoked the Ji family for no reason, so we’ll still take the money!”","The Chamber of Commerce Alliance was a medium-sized faction in the Independent Continent. Torre had never been bullied like this before. He was about to say, “You didn’t even do a good job and you still ask me for money?”","“Whoever wants to do it can do it. I don’t dare to touch this matter again. Also... this is money that our brothers risked their lives for. President Torre, don’t bicker with me.”","“You...”","“That’s it. I’m hanging up!”","A busy tone sounded from the receiver. Torre’s face was ashen as he realized that the other party had hung up on him.","His temples throbbed as he slowly put down the receiver. His gaze darkened as he called in his secretary.","“President, do you have any orders?” The secretary looked down and asked him respectfully.","Torre sat in a leather swivel chair with his hands on the desk. He was dressed in a black suit and had a cold expression on his face. His aura was very strong. “Go and check the background information of the group of people from Country Z.”"]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 Master Wang Discovered That Sister Nian’s in the Independent Continent","paragraphs":["1692 Master Wang Discovered That Sister Nian’s in the Independent Continent","The secretary was about to leave when he stopped him again.","“President?”","Torre’s face twitched. He placed his hand on his brow bone. Although he didn’t believe it, he instructed cautiously, “Especially that girl called Qiao Nian! Get someone to do a good background check on her. See if she has any other backgrounds we don’t know about.”","Based on the information he had, the people from Country Z were all involved in scientific research or education.","Background?","That did not account for much in the Independent Continent.","However, the Radiant Gang insisted that Qiao Nian was related to the Ji family.","The Ji Family...","Torre couldn’t afford to offend such a family.","However, at the same time, he did not believe that a country bumpkin from overseas could be related to the Jis and know someone other than from the side family.","The Radiant Gang people had made it very clear to him over the phone that they saw someone from the Ji family!","The Ji family was very low-key. They were rarely seen at banquets in the Independent Continent. How could one of them be in the room of an overseas girl?","“Check if there’s anything different about her other than studying at Qing University.”","* * *","In a quiet three-story villa on the Independent Continent.","The white decoration was simple and clear. The furniture was stylish. There was also a one-meter-tall blue and white porcelain vase in the closet. It formed a strong visual impact with the black sofa not far away.","“Master Wang.” Mo Dong had just returned from a call outside. Seeing the young man who hadn’t slept all night and was about to go upstairs to rest, he looked up and reported to him, “Mo Xi just called and told me that Master Cheng’s men offended Torre. Torre seems to have found someone to take revenge.”","Gu San had not rested for a day and night. He had been dozing off just now, so he went to the kitchen to make a pot of tea.","But he came out as soon as he heard Mo Dong’s words.","“Someone from Master Cheng’s team?”","“Yes.” Mo Dong saw that he was holding a cup of tea and took it without hesitation. Gulping it down, he felt much more comfortable. Then, his brows relaxed and he said unhurriedly, “I heard that the person took out a billion yuan to snatch the goods that Torre wanted to buy from the auction. Mo Xi didn’t say the specifics over the phone. I think that’s what he meant.”","Gu San was a generous person and did not mind that he snatched his cup of tea. He turned around and placed the rest of the tea on the table. Then, he was stunned and looked at him in surprise. “There’s such a generous person in Master Cheng’s team?”","Mo Dong walked over and poured himself another cup of tea. This time, he didn’t gulp it down. He took a small sip and looked at Ye Wuchuan, who was walking up the stairs. “That’s what Mo Xi told me.”","At first, his eyes were filled with the hostility of someone who had not slept well. He did not really want to deal with these trivial matters. He wanted Mo Dong and the others to deal with it themselves.","But he frowned slightly and ignored them when Mo Dong said something about taking out a billion guns. He took out his phone, lowered his eyes, and sent a message.","He didn’t have to wait long before a message came back.","He looked down.","[QN: No.]","It was a simple word.","Qiao Nian was too lazy to even type a word more.","His thin lips curled up when he saw her concise WeChat message. He seemed to have seen the girl’s lazy expression when she replied to his message.","However, his smile froze for a moment. His sharp gaze moved up again as he reread the message he had sent.","[Are you in Rao City?]","Below was Qiao Nian’s reply a minute ago: [No.]","The answer was obvious."]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 I Changed My Mind!","paragraphs":["1693 I Changed My Mind!","His fingers holding the phone were slender and beautiful. He paused for a moment and replied: [Y: Be careful outside.]","After the message was sent, he put his phone into the pocket of his windbreaker and turned back. His entire body was filled with hostility, and it was obvious that he was not to be trifled with.","“M-Master Wang?” When Mo Dong saw that he had suddenly returned, he put down the teacup in his hand in a daze and asked him, “Aren’t you going up to catch up on your sleep?”","Ye Wangchuan walked straight to the sofa and found a comfortable place to sit down. Then, he poured out a cigarette and bit it between his lips. He asked lazily, “Where’s Torre?”","Mo Dong had yet to react when Gu San scratched the back of his head in a daze. “The Chamber of Commerce Alliance, right?”","Torre was the president of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. When he had nothing to do, he would definitely stay in the headquarters and not go anywhere else.","“Catch him.” He touched the lighter, and a cluster of orchid fire lit up. He lowered his head and lit the cigarette. His handsome face was quite dispirited at the moment, but it was a bloody and fierce look.","His entire body exuded a vicious aura.","At first, Mo Dong was stunned and speechless.","Then, he came back to his senses and hurriedly said, “Master Wang, didn’t you say at the beginning that we wouldn’t alert the enemy and would first investigate the person behind him before closing the net? Why did you suddenly...”","His answer was flat. “I’ve changed my mind.”","Mo Dong was confused.","How could Master Wang change his mind about such a big matter? There was no sign before he suddenly changed his mind.","After saying that lazily, Ye Wangchuan ignored him and turned to Gu San. “Which hotel is Master Cheng staying at?”","Gu San’s reaction was slower than Mo Dong’s. He thought about it habitually. “Paradise Hotel, right?”","Ye Wangchuan picked up his phone and looked at the time. “I’ll go over later.”","Gu San nodded dumbly.","Mo Dong’s eyelids twitched. He had a stomach full of questions.","For example, didn’t Master Wang plan to interrogate Torre?","They would be capturing the president of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance in the open. The other forces in the Independent Continent would definitely notice them.","At this juncture, why did Master Wang care about Torre going to the Paradise Hotel?","After Gu San finished speaking, he came back to his senses and wanted to look for his phone. “I’ll call Master Cheng and ask if they’re at the hotel.”","Ye Wangchuan stopped him. “No, I’m not looking for Master Cheng.”","Gu San looked at him in confusion.","What do you mean?","He finally asked a more crucial question, “Master Wang, why aren’t you going to look for Master Cheng and the others? Then, why are you going to the hotel?”","Mo Dong actually wanted to know this question too. He immediately watched the man’s every move, as if he wanted to get an answer.","Under their unblinking gazes, Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and looked at the endless sunset in the distance. He stubbed out the cigarette and threw it into the ashtray. Seemingly in a good mood, he said softly, “Qiao Nian is there.”","Mo Dong was dumbfounded.","Gu San was the first to react. He looked happy. “Miss Qiao is in the Independent Continent?”","In his excitement, he paced around and then stopped. “That’s not right. Miss Qiao didn’t even tell us that she came to the Independent Continent.”","Ye Wangchuan chuckled and leaned back. He looked at him lazily and asked, “Have you asked her?”","Gu San said without thinking, “No!”","“That’s right.” His eyes were dark and thick. “You didn’t ask her, so why would she tell you? You didn’t tell her that you were going to the Independent Continent, either.”"]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 The Chamber of Commerce Alliance Is Over","paragraphs":["1694 The Chamber of Commerce Alliance Is Over","“It’s because the Independent Continent is too dangerous...” Gu San stopped mid-sentence and immediately understood.","Both sides were thinking of the same thing!","Master Wang and Miss Qiao both thought that the other party would be worried if they said they were going to the Independent Continent, so they did not say anything.","He thought about it and said happily, “I knew it. How could there be such a generous person on Master Cheng’s team... At that time, I wanted to say that that person’s style of doing things was very similar to Miss Qiao’s, but I didn’t say anything. I didn’t expect it to be her.”","!!","Gu San realized something as he finished speaking.","“In other words, the person who spent a billion yuan to snatch the goods is Miss Qiao?” He was in an extremely good mood and muttered to himself, “Master Wang, I’m going to the Paradise Hotel with you later. I want to see Miss Qiao, too. I wonder if she had dinner. If not, I’ll take her to a delicious Chinese restaurant.”","There were people from all over the world in the Independent Continent.","Therefore, restaurants in the Independent Continent were the same. There were dishes from all countries. Country Z’s cuisine was rich and delicious, and it was equally popular in the Independent Continent.","Gu San was talking about a restaurant that specialized in Country Z’s cuisine.","“We’ll talk about it when the time comes.” Ye Wangchuan ignored him and went upstairs to change his clothes and wash his face.","Mo Dong looked at their happy faces and frowned. He didn’t show his dissatisfaction, but he was more or less dissatisfied.","It was that girlfriend who disrupted their plan again!","He didn’t need to use his toes to understand that Master Wang’s sudden change of heart to quickly deal with Torre must have something to do with this Miss Qiao.","Master Wang was worried that the other party would secretly attack her, so he would destroy their nest first!","It was just a woman. He spoiled her too much!","Mo Dong took a deep breath.","He still did not approve of this method of handling things.","They had already thought of a step-by-step plan to infiltrate the enemy’s ranks. Qiao Nian’s appearance had more or less disrupted their plans.","Now, it seemed that they had to plan again.","But Torre...","Since Master Wang had given the order, they definitely had to capture him!","He was unlucky. Of all people, he had to touch Master Wang’s precious girlfriend.","* * *","“SN, how long do you plan to stay in the Independent Continent?” Ji Nan put a piece of duck meat into the girl’s bowl and looked up to ask her with a smile.","She didn’t like sweets.","The restaurant that Ji Nan had brought her to had just the right amount of sweetness.","Qiao Nian didn’t eat much. Basically, after touching each dish, she put down her knife and fork and sat there playing with her phone.","Coincidentally, her phone reminded her that someone was checking her information again.","The corners of her lips curled up into an evil smile. She multitasked as she typed in code. She took the time to answer him, “I’m just investigating something. I’ll go back after I investigate that matter. It shouldn’t take more than a few days.”","She did not expect to find out everything at once.","Her motive for coming to the Independent Continent with Nie Mi and the others was very clear—to check if her mother was a member of the Ji family!","She only wanted to figure this out. As for the twists and turns involving family secrets, it was impossible for a big family like the Jis to be investigated fully in a day or two.","She couldn’t stay in the Independent Continent for that long.","She could only investigate the most basic situation first.","Ji Nan was still trying to figure out what she was talking about.","Qiao Nian lifted her eyelids and looked at him with her dark eyes. “Are you full? If you are, I’ll go pay the bill.”","Then, she explained softly, “I have something on. I have to go back to the hotel.”"]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 Mom, We’re Just Friends!","paragraphs":["1695 Mom, We’re Just Friends!","Ji Nan picked up the jacket on the back of the chair and said gentlemanly, “I’ll send you back.”","Qiao Nian’s phone kept vibrating at a small frequency. She wanted to go back and talk about it, but she was annoyed by the vibrating phone. A thick layer of surliness appeared under her eyes. She picked up her phone with one hand and started typing again.","Ji Nan saw how quickly she wrote the text message.","Seeing that Qiao Nian was busy, he considerately didn’t rush her. With the coat draped over his arm, he stood there patiently, waiting for her to finish writing her message.","Five minutes later, the girl finally ‘replied’. She picked up her cap, pulled out the chair, and stood up. “I’ll go pay the bill.”","Seeing that she was done with her work, Ji Nan called out to her, “SN, the security in the Independent Continent is not better than in Jing City. It’s not safe for you to go back alone. Let me send you back.”","“There’s no need.” Qiao Nian put on her cap and refused.","However, Ji Nan was exceptionally persistent. He restrained his smile and said with a serious expression, “I’m telling you the truth. The Independent Continent is not safe. I’m worried about you going back alone. Let me send you back.”","Qiao Nian twirled her cap around her wrist. She hadn’t put it on yet. Hearing his words, she fell silent, raised her eyelids, and finally took a step back. “Alright.”","Ji Nan watched her as she went to pay the bill.","His phone on the table rang at this moment.","Ji Nan walked over and picked it up. He lowered his eyes to take a look and dropped his smile. He picked up the call. “Hello, Mom.”","He looked up in Qiao Nian’s direction and only saw the girl’s tall and arrogant back. Ji Nan retracted his gaze and said, “I’m eating outside with a friend.”","“A female friend?” Ji Nan rubbed his temples. “No, you don’t know her. She’s an online friend of mine. I’ve known her for a few years. I’ve never met her before, but we’re very close. She’s no different from a friend in real life.”","The other end of the phone said something, but he quickly denied it. “No, we’re not in the relationship you think we are. She went to the bar to counter the bill. Forget about the photo.”","No matter what, he had only met Qiao Nian twice in reality. Previously, they had only communicated online.","Ji Nan had an indescribable feeling and a natural liking for Qiao Nian.","However, he was very clear.","He knew very well that his love for Qiao Nian was not the kind of love a man would have for a woman. He saw her as his younger sister.","He would want to protect Qiao Nian every time he saw her.","However, from a certain perspective, Ji Nan still did not know why he felt this way.","From what he knew, SN was unfathomable.","SN herself didn’t look to have the same kind of soft and cute personality as his little sister at home gave him.","In any case, none of the little sisters from the Ji family’s side branches fought for the bill when eating with him.","“... Hmm? A banquet? I don’t know if she’s free.","“She came with her teachers. She has some private matters to attend to here. She should be leaving in a few days.”","Ji Nan saw the girl walking back. He lowered his voice and said to the person on the other end of the phone in a helpless tone, “Mom, I’m not talking to you anymore. I’m hanging up.”","Coincidentally, Qiao Nian saw him putting down his phone.","Ji Nan picked up his coat again and said to the girl gently, “Let’s go back.”","“Mm.” Qiao Nian didn’t mind and followed him."]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 Sister Nian: No, I Don’t Like Taking Photos","paragraphs":["1696 Sister Nian: No, I Don’t Like Taking Photos","Halfway there, Ji Nan thought of something and stopped to ask her, “By the way, SN, do you have a photo on your phone?”","Qiao Nian was dumbfounded.","What?","Photo?","Ji Nan smiled and explained gently, “Do you have your photo on your phone? I want to introduce you to my mother. She’s a good person. I’ll take you to meet her if you’re free.”","The wife of the Ji family’s head in the Independent Continent came from a prestigious family. Xie Yun was not someone that everyone could meet in the Independent Continent.","Ji Nan also remembered that this was Qiao Nian’s first time in the Independent Continent. Even if he didn’t have any intention of being in a relationship with her, it wouldn’t be bad to introduce her to more people.","It would be more convenient for her to work in the Independent Continent later if she caught his mother’s eye.","At the very least, small characters like the Radiant Gang wouldn’t dare to harass her again.","“I don’t mean anything else. I mean, just treat it as getting to know an elder.” Ji Nan was afraid that she would misunderstand him, so he explained further.","Qiao Nian immediately figured out why he wanted to do this. However, she hadn’t investigated her mother’s relationship with the Ji family yet, so it wasn’t convenient for her to have too much contact with them for now.","“I don’t usually take photos. Sorry.”","Ji Nan looked at her deeply. He couldn’t tell if she didn’t take photos or didn’t want to see his mother, but he just smiled. “It’s fine if you don’t have any. I just thought of asking you.”","As he spoke, he continued walking.","Qiao Nian pressed down on her cap and pursed her lips slightly. Catching up with him, she said in a low voice, “I’ll finish what I’m doing first. I’ll visit Auntie if I have time.”","Ji Nan suddenly felt that he had thought too much just now. His handsome face was filled with guilt, but he still smiled. “Okay, let’s see your schedule.”","He thought for a moment and said, “You can visit her if you have time. Forget it if you don’t. Anyway, there will be opportunities in the future. This isn’t the only chance.”","“Yes.” Qiao Nian didn’t say anything else. She nodded as if agreeing with him as they walked out of the restaurant.","* * *","Chamber of Commerce Alliance Headquarters.","Torre was working on a file when the computer flashed and the screen went black.","He was almost done. This sudden computer malfunction had wasted all his previous efforts.","Unable to suppress his anger, he picked up the phone and was about to make an internal call to ask what was going on.","However, he realized that the computer was not the only thing malfunctioning.","He couldn’t even use the internal phone in his office!","Torre stood up abruptly and pushed away from the leather swivel chair. He grabbed his phone and prepared to go out and take a look.","However, someone knocked on the door at this moment.","“Come in.”","The secretary rushed in with a flustered expression. “President, all the networks of our Chamber of Commerce Alliance are down.”","“Huh?”","“We seem to have been attacked by a hacker! The network, circuits, and security facilities of the headquarters have all been cut off from the main computer console. The main computer has also been infected with a virus and crashed. The entire Alliance has fallen to a standstill. Everyone is in a mess and asking what’s going on. Other than the elevator and backup electricity, we can’t use anything else.”","Torre listened for a long time before he finally got the gist of what he was saying. “You said we were hacked?”","“I think so.” The secretary lowered his head, not daring to speak loudly.","“Heh!” Torre was so angry that he almost laughed at this series of events. “We asked the Hacker Alliance for the system, and they still found someone to attack our network? Are they crazy? Or are their brains damaged?!”"]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 The Computer Was Hacked and the Power Was Cut Off","paragraphs":["1697 The Computer Was Hacked and the Power Was Cut Off","“This...” The secretary did not dare to say anything. “I don’t know either, but we were indeed attacked by a top hacker. Now, all the networks in the alliance are shut down.”","Torre kicked the trash can and scowled. “I’ll call the Hacker’s Alliance right away.”","He wanted to ask the other party for an answer.","One call was answered by the boss of the Hacker Alliance.","!!","The Hacker Alliance’s influence in the Independent Continent was no less than the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. Although Torre was so angry that his head was about to explode, he still suppressed his anger and tried his best to be as calm as possible. “KZ, did your Hacker Alliance hack the network and power supply of our Chamber of Commerce headquarters?”","The people from the Hacker Alliance were trying to find out if the big shot who hacked into their computers was the legendary Sun.","After being questioned by him, he immediately returned the question unhappily. “What does President Torre mean? Your Chamber of Commerce Alliance’s computer has been hacked, and you’re looking for me? Why? Does our Hacker Alliance care if your internet power is plugged in? Are you looking for the wrong person!”","Torre’s anger eased when figured out that the other person’s tone was off, and his own tone softened. “It was not you?”","The leader of the Hacker Alliance laughed. “Our people are all here. Who would touch your computer for no reason? Do we have nothing to do?”","Torre’s anger quickly subsided as he realized that he had found the wrong person.","Due to the other party’s identity, he was a little embarrassed and explained, “I’m sorry, it’s like this. A minute ago, our computers suddenly collapsed and the power was cut off by someone through the main computer. This kind of thing was obviously done by a hacker. I thought it was done by some ignorant hacker on your side, but who knew that there was a mistake...”","“He’s not one of us.” The boss of the Hacker Alliance did not accept his explanation, but he did not fall out with him. He only said coldly, “You don’t even know who you’ve offended.”","“What kind of person is stronger than the Hacker’s Alliance in this aspect...?” Torre himself only asked in return.","Unexpectedly, the other party was very rude. “How would I know! Recently, there might be someone in the Independent Continent who’s better than our Hacker Alliance.”","Better than the Hacker Alliance?","Torre froze.","He didn’t have time to ask before the other party hung up unhappily.","He held the phone for a long time and rubbed his temples. “They’re not from the Hacker Alliance. They said they didn’t do it.”","The secretary had been listening to him on his call.","Although he couldn’t hear what the other party was saying, he could hear what Torre was saying to them.","He had already guessed it and was at a loss. “President, what should we do now?”","Torre rested his chin on his hand and remained silent.","He didn’t know what to do.","It wasn’t the Hacker Alliance.","But they were clearly hacked.","Who in the Independent Continent other than the Hacker Alliance would have the ability to shut down their network?","“Have you found the information I asked you to look up?” Torre asked suddenly.","“It’s that Qiao Nian. Have you found out about her? Does she have another identity, such as...”","Torre himself thought he was overthinking things. “Like being particularly computer-savvy.”","“President, are you saying that Qiao Nian is the one who hacked us?” The secretary understood what he meant and looked incredulous. “No, I just found someone to investigate her. Before I could get a response, the computer went black.”"]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 President, The People From Bright Gate Barged In","paragraphs":["1698 President, The People From Bright Gate Barged In","Torre felt that it was too much of a coincidence!","However, at this moment, he was still unwilling to think in this direction. He waved his hand and said, “I understand.”","The secretary was about to leave when Torre stopped him again. “Find a few more people to investigate her later. Investigate her properly! It’s best if you can even investigate her growth in Country Z. I want to get all the information on her as soon as possible.”","“I got it.”","!!","The secretary nodded and was about to leave.","Suddenly, another bodyguard barged in with an ugly expression and said to them anxiously, “President, bad news. Someone from Bright Gate has barged in!”","“What did you say?”","Torre only felt that today was too fantastical. He even suspected that his ears were playing tricks on him. “Bright Gate?!”","Bright Gate was a very special existence in the Independent Continent.","They didn’t belong to any of the three great clans. They were mysterious and solitary, but they were much stronger than mid-level forces like them.","Many people in the Independent Continent privately said that if Bright Gate was given another ten years, they might leap to become one of the top factions in the Independent Continent.","Torre’s mind was a mess. He couldn’t understand the situation at all.","They had no enmity with Bright Gate. Why would they come looking for them?","What were they all up to!","“Security—”","Torre had only said a word when the bodyguard responded. His expression was ugly, and his eyes revealed despair. “President, you forgot that our Internet system is paralyzed. The people from Bright Gate are barging in. We can’t even close the door outside.”","There were disputes every day in the Independent Continent. High-tech defensive doors were installed in places like the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. These doors could not be opened without weapons.","But today was a special day.","The Chamber of Commerce Alliance’s Headquarters’ main computer was hacked.","The so-called high-tech defense system also required computer control, so at least at this moment, these awesome defense systems were useless!","Torre’s expression changed.","* * *","Outside Paradise Hotel.","A military-green SUV parked quietly on the road.","A man sat in the driver’s seat. He rolled down the window and placed his hand on the side. His gorgeous face had a lazy expression as he looked at the hotel entrance from afar.","People went in and out.","None of them seemed to be the person he was waiting for.","“Master Wang, Mo Dong and the others have Torre under control.” Gu San lowered his voice and spoke.","Ye Wangchuan took out chewing gum from the side. Before he tore open the wrapping paper, he raised his eyebrows and asked in a low and hoarse voice, “Already?”","Mo Dong moved a full two hours faster than he had expected.","Ye Wangchuan glanced in his direction. His eyes were deep, and he almost immediately saw through the situation. “Did something happen to the Chamber of Commerce Alliance?”","“How did you know?!” Stunned, Gu San immediately reported to him, “Yes, Mo Dong and the others said that the Chamber of Commerce Alliance’s network happened to be down at that time, and the internal power was cut off. They almost didn’t spend any effort to go in and find Torre.”","He smacked his lips and sighed. “Tsk, they’re so lucky this time.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at him and clicked his tongue lazily. This was the first time he realized that ‘simple people are happier’. For example, Gu San immediately thought that this ‘accident’ was their good luck.","“As long as you’re happy.”","Gu San suddenly sat up straight at this moment.","“Master Wang, I see Miss Qiao.”"]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 I’ll Go Over and Take a Look. Wait for Me Here","paragraphs":["1699 I’ll Go Over and Take a Look. Wait for Me Here","Qiao Nian had just gotten out of a black Buick.","She was still dressed in the style. Her sweater and cap were pulled tightly, and her legs were wrapped in black pants. They were straight and well-proportioned.","Her personal style was very outstanding.","Gu San could recognize Qiao Nian at a glance.","After Qiao Nian got out of the car, she didn’t enter the hotel immediately. Instead, she stood beside the car as if talking to someone. Gu San was stunned.","Soon, he knew who Qiao Nian was talking to.","Ji Nan got out of the car from the other side and walked up to the girl. He then said to call him if she was in trouble.","“Uh, who’s the person beside Miss Qiao?” Gu San was dumbfounded. His eyes widened as he asked.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were dark as he reached out to unbuckle his seatbelt. He didn’t look angry. “I’ll go over and take a look. Stay in the car and wait for me.”","“M-Master Wang?!” Gu San was shocked. He instinctively thought that he was angry.","Gu San was anxious as he watched him get out of the car. He wanted to get out of the car to inform Qiao Nian, but he couldn’t go against Master Wang’s wishes. An idea flashed through his mind. He quickly found his phone and dialed Qiao Nian’s number.","“Answer the phone, Miss Qiao.” Gu San had been staring at the girl who was talking to someone at the entrance of the hotel. His face was filled with nervousness, and he was still nagging. “Answer the phone, Miss Qiao. Hurry up and answer the phone...”","* * *","“I won’t send you up.” Ji Nan’s refined and handsome face was quite serious as he talked to the girl. “You can call me if you encounter any trouble in the next few days. My phone is turned on 24 hours a day. Call me anytime.”","This was not an ordinary promise. One had to know that he was Ji Nan!","He was from the Ji Family of the Independent Continent.","Qiao Nian nodded and was about to wave goodbye when her phone suddenly rang.","Ji Nan frowned. Thinking that the Radiant Gang was looking for her again, he stood rooted to the ground and said to the girl gently, “SN, look at who’s calling.”","Annoying!","Qiao Nian’s head hurt from the ringing of her phone. She took out her phone and looked down to see the caller ID.","Surprised, she frowned slightly, as if a little confused.","Seeing that her reaction was off, Ji Nan asked her softly, “Who is calling? It’s so urgent.”","“A friend.” Qiao Nian didn’t answer the call immediately. Instead, she hung up Gu San’s call and put her phone back into her pocket, intending to return the call in her hotel room. She looked up, her dark eyes bright. She was about to say goodbye when, unexpectedly, Ji Nan looked behind her, smiled, and said, “SN, your friend is here.”","“Huh?”","Qiao Nian looked at him standing there leisurely with his hands in his pockets as if there was really someone behind her.","Who was it?","She turned her head in confusion. She had thought that she would see Nie Mi or Principal Liang.","Unexpectedly, she saw a tall figure.","He was wearing a long windbreaker, which made him look strong and thin. He was walking towards them, and the prayer beads on his wrist looked even redder against his fair skin.","Ye Wangchuan?","Qiao Nian’s eyelids twitched. She instantly understood why Gu San had been calling her crazily. He had even called again after she hung up.","Her phone stopped vibrating almost as soon as the man reached her. It was as quiet as a chicken now."]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 Hello, I’m Qiao Nian’s Boyfriend","paragraphs":["1700 Hello, I’m Qiao Nian’s Boyfriend","Tsk!","Qiao Nian understood. She looked up and asked, not too surprised, “Why are you here?”","Ye Wangchuan had a good temper. He looked lazy and noble as he lowered his head to talk to her. “I sent you a WeChat message. You probably didn’t see it.”","Qiao Nian was speechless again.","!!","She slowly picked up her phone and opened WeChat. She looked down and saw that there was indeed a new message from an hour ago.","[Y: I’m going to look for you now.]","Qiao Nian was speechless again.","With the evidence in front of her, Qiao Nian was instantly speechless. She put away her phone and coughed guiltily to hide her embarrassment. “Um, I didn’t notice.”","Ye Wangchuan helped her adjust her cap. He had no intention of complaining as he slowly lowered his hand and said concisely, “I know, that’s why I didn’t go in to look for you. I’ve been waiting outside for you to come back.”","Ji Nan smiled. He couldn’t help but interrupt when he saw their intimate interaction, “S...”","He quickly changed his words and looked at the girl. “Nian Nian, this is...? Aren’t you going to introduce him?”","He and Qiao Nian were both outstanding people.","However, Ji Nan’s appearance was the same as Qiao Nian’s. He was an exquisite type. Compared to Ye Wangchuan, he was not as sharp.","He was more reserved.","In addition, Ji Nan smiled at everyone and didn’t show his emotions easily. His temperament was more gentle, and he didn’t have Qiao Nian’s strong personal style.","Therefore, his aura was more or less suppressed by Ye Wangchuan’s more powerful aura as they stood side by side.","However, Ji Nan was Ji Nan, after all. Even though he was standing with Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian, he was not suppressed much. He wasn’t ignored, either. He still had a presence.","At this moment, he suddenly asked Qiao Nian a question. His scrutinizing gaze was still on the young man. It wasn’t very sharp, but he was definitely not the friendly type.","“Ah, he’s...” Qiao Nian’s attention was pulled back by Ji Nan. She opened her mouth, thinking about how to introduce Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan smiled and walked over. He was the first to extend his hand in a friendly manner, and his tone was polite. “Hello, I’m Ye Wangchuan.”","Ye Wangchuan?","Ji Nan’s smile did not change, but he was not as calm as he appeared on the surface.","He had been to Country Z before, so he had naturally heard of this name.","However, he had never had the chance to meet him.","Ji Nan did not expect him to meet the other party under such circumstances. He did not extend his hand immediately.","However, Ye Wangchuan didn’t show any signs of anger. His left hand was still in midair, and his expression was lazy and casual. He smiled again and said lightly, “Qiao Nian’s boyfriend.”","Ji Nan was stunned. He instinctively glanced in the girl’s direction. His eyes seemed to be asking for confirmation.","Qiao Nian was a little irritated by Ji Nan’s questioning gaze, but she didn’t hesitate. She nodded at him, tacitly agreeing.","Ji Nan was speechless.","Ye Wangchuan had already introduced himself, and he was Qiao Nian’s partner.","Even if Ji Nan still had doubts about him, he could not act unfriendly anymore. Hence, he shook the man’s hand. He was refined and handsome. “Hello, I’m Ji Nan. I’m Nian Nian’s... friend.”","In the end, Ji Nan felt a little upset at his self-introduction, as if he had lost."]}]);
